            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficiency in one or more general purpose programming languages",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of software skills such as business analysis, development, maintenance and software improvement",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Corporate Technology",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Corporate Technology (CT) organization develops applications and provides technology support for corporate functions across JPMorgan Chase, including Global Finance, Corporate Treasury, Risk Management, Human Resources, Compliance, Legal, and all functions within the Corporate Administrative Office (CAO).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "CT teams are aligned with corporate partners' evolving technology needs and the firm's ever expanding technology controls agenda.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A top CT priority is purpose-building scalable corporate systems. Teams focus is on:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responding to the evolving regulatory environment and helping to meet the firm's regulatory commitments by addressing internal and external commitments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Advancing the firm's Roadmap programs -- Single Sourcing of data, Architecture Convergence, and Rationalization of Application Portfolio and Platforms",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Adopting industry leading technologies to support best-in-class business capabilities for high performance computing and data storage solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Driving innovation across the firm's corporate technology portfolio, increasing efficiencies through process automation and Agile application development, with an emphasis on user experience and shorter development cycles",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Investing in security & controls for cyber, access/entitlements uplift, data protection and application resiliency",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Controls & Operational Risk Technology supports - identification, assessment, and prioritization of risks followed by coordinated application of resources to minimize, monitor, and control the probability and/or impact of events.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tech at JPMC:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "When you work at JPMorgan Chase & Co., you're not just working at a global financial institution. You're an integral part of one of the world's biggest tech companies. In 14 technology hubs worldwide, our team of 40,000+ technologists design, build and deploy everything from enterprise technology initiatives to big data and mobile solutions, as well as innovations in electronic payments, cybersecurity, machine learning, and cloud development. Our $9.5B+ annual investment in technology enables us to hire people to create innovative solutions that will not only transform the financial services industry, but also change the world.",
