          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Western National is seeking a highly collaborative and influential front-end developer to join our team in developing exceptional experiences. This exceptional opportunity offers someone a chance to contribute to a highly impactful organizational initiative that will transform how our customers interact with our company.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The ideal candidate has 5+ years of Software Development experience with strong experience in modern Javascript (ES6+) and Node. The candidate would ideally have experience with Vue or similar web frameworks, and there is a high preference for Java experience. Come join our team for opportunities to grow your skills and be a part of something truly transformative.",
