            "utterance": "About Naehas",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join a pre-IPO, fast-paced, rapidly growing software as a service company based in Silicon Valley. Naehas is a marketing offer and content orchestration platform that supports some of the largest consumer brands in the world. Our customers include four of the top six banks and market leaders in media, communication and insurance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re expanding our office in the Gurugram area (India) and would like to fill it with team members who value autonomy, collaboration and meaningful work. Our recipe for success is very simple - “Passionate and happy employees translate into happy customers and a world-class product”.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the Position",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are seeking to hire a passionate Software Engineer to build features for our flagship naehas’ Platform.",
