            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Novartis Business Services IT (NBS IT) is working to support Novartis to deliver better patient outcomes through innovative use of information and technology. As technology is reshaping the healthcare industry, IT will be a differentiator for our businesses, inspiring new ideas and enabling Novartis to reimagine medicine.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To continue to add even greater value for the business we need to have the right people with the right capabilities.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We need to be customer-oriented and focus on bringing the best services and solutions to the business – both globally and locally – to support our patients.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "NBS IT offers this extraordinary work experience with a real opportunity to develop in a highly fast-paced technology-driven environment where collaboration and innovation are at the heart of who we are and what we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Science, innovation & technology are central to the Novartis mission of caring & curing patients. We have a clear understanding and deep commitment that IT will be a critical factor in our future success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Collaborate in multi-functional teams to evaluate business activities, and then develop innovative and effective approaches to seek team’s analytics problems and communicate results and methodologies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Ability to initiate and drive projects from conception to completion with minimal direction.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Innovates and recommends sophisticated predictive analytics, computational science, Natural Language Processing (NLP), machine learning and deep learning techniques to answer research questions and synthesize insights that achieve business objectives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Establishes scalable, efficient, automated solutions for large scale data analyses, model development, model validation and model implementation. Works to translate prototypes into new products, services, and features and provide guidelines for large-scale implementation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Ability to build and fine tune algorithms that scale up from small-scale proof-of-concept stage to full production systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Build knowledge artifacts of business problems that were solved with sophisticated analytics techniques which can be published in journals. Excellent quantitative skills and the ability to tell a story using data",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum requirements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•PhD. or Masters from top University in Statistics, Operational Research, Computer Science or in a quantitative field.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•SQL, Python, R, Scala, Tensor Flow, Pytorch are Mandatory Qlikview/Tableau/Spotfire but not limited to these are good to have",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•2+ years after PHD or 5+ years after Masters",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•In predictive modeling and large data analysis",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•In data querying languages (e.g. SQL), scripting languages (e.g. Python, R, Scala), or deep learning libraries (e.g. tensorflow, pytorch).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Expertise in at-least some visualization tools such as Qlikview, Spotfire, Tableau (but not limited to these) for designing insights is good to have",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why consider Novartis?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "799 million. That’s how many lives our products touch. And while we’re proud of that fact, in this world of digital and technological transformation, we must also ask ourselves this: how can we continue to improve and extend even more people’s lives?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We believe the answers are found when curious, courageous and collaborative people like you are brought together in an inspiring environment. Where you’re given opportunities to explore the power of digital and data. Where you’re empowered to risk failure by taking smart risks, and where you’re surrounded by people who share your determination to tackle the world’s toughest medical challenges.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Imagine what you could do at Novartis!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
