            "utterance": "Software Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Vista Equity Partners is the world's leading private equity firm for Enterprise Software and recently invested $1.5B in the Reliance Jio Digital Platform. As part of the Vista portfolio, Integral Ad Science (IAS) is a NYC-headquartered global technology and data company that builds verification, optimization, and analytics solutions for the advertising industry. We are looking for a Java Software Engineer to join our new and fast-growing R&D team in Pune. If you are excited by technology that has the power to handle hundreds of thousands of transactions per second; collect tens of billions of events each day; and evaluate thousands of data-points in real-time all while responding in just a few milliseconds, then IAS is the place for you!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Software Engineer you will build and expand upon the IAS reporting framework and UI for IAS' analytics and reporting software products. You will integrate reports and dashboards into the IAS UI platform and implement critical features in our custom report builder tool using state of the art technologies and tools.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The ideal candidate has a passion for data analytics and back-end development.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you'll do:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and develop critical features in our microservice technology stack",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Integrate with 3rd party APIs and services",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and develop back end Java services and components in our world class custom report builder",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Participate in agile meetings and daily stand ups",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work closely with Product teams and other cross-functional teams",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You should apply if you have most of this experience:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "3-5+ years of recent experience with back end software development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with Java, Groovy, and SQL",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with persistence APIs such as Hibernate",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong understanding of REST and microservice architectures and systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with build tools such as Gradle and Maven",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A strong passion for Test Driven Development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience or understanding of AWS services such as EC2, S3, Lamba, and SQS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of full software development life cycle, agile development and continuous integration",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Integral Ad Science",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Integral Ad Science (IAS) is the global market leader in digital ad verification, offering technologies that drive high-quality advertising media. IAS equips advertisers and publishers with both the insight and technology to protect their advertising investments from fraud and unsafe environments as well as to capture consumer attention, and drive business outcomes. Founded in 2009, IAS is headquartered in New York with global operations in 18 offices across 13 countries. IAS is part of the Vista Equity Partners portfolio of software companies. For more on how IAS is powering great impressions for top publishers and advertisers around the world, visit integralads.com.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Equal Opportunity Employer:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IAS is an equal opportunity employer, committed to our diversity and inclusiveness. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age. We strongly encourage women, people of color, members of the LGBTQIA community, people with disabilities and veterans to apply.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "California Applicant Pre-Collection Notice:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We collect personal information (PI) from you in connection with your application for employment or engagement with IAS, including the following categories of PI: identifiers, personal records, commercial information, professional or employment or engagement information, non-public education records, and inferences drawn from your PI. We collect your PI for our purposes, including performing services and operations related to your potential employment or engagement. For additional details or if you have questions, contact us at compliance@integralads.com.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To learn more about us, please visit http://integralads.com/ and https://muse.cm/2t8eGlN",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
