          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Siemens founded the new business unit Siemens Advanta (formerly known as Siemens IoT Services) on April 1, 2019 with its headquarter in Munich, Germany. It has been crafted to unlock the digital future of its clients by offering end-to-end support on their outstanding digitalization journey. Siemens Advanta is a strategic advisor and a trusted implementation partner in digital transformation and industrial IoT with a global network of more than 8000 employees in 10 countries and 21 offices. Highly skilled and experienced specialists offer services which range from consulting to craft & prototyping to solution & implementation and operation – everything out of one hand!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Before our software developers write even a single line of code, they have to understand what drives our customers. What is the environment? What is the user story based on? Implementation means – trying, testing, and improving outcomes until a final solution emerges. Knowledge means exchange – discussions with colleagues from all over the world. Join our Digitalization Technology and Services (DTS), team based in Bangalore and enjoy the freedom to think in completely new categories!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This is your role. What part will you play?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsible for the development and delivery of parts of a product, in accordance to the customers’ requirements and interpersonal quality norms. Activities to be performed include:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Requirement analysis and design of software solutions based on requirements and architectural /design guidelines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implementation of features and/or bug-fixing and delivering solutions in accordance with coding guidelines and timely with high quality.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Identification and implementation of unit and integration tests to ensure solution addresses customer requirements, and quality, security requirements of product are met.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Performing code review and creation / support for relevant documentation (requirement/design/test specification).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ensuring integration and submission of solution into software configuration management system, within committed delivery timelines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Performing regular technical coordination / review with partners and ensuring timely reporting and blocking issues if any.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Takes strong initiatives and highly result oriented",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good at presenting within the team as well as with all the partners",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong customer focus and good learner.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Highly proactive and excellent teammate",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We don’t need superheroes, just super minds",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You must have BE / B.Tech / MCA / ME / M.Tech qualification with 4 years of confirmed ability?",
            "intent": "job_description"
