          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SonicWall delivers Boundless Cybersecurity for the hyper-distributed era in a work reality where everyone is remote, mobile and unsecure. SonicWall safeguards organizations mobilizing for their new business normal with seamless protection that stops the most evasive cyberattacks across boundless exposure points and increasingly remote, mobile and cloud-enabled workforces. By knowing the unknown, providing real-time visibility and enabling breakthrough economics, SonicWall closes the cybersecurity business gap for enterprises, governments and SMBs worldwide. For more information, visit www.sonicwall.com or follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook and Instagram.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ready to do your part in the cyber arms race? SonicWall offers fun, high-energy work environments at the leading edge of technology, networking and cybersecurity. Whether you're in sales, marketing, engineering, product management, technical support or finance, you'll have real opportunities to help protect more than 500,000 organizations across the globe. If you're ready for a career that can impact change — and not just a another job — join one of committed and enthusiastic SonicWall teams in offices around the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This is a challenging position that will call on the engineer to utilize a variety of skills. You will be responsible for developing and maintaining software related to SonicWall NGFW products. SonicWall is an industry leader in NGFW and your contributions will have major impact in security industry. The engineer should be well experienced in core networking technologies. You will also be working closely with multiple cross-functional engineering teams, potentially located in multiple time zones, to arrive at innovative design solutions. Direction will be provided but the engineer must be able to work well independently and have initiative to identify and solve problems proactively.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Design and Develop scalable solutions for SonicWall NGFW products",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Responsible for designing solutions from scratch",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Responsible for handling customer escalation issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Break down complex engineering problems and rapidly develop prototypes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Work with product management team to define new features",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Understand customer needs and help improve the product portfolio",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Collaborate with other engineers on code reviews, internal infrastructure, and process enhancements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Collaborate and communicate well with others on requirements and status to ensure products are manufactured properly and reports are accurate.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Requirement:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Strong C programming experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Hands on experience with TCP/IP, UDP and other networking protocols",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Hands on experience with Firewall, NAT and related technologies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with multi-core and multi-threaded programming is a strong plus",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Strong analytical and problem solving skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Strong oral and written communication skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Show aptitude to learn new things and incorporate new ideas",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Ability to quickly troubleshoot and resolve issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Familiarity with Agile Software Development Methodologies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with virtualization infrastructure is a big plus",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Education and Experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or a related area of study",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 5+ years of industry hands-on experience in the skills requested above",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
