          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Python Developer Job DescriptionWe are looking for a Python Web Developer responsible for developing complex structure and data analysis applications. The primary focus will be the development of the administration portal of a new product collecting mobile network measurements from a mobile application with a team leading role. You will also be responsible for integrating the front-end elements built by your co-workers into the application; therefore, a basic understanding of front-end technologies is necessary as well.",
