          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ideal Candidate should have prior experience of 3 - 5 years in Python Development. We are looking for young dynamic technology professionals to be part of the Core team developing critical Financial application development. Candidates should have a growth mindset, flair to work for diverse functional areas, be hardworking and committed to their profession.",
