            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tech Driven Basic (TDB) is a company with the vision of providing AI software in various domains such as medical, real estate, government, retail, and construction. We provide our clients with various camera enabling tools like autonomous tools, life savior tools, decision-making softwares, Edge-surveillance, and IoT. We have been working on it for a long time with the back of a strong AI team. We at TDB focus to solve real-time problems in an automated way. With a strong perspective and focus, we have developed many products for our global clients for solving their problems through automation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the internship/job:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Selected intern's day-to-day responsibilities include: 1. Developing a web application using Python/Django 2. Creating API/web services, front-end development 3. Can build a restfull api using django 4. Can build a restfull api using django",
