          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a great mobile developer who is proficient with Flutter. Your primary focus will be on developing user interface components and implementing them fusing Flutter. You will ensure that these components and the overall application are robust and easy to maintain. You will coordinate with the rest of the team working on different layers of the infrastructure. Therefore, a commitment to collaborative problem solving, sophisticated design, and quality product is important. You'll be instrumental in participating in technical discussions, taking ownership of your projects, and continually improving our code and the way that we work.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
