          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Product Lines: Videojet is the leading provider of product and case coding solutions to a wide range of industries including food, beverage, pharmaceutical, personal care, electronics, chemical, and aerospace. Our Uptime Peace of Mind™ brand promise means Videojet listens to its customers’ needs and provides the right equipment, supplies and software combined for reliable performance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Distribution Channels: Videojet utilizes a combination of direct and indirect sales channels. The vast majority of all solutions are deployed by Videojet’s direct sales organization.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "II.Purpose of the Position",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The WordPress Developer will be responsible for both back-end and front-end development of Videojet’s websites, including creating WordPress themes and plugins. He/she will have excellent programming skills and deep understanding of PHP, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The candidate should have a strong understanding of industry trends and content management systems. Experience with the responsive and adaptive design is strongly preferred. Also, an understanding of the entire web development process, including design, development, and deployment is essential.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
