            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This position will consult/analyze and deliver on more complex assignments/projects for their assigned area(s) of application development responsibility. The associate will also act as a resource and develop more complex innovative business solutions by creating new applications, modifying existing applications and providing postproduction support. The associate will deliver more complex business application software solutions following the system development life cycle process.",
