            "utterance": "About Keycentrix™*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Keycentrix is a software and technology company based in Wichita, Kansas. For over 40 years, we have provided powerful and affordable software that helps Independent Retail and Mail-order Pharmacies thrive. We also provide best-in-class software solutions for Specialty Pharmacies with Newleaf® software, allowing pharmacies to run better, smarter, and faster, while maintaining high-touch care for the communities and patients served. Learn more about our full range of software and IT services at keycentrix.com.",
