          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who We Are:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bandwidth lives for innovation! Our technology powers brands like Google, Microsoft, GoDaddy, Arlo, Netgear, Zoom, Rover and more of the most exciting leaders in technology. Our intelligent voice, messaging, 9-1-1 access, and phone number services— all backed by Bandwidth's own nationwide, all-IP voice network—allow us to power the way people communicate, connect, and do business.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Bandwidth, your music matters when you are part of the BAND. We celebrate differences and encourage BANDmates to be their authentic selves. #jointheband",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we are looking for:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a passionate and talented Sr. Salesforce Developer to join our growing team and help take our Salesforce platform to the next level. You will be given a high level of responsibility for the freedom and the potential to make an immediate impact. We're seeking somebody who is a maker, a hacker, and a software craftsman. If your idea of fun is losing track of time while geeking out lighting or apex, we'd like to talk to you.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What You'll Do:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You're gonna write great code and lots of it. You'll be a senior member of an agile software development team, and a leading voice in your team's design and implementation efforts. You'll communicate with peers to build and refactor code that is both readable and reliable due to its inherent lack of complexity. You'll also look critically at what we're building and how we're building it, and you'll originate ideas and activities that advance our craft.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What You'll Need:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you're our person, you probably look like this:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have 5+ years of experience developing directly in the Salesforce platform",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have experience building custom Salesforce solutions utilizing lightning web components and apex for complex business processes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have Salesforce Platform Developer and Platform App Builder certifications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have the ability to evaluate complex business problems and turn them into solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have experience with other technologies just as Java, Javascript, and jQuery",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have experience developing solutions on Sales Cloud, Service Cloud, and Heroku",
            "intent": "job_description"
