          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If revolutionizing healthcare excites you, join our growing team and help us achieve our mission to build better software for doctors and patients and improve healthcare for all. drchrono was founded and is led by two software engineers, Michael Nusimow and Daniel Kivatinos. Unlike other healthcare companies, our company is built from the ground up to address modern healthcare through technology and innovation. We believe in open APIs and being part of an open ecosystem.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a YCombinator funded Silicon Valley startup working out of the chronoplex in Sunnyvale, Los Angeles, and Hunt Valley, Maryland. Since our inception, we have attracted over 100k physicians, 10 million patients, and have been to the White House to discuss how technology can solve healthcare problems as part of the Precision Medicine Initiative . So far we’ve booked 20+ million patient appointments and processed 1.5 billion dollars in medical billing per year. drchrono is ranked by INC 500 as one of the fastest growing private companies in America. We are an official Apple Mobility Partner with our industry leading EHR (Electronic Health Records) iPad app.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Silicon Valley Business Journal designated drchrono as one of the fastest growing private companies and was voted the #1 mobile Electronic Health Record 5 years in a row by Black Book Rankings.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "drchrono Engineering plays a critical role delivering innovative products from inception to mass adoption. You’ll be able to use your expertise and creative talents to build things working closely with product, design, and other departments. We have the mind and soul of SaaS startup and you’ll be able to build world class software that delights users and can scale to millions of people. The ideal candidate will be comfortable in a fluid start-up environment and will bring an energetic, fun and creative approach to their work. You could be an experienced engineer or a recent graduate eager to learn and get involved at all stages of the development lifecycle.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you'll do:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Create products & features that make it easier for doctors and their staff to run an efficient medical practice",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Continually offer thought-leadership and dependable execution ability in a high-paced environment characterized by ongoing iteration and product pushes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Play a key role in product development, help shape direction of drchrono feature set",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Take complex and thorny practices and processes and build beautifully simple and maintainable software.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design & write software to help manage and automate the complexity of running a private medical practice",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Help build scalable programs that standardize information flow and increase operational capacity",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be part of a close-knit engineering team that ships new code to make a meaningful impact in healthcare",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement automated and exploratory testing processes that provide continuous feedback on quality issues; find ways to break our web application before their public release",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement internal and public facing pages on drchrono.com",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Mentor and train new engineers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Help make UI and UX decisions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you'll need:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Hacker strong with CS fundamentals from Bachelor’s in CS, engineering, related discipline or equivalent industry experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience building products for fast growing web or mobile products",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have at least 3 years of professional experience developing in Python",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to manage conflicting project demands and thrive in a small, fast-paced, start-up environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in a fast-paced work environment & a bias for action. You work as part of a team and care about building scalable and maintainable systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A product-first approach to building software. You care about the real world functionality of your programming.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience doing front-end web development using HTML, CSS, and modern Javascript using AngularJS.",
