          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong knowledge of Java, C++ and Ruby Javascript (Node.js) RESTful APIs (consuming or developing) NoSQL databases (Redis, ElasticSearch, DynamoDb, MongoDb, etc) SQL databases (mySQL, Postgres, etc)",
