          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are hiring an ASP.Net Core developer to join our product development team. We are looking for a .Net + Angular Full Stack developer to build software using languages and technologies of the .NET framework. Create applications from scratch, configure existing systems, and provide user support. Should be able to write functional code with a sharp eye for spotting defects.",
