          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The New Products- Software Developer is responsible for design, development, packaging and maintenance of application code on the Online Deposits project (Online Digital Banking products). The Developer is also responsible for the quality of the application code and adheres to the relevant coding standards and established patterns. The Developer will provide with the technical expertise on the design and construction of new modules as well as the use of appropriate development tools; by interacting with peer developers, business analysts, architects and other development teams.",
