            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "BBC Global Services is more than just another BPO company. We go above and beyond to make sure that the value we provide directly impacts our client’s business, brand, and most importantly bottom line. Our process expertise and workflow management help to streamline and enhance operations, minimize risk, and promote a quality experience for your customers.",
