          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SARA Analytics Pvt. Ltd. (the “SAPL”) is an ISO certified company established in Jaipur for the last ten years. We are aiding businesses around the world to increase their profitability and efficiency. We have a well-established reputation for providing quality services to the Offshore Clients, Information Technology Companies, CPA Firms, Non-Profit, Healthcare, Real Estate, Investment Management, and Governmental Entities.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re hiring an experienced Server Administrator to manage our Server and IT networks. Then you will thrive and grow with our IT team. We are looking for IT rock stars with a zeal to become IT managers and Senior consultants.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We encourage people to bring the full breadth of their talents, experience, and personal style to make an impact on the clients we serve. If you work best in a team environment, you believe that collaboration works, and you want to push the limits of your potential, then SAPL is for you. We develop outstanding professionals and leaders who grow with our firm and gain the experience and training needed to build a great career in IT.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Location: 601, 6th floor North Avenue, Sikar Road, Jaipur- 302013",
            "intent": "job_description"
