          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "iOS Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bytemark is looking for a talented iOS Developer to work as part of our team in Bangalore.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The iOS Mobile Developer maintains, manages, and continually develops a suite of applications built for our top clients. Coordinate and participate in the implementation, testing and support of iOS-based applications using Objective-C, Cocoa, Xcode and the iOS SDK. Design and implement new features, create UI, debugging and data modeling. Assist in testing all applications against software and hardware versions. Provide timely turnaround and documentation of bug fixes during test cycle.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide iOS development services for BM and its clients. As an engineer on the iOS app team, your responsibilities will range from high-level user interfaces, to writing networking code to communicate with web service APIs to developing framework code used by other teams at Bytemark and third party developers. You'll be responsible for maintaining and improving existing apps and implementing new and innovative features for future apps. You will also be responsible for debugging and delivering the best possible application performance including smooth scrolling and delivery of on time, speedy launch times.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "3+ years building complex applications for iOS using Objective-C/C++ with Cocoa and other",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "4+ years mobile application development at the user interface and system levels",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2+ years leading a small team of developers with your role being the primary hands-on developer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to understand and debug large and complex code bases",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Expert knowledge of iOS SDK performance tools and optimization techniques",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Demonstrated problem solving and communication skills with great experience extracting requirements from customers and translating them into features",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Git experience is preferred",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Shipped multiple iOS titles and can provide samples of deep, highly functional apps.... no one-trick ponies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "B.S. or M.S. Computer Science or related field",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient in Objective-C",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of compiler settings",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SQLite experience is preferred",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with creating static libraries is preferred",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have a good working knowledge of UIKit",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have an understanding of blocks, Grand Central Dispatch, and when to use each",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have worked on an app in the App Store",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must know how to use Instruments (Leaks, Object Allocations, etc)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must know good memory management techniques (what goes in dealloc, viewDidUnload)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Company Description:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bytemark, Inc. develops highly customized applications in the mobile space. We offer ticketing solutions across the security spectrum.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excited by Big Data, Machine Learning and Predictive Software? Interested in creating new state-of-the-art solutions using Machine Learning and Data Mining techniques on Terabytes of Data?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Amazon Bangalore, we are developing state-of-the-art large-scale Machine Learning Services and Applications on the Cloud involving Terabytes of data. We work on applying predictive technology to a wide spectrum of problems in areas such as Amazon Retail, Seller Services, Customer Service, Alexa, Chatbots and so on. We are looking for talented and experienced Machine Learning Scientists (Ph.D. in a related area preferred) who can apply innovative Machine Learning techniques to real-world e-Commerce problems. You will get to work in a team dedicated to advancing Machine Learning technology at Amazon and converting it to business-impacting solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Major responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Use machine learning, data mining and statistical techniques to create new, scalable solutions for business problems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Analyze and extract relevant information from large amounts of Amazons historical business data to help automate and optimize key processes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Design, develop and evaluate highly innovative models for predictive learning",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Establish scalable, efficient, automated processes for large scale data analyses model development, model validation and model implementation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Research and implement novel machine learning and statistical approaches",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Basic Qualifications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
