            "utterance": "Job Summary: Responsible for the maintenance, configuration, and reliable operation of computer systems and servers. Install hardware and software, and participate in research and development to continuously improve and keep up with the IT business needs of the organization. Also, resolve problems and issues with computer and server systems to limit work disruptions within the company.",
