          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP started in 1972 as a team of five colleagues with a desire to do something new. Together, they changed enterprise software and reinvented how business was done. Today, as a market leader in enterprise application software, we remain true to our roots. That’s why we engineer solutions to fuel innovation, foster equality and spread opportunity for our employees and customers across borders and cultures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP values the entrepreneurial spirit, fostering creativity and building lasting relationships with our employees. We know that a diverse and inclusive workforce keeps us competitive and provides opportunities for all. We believe that together we can transform industries, grow economics, lift up societies and sustain our environment. Because it’s the best-run businesses that make the world run better and improve people’s lives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JOB Title: Senior Developer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP Ariba is the world's business commerce network. We help companies extend their business commerce processes into the Cloud, where they can use our Procurement solutions and the Ariba Network to find opportunities to cut costs, reduce risk, and grow revenue through better collaboration with trading partners. The Ariba Network is the world's largest trading partner community with more than US $1 Trillion in transaction volume flowing through and more than 1.7 million businesses in 190 countries around the world trading in 172 currencies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Supplier Management solution is built on a robust highly scalable cloud platform that helps businesses integrate with the rest of organization's procurement processes, it's the only end-to-end solution portfolio that lets organization's manage supplier information, lifecycle, performance, and risk all in one place.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are presently looking for engineers to work on this highly scalable and complex platform and modern User Interface with function rich features and Rest based open API integration capabilities. This plays a key role in our vision for high frequency production releases with high quality.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Work in multiple components of Supplier Management building on robust, easily deployable componentized Micro service architecture and existing tried and tested platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Troubleshoot and solve Complex Cloud Scalability issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Develop/Enhance the user experience using newer technologies like AngularJS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• You will be member of the core Ariba Supplier Management team in Bangalore, Ariba IDC which is one of the biggest engineering teams in Ariba globally",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "ROLE REQUIREMENTS:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Bachelors in computer science or equivalent work experience with minimum 8+ years of development experience developing production grade software",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Strong java programming skills, as well as the ability to read and code review complex code bases written by others",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• User Experience technical design and architecture using Web technologies that includes implementation with AngularJS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Enterprise J2EE architecture and design expertise including prior Server side implementation experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Demonstrated leadership and ownership of a medium and innovative feature that has been successfully deployed",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in a Cloud based development environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "WHAT YOU GET FROM US",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Success is what you make it. At SAP, we help you make it your own. A career at SAP can open many doors for you. If you’re searching for a company that’s dedicated to your ideas and individual growth, recognizes you for your unique contributions, fills you with a strong sense of purpose, and provides a fun, flexible and inclusive work environment – apply now.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP'S DIVERSITY COMMITMENT",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To harness the power of innovation, SAP invests in the development of its diverse employees. We aspire to leverage the qualities and appreciate the unique competencies that each person brings to the company.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP is committed to the principles of Equal Employment Opportunity and to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and/or mental disabilities. If you are in need of accommodation or special assistance to navigate our website or to complete your application, please send an e-mail with your request to Recruiting Operations Team (Americas: Careers.NorthAmerica@sap.com or Careers.LatinAmerica@sap.com, APJ: Careers.APJ@sap.com, EMEA: Careers@sap.com).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Successful candidates might be required to undergo a background verification with an external vendor.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Additional Locations:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "*Job Summary*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
