          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Great Learning is an online and hybrid learning company that offers high-quality, impactful, and industry-relevant learning programs to working professionals. These programs help them master data-driven decision-making regardless of the sector or function they work in and secure their career growth into the future. These programs are delivered through a convenient and robust technology-enabled experience with no disruption to their careers.",
