            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tyler Petroleum, one of the fastest growing private companies of America, ranked 4614 in 2019 according to Inc.com. The company is well known for gas stations, software development, travel centers, convenient shops, and food centers in the USA.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tyler Petroleum founded the office in Kerala in 2018, located in Manjeri Malappuram. It is an amazing place to work in a positive environment, which attracts talented staff. Manjeri is one of the best upcoming cities in Kerala. In our Kerala office, we offer very unique benefits and infrastructure, inspired by American standards. The office is built and designed by a well famous Architect under the direct supervision of the company.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We equipped the gym and gaming area inside the office as the health of our team is very important. The office is having a fully furnished pantry and coffee area too.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The team has a well quiet environment to work. Chairs and Desks are upscale and ergonomic for maximum comfort. We provide core i7 SSD Desktop with three to five extended 27inch curved monitors. Keyboard and Mouse are of high performance and easy to use. We provide a relaxation area in case if staff need to take a break.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The salary package we offer you is the best in the IT industry. The office is open 24 hours and 7 days. Staff can decide the working hours and they enjoy this flexibility.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The staff gets the chance to work in challenging and complex tasks using the latest technology and infrastructure. Our senior engineer from USA will directly coach you to improve productivity.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We specialize in web-based fintech applications. We recruit very selectively to ensure the product is handled by great talents without giving any security issues. We evaluate mathematical skills, technical skills, communication, attitude, soft skills, etc before hiring staff.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Currently, the company is hiring experienced PHP Laravel Developers into our Kerala office. Company looking for well experienced and skilled developers who can collaborate with management, departments, and customers to identify end-user requirements and specifications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are glad to invite you to join our team. Always feel free for a free consultation with us.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Type: Full-time",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Salary: ₹240,000.00 - ₹1,200,000.00 per year",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Write “clean”, well-designed code",
            "intent": "job_description"
