            "utterance": "ARMSOFTECH.AIR provides state of the art and most advanced IT & ITES infrastructure for our clients. We have extensive experience of managing the depth and breadth of services, enabling our clients to derive significant benefits in terms of reduced service provisioning turnaround time, reduced customer churn and enhanced customer satisfaction. Our products & services are developed and managed by personnel having many man years of carefully gleaned experience in the BFSI industry.",
