            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Classpro is India’s leading online software for coaching classes. With 1000+ coaching classes using it daily in 7+ cities, it is changing the way coaching classes manage their business in India. We are a small team of young, highly enthusiastic, creative and performance driven people who will do anything (literally) to deliver the best possible user experience to our customers. That's exactly what we are looking in you!",
