          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Network Engineer (Test Lab) position in our environment is looking for MPLS or MPLS-TE Engineers with some skills in coding to move into an exciting role to gain additional skills in automation and testing across various platforms. This is new role and is an opportunity to be part of a highly dynamic, cutting-edge and challenging environment.",
