          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP started in 1972 as a team of five colleagues with a desire to do something new. Together, they changed enterprise software and reinvented how business was done. Today, as a market leader in enterprise application software, we remain true to our roots. That’s why we engineer solutions to fuel innovation, foster equality and spread opportunity for our employees and customers across borders and cultures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP values the entrepreneurial spirit, fostering creativity and building lasting relationships with our employees. We know that a diverse and inclusive workforce keeps us competitive and provides opportunities for all. We believe that together we can transform industries, grow economics, lift up societies and sustain our environment. Because it’s the best-run businesses that make the world run better and improve people’s lives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At SAP SuccessFactors we have started a Human Revolution. Using the latest technology, we are unlocking human potential and transforming our customer’s workforces in ways they never imagined. We are digitally transforming their businesses into the next generation of intelligent enterprises. Because people are at the heart of every business transformation and people are the heart of our business. The SAP SuccessFactors product suite spans core human resources and payroll, analytics-based hiring and customized onboarding, continuous performance management, intelligent succession, and more. We operate the largest HCM Cloud in the world, supporting over 120 million users with over a billion transactions for customers across 26 industries in over 90 countries. Our co-located agile teams have end-to-end ownership of product, design, development, release, user assistance, and cloud operations capabilities. We are looking for the best talent to join our team and deliver continuous innovations in the cloud while bringing purpose to their lives and more meaning to their work. Join us today and become a part of the Human Revolution.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Employee Central team is looking for an energetic and dependable individual, who is passionate about solving complex system-level problems, creating scalable and highly efficient frameworks, and supporting software development across the whole business suite. A professional with a solid grounding in Computer Science, strong interest in security, big data, data structures, algorithms, and software design is an ideal candidate for this team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Role Requirements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design, implement and continuously improve complex backend system architecture to support a high-volume SaaS system with complex business scenarios, high security, performance, scalability, and testability",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java coding skills and expertise in JDBC, JMS and Web Services (REST, oDATA) with focus on performance and scalability",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "OOAD, algorithms, data structures, design patterns",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "RDBMS concepts, OS and runtime experience (Unix, Windows, JVM, Web servers, Servlet Containers)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "UI technologies such as JavaScript, HTML, CSS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Extremely strong passion for technology and software craftsmanship",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps mindset – an inherent sense of ownership through the development and deployment lifecycle",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong grasp on at least one relational database system such as SAP Hana, Oracle, SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, or DB2",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with Spring Hibernate and PL/SQL and tuning queries for best performance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of lean development infrastructure process including Git, TeamCity, Jenkins, etc. and exposure to Continuous Delivery practices",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Exposure to building large scale applications deployed on a public cloud-like AWS, AZURE, GCP, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with the top OWASP threats and experience in mitigating these.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "B.S. in Computer Science or equivalent industrial experience required; Master’s Degree preferred.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Technologies/Tools/Architectures you could enjoy:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
