            "utterance": "As a DevOps Engineer, you would be responsible for bringing and spreading knowledge, ideas, and hands-on implementation skills needed to deliver and run software services. You will be working in close proximity with the team and the client to understand the requirements, design and implement the infrastructure for running the software service. To dive into the details you will:",
