            "utterance": "Experience with databases, persistence frameworks and SQL",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid design and programming experience and very strong in programming disciplines like object oriented principles, design patterns, data structures and unit testing",
