          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Business Promoted is a subsidiary of USA based leading digital marketing company, Inetapplication LLC. We are Google's official partner for their flagship product - Google ads. Headquarted in Florida, USA, Business Promoted is expanding its India operations at our new office in Amanora Chambers, Hadapsar, Pune. More information can be found at www.businesspromoted.com",
