          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We need a professional Web Designer with experience in WordPress to take over the *graphic and user interface design* of our websites. We’re looking for a candidate who has created and maintained functional, attractive websites for companies. we prefer experience in clean, modern, responsive websites with excellent navigational structures and detailed linking.",
            "intent": "job_description"
