          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "POSITION PURPOSE: Provide support, automation, and infrastructure expertise for all aspects of the Johnson Controls IoT SaaS offerings. Expertise will be centered on Cloud (particularly, but not limited to Azure) environments, with specific emphasis on Linux, Kubernetes, security, ISO, SOC2 and CI/CD pipeline automation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you will do",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Senior DevOps Engineer is responsible for the automation and configuration management of the platforms infrastructure and provides stable environments for delivery of quality. They will work as part of a team continuously delivering and deploying to customers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Senior DevOps Engineer is responsible for the automation of all manual tasks for the building and deployment of both code and data in order to enable continuous integration and continuous deployment frameworks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Senior DevOps Engineer is also tasked with the creation of software deployment strategies that allow team members to successfully deploy sites/software in any environment. They are also responsible for the updating of configuration management tools, code, and modules for the purpose of streamlining implementation and supportability.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Senior DevOps Engineer is further tasked with implementing monitoring and logging solutions that identify both system bottlenecks and production issues. They will further identify and implement data storage schemas such as clustering in order to maximize performance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How you will do it",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A candidate for this position must have had at least 5+ years of working experience managing infrastructure, 2+ of this as a DevOps Engineer. The candidate must also have had experience automating the managing of large-scale infrastructure and have significant familiarity with Chef, Ansible, or similar configuration management tools. The candidate will have had vast experience in systems automation, orchestration, deployment, and implementation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "He will have had excellent in-depth experience using Docker, Kubernetes/Openshift, Jenkins and Linux as well as experience configuring and automating monitoring tools. The candidate must similarly demonstrate experience in software development and experience working with tools and languages such as .Net Core , Angular, Java ,Git, Python, Shell scripting, Java, and SQL.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A suitable candidate will further demonstrate experience in scaling distributed data systems and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2+ years experience in building, maintaining and operating production systems (> 99.5% SLA) on Microsoft Azure(Preferred) ,GCP or AWS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we look for",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Qualifications Education & Experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• BS in Computer Science or equivalent work experience. Work experience significantly more important than education",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 3-5 years of overall industry experience working on enterprise based IT projects",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• The Senior DevOps Engineer will also need good communication skills in his intensely collaborative role, leading to more efficient execution of collaborative duties across the engineering department and the business",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Ability to build and improve CI/CD pipelines, working tightly with global software engineering teams to create a standardized set of solutions that continues to improve our ability to deliver technology products to the customers faster, more often, and with very high quality.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 2+ years of experience with Docker and any one of container management/ container orchestration tools like Kubernetes, Openshift ,Docker Swarm or Apache Mesos including associated sub-components i.e. Docker Registry, Docker Hub and configuration of custom controllers etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 2+ years experience in building, maintaining and operating production systems (> 99.5% SLA) on AWS, GCM or Azure(Preferred)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 2+ years of Configuration Management experience using either Chef, Puppet or Ansible",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in writing automation scripts in PowerShell, Shell and/or python scripting to automate complex tasks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Subject Matter Expert for the organization on DevOps and the technology infrastructure foundation specifically this will be expertise around Cloud, Instance level Security, automation and monitoring tools, and basic infrastructure / networking interaction.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience on Continuous improvement around automation tools and processes for Infrastructure as Code specifically Terraform, Chef, Sonar Cube, Frog artifactory, Jenkins , Consul and Vault and other tools as needed.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in Implement, maintain, and improve Continuous Integration, Testing, Delivery and Deployment environments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in deploying and maintaining logging and monitoring systems like Application insights, Dynatrace, ELK (Elastic Search, Logstash & Kibana) and Grafana.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in deploying and maintaining message queue systems like RabbitMQ, HiveMQ, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Candidate should have working experience on backup & recovery , Disaster Recovery (DR) and High Availability (HA)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Excellent English communication and inter-personal skills, including the ability to communicate difficult technical concepts in a straight-forward, simple manner",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Familiar with agile methodology",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Understanding on standard networking concept such as DNS, DHCP, subnets, load balancing, Reverse Proxy, Nginx, Firewall etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Knowledge on Azure ,Jenkins,Kubernetes,Nginx,Consul, Vault , Git, Package Management",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SKILLS/ABILITIES:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to solve problems quickly and completely",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good written and verbal communication skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent customer service skills to interface with both internal and external customers on a daily basis",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to work successfully both in a team environment and independently",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
