          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Network Administrator",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why Ericsson?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ericsson is driving 5G standardization and was the largest contributor to the standardization body in 3GPP during 2018. Ericsson is committed to rapidly applying these standards to our technology development. Ericsson is a technology leader in 5G. Pioneering customers select us as their 5G partner and we are first with commercial live networks in four continents. This includes multiple operators in both the US and South Korea, as well as in Switzerland, Australia and UAE. We have publicly announced commercial 5G deals with more than 20 named operator customers. In India, we are known for delivering “World-First” projects for India’s largest and most renowned telecommunications carriers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Location: Noida",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Exciting Opportunity!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are hiring IP Network SME to be a part of our team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Deploy & drive end-to-end technical solutions in IP & Packet Transport Domains across – IPRAN/Mobility, CEN Networks, IP-MPLS, MPLS-TP, Packet Backbone etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop deployment technical Transport solution presentations and implementation procedures and perform C-Level customer presentations on services solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong team player capable to support Integration teams in troubleshooting during deployment & Migration Phases of Project on product, performance & solution level.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ensure 1st time Right Methods and prepare Root Cause Analysis for outages.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Deliver Project Milestones as per agreed timelines secure customer acceptance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Travel and work in Customer Project Locations and work across cross-domain teams.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent IP/MPLS CEN Network competence with ability to independently work in areas of E2E QoS, Packet Transport Network Dimensioning, Optimization, Integration & Service Migrations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to learn & work in cutting edge areas like SDN & Cloud Infrastructure",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To be successful in the role one must have",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "8 to 15 Years of work experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "CCNA or JNCIA & CCIE (R&S) or JNCIS or JNCIP (Service Provider)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "– Strong IPv6 & e2e QoS competence & ability to troubleshoot e2e IP Transport Network",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "– Design, Configuration & Deployment of CISCO & Juniper Routing & Switching Products for Mobility & Enterprise solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "– Proven experience in designing/implementing/managing IP/MPLS CEN networks including swaps & migrations",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "– Hands-on experience in deploying large (100 Gig ring) Core & Aggregation Routers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "– Familiar with design concepts related to IP addressing plan, Routing, Security, Switching, Tunneling, VPNs, layer -2 concepts such as VLANs, COS, Firewall, NTP, AAA, Basic Network level knowledge of 2G,3G&4G interfaces & functionalities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What's in it for you?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Every year, more than 10,000 organizations from over 60 countries partner with the Great Place to Work® Institute for assessment, benchmarking and planning actions to strengthen their workplace culture. Great Place to Work® Institute’s methodology is recognized as rigorous and objective and is considered as the gold standard for defining great workplaces across business, academia and government organizations. Ericsson India Limited has been Great Place to Work - Certified™ in 2020.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What happens next once you apply?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Read about the next steps here. For your preparation and reference, here is our overall Brand video and some insights about our innovations in 5G",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "https://www.ericsson.com/en/careers/job-opportunities/hiring-process",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Do you believe that an organization fostering an environment of cooperation and collaboration to execute with speed creates better business value? Do you value a culture of humanness, where fact based decisions are important and our people are encouraged to speak up? Do you believe that diverse, inclusive teams drive performance and innovation? At Ericsson, we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We provide equal employment opportunities without regard to race, color, gender, sexual orientation, transgender status, gender identity and/or expression, marital status, pregnancy, parental status, religion, political opinion, nationality, ethnic background, social origin, social status, indigenous status, disability, age, union membership or employee representation and any other characteristic protected by local law or Ericsson’s Code of Business Ethics.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
