          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join our NSX User Interface team as an UI architect. We are looking for UI experts/architects who are passionate about building modern User Interfaces. Ideal candidate should be a full stack developer and have extensive real-world experience with web-based user interface technologies, write high-quality UI code, and demonstrates principles of good UI design and usability. In this role, youll be responsible for building and maintaining UI architecture, common components, and features. As an UI architect in the team you should have high standards for code , quality and also encourage best practices in the team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "NSX User interface team is charted with developing best in class UI for NSX-T product and its various feature set. The team is responsible for developing user interfaces which are 'Simple' to use, 'Modern' and 'Efficient'. We are a close knit team and believe in team work and work very collaboratively. NSX-T is redefining the way networking is done and this is your chance to be on the journey and influence the way networking is be presented to users through the User Interface.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
