            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who You'll be:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Write applications using dotNET; learn new stacks and technologies and apply our instrumentation to these applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Help customers instrument, monitor, and debug their large multi-tiered complex applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Replicate customer environments and work to identify & fix the root cause or provide interim workaround as needed.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide advanced technical support and work with customers to solve complex issues with the product in their environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build internal and customer-facing Tools and extensions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Identify product bugs and enhancements based on customer environments and work to close them.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Team:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Software Engineer on the .NET Engineering team, you will be responsible for solving complex technical challenges in customer environments and working with customers to provide advanced technical support, analysing both AppDynamics and customer code. You bring experience as a hands-on software engineer who can quickly scan and write code, spot bugs and resolve them, and someone who has great customer-facing communication skills. In this position, you will be responsible for building multi-tiered applications using various .NET Full/Core frameworks, asynchronous programming patterns, and cloud components. You’ll be working in customer environment as well as Cloud environments such as AWS and Azure. This is a unique opportunity to work in a rapidly-scaling, fast-paced environment with exposure to the most advanced technologies across the stack.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who you're:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Min of 3+ years of software development experience in .NET with extensive debugging and troubleshooting.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "BS in Computer Science or equivalent work experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience is configuring IIS, Docker, AWS, Azure, and Windows networks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with object-oriented and asynchronous programming patterns",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of MVC design patterns and frameworks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Real-world experience coding/deploying/troubleshooting .NET Core hosted in Docker Linux containers, Windows, and Cloud environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of Web protocols, formats, and server environments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Outstanding attention to detail, specification, and ability to troubleshoot/fix complex problems in customer environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proven customer-facing professionalism with great communication skills; IE the ability to tailor communication for the audience. You’ll be working with very technical, as well as some non-technical customers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "AppDynamics is an application performance monitoring solution that uses machine learning and artificial intelligence (AI) to provide real-time visibility and insight into IT environments. With our unique AIOps solution, you can take the right action at exactly the right time with automated anomaly detection, rapid root-cause analysis, and a unified view of your entire application ecosystem, including private and public clouds. Using AppDynamics, you’ll finally align IT, DevOps, and the business around the information that helps you protect your bottom line and deliver flawless customer experiences at scale.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "AppDynamics is headquartered in San Francisco and has a R&D center in Bangalore.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Learn more about us here: https://www.appdynamics.com/",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We're rated as the best workplace by most of our employees- https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/Working-at-AppDynamics-EI_IE319551.11,22.htm",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Here's why Cisco bought Appdynamics for whopping $3.7 Billion- https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/small-biz/startups/heres-why-cisco-paid-a-whopping-3-7-billion-to-appdynamics/articleshow/56804329.cms",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "#WeAreCisco, where each person is unique, but we bring our talents to work as a team and make a difference powering an inclusive future for all.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We embrace digital, and help our customers implement change in their digital businesses. Some may think we’re “old” (36 years strong) and only about hardware, but we’re also a software company. And a security company. We even invented an intuitive network that adapts, predicts, learns and protects. No other company can do what we do – you can’t put us in a box!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "But “Digital Transformation” is an empty buzz phrase without a culture that allows for innovation, creativity, and yes, even failure (if you learn from it.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Day to day, we focus on the give and take. We give our best, give our egos a break, and give of ourselves (because giving back is built into our DNA.) We take accountability, bold steps, and take difference to heart. Because without diversity of thought and a dedication to equality for all, there is no moving forward.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "So, you have colourful hair? Don’t care. Tattoos? Show off your ink. Like polka dots? That’s cool. Pop culture geek? Many of us are. Passion for technology and world changing? Be you, with us!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are a data junkie who would like to wrangle through huge data sets of usage, stats, clickstreams, free text feedbacks and more to predict the user experience, adoption and retention. You like to solve complex and challenging problems and articulate the results in a lucid manner. Then we’ve got the problem for you and the data to solve it.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In your role as data scientist you will :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Select features, building and optimizing classifiers using machine learning techniques",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build statistical/machine learning models to extract insights",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Create automated anomaly detection systems and constant tracking of its performance",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Collaborate with subject matter experts to determine relevant data sources",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Communicate the insights/recommendations to a wide spectrum of stake holder",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Act as a mentor to guide/train less experienced folks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Desired Skills and experience:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "B.E/Masters in Computer science/Statistics or equivalent",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
