            "utterance": "Since our inception in 2001, we have been experiencing tremendous growth over the years. IT outsourcing via Technology Staffing Solutions has been at the core of our establishment. In closely working with our customers over the years, they came to rely on us not only for staffing their in-house IT-talent but also to help them provide complete care for their IT investments and power their ability for rapid technology innovation. This intimate understanding of our customers challenges led to the development of Managed Technology Services and Application Development Services business units. Our customers now enjoy a single source provider for end-to-end technology solutions to address their IT challenges. To date, we have a very robust platform that can holistically meet the technology needs and overcome the technology challenges of any company; and, we have been growing between 25% and 33% YoY in the past five years.",
