            "utterance": "About Fast Data Technologies Team (FDT)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Fast Data Technologies (FDT) group builds multiple cloud based and distributed platform services which are at the core of Amazons consumer and digital businesses. Fast Data is the next step in the evolution of Big Data.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "FDTs core NoSQL distributed storage platform processes more than 2.7 trillion transactions per day to serve various tier-1/mission-critical Amazon websites and internal Amazon systems. Thousands of services fueling the growth of Amazon businesses use FDT to store customer orders, catalog and product information, shopping cart, Kindle device information, and hundreds of other business critical data-sets.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The performance and availability of FDT is critical to the reliability of the Amazon brand. We partner with Amazon Web Services (AWS) to leverage technologies built for cloud customers, and to offer technologies we invent through AWS channel to the broader market.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In addition to core storage, this group owns products like Tiered Storage, Secondary Indexing, Range Queries, Cloud Messenger, Sequence Generator and Data backfill.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Towards this vision, we are seeking a strong and highly motivated engineers to disrupt and build next generation of distributed cloud computing products and take it to the next level.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We invite you to explore this awesome, career defining opportunity to be a part of Amazon",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Responsibilities Will Include",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "4+yrs to 12 years of industry experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Lead the design, and ultimately deploy successful services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ensure the quality of design of systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Defining new APIs that demonstrate full and complete understanding of service interdependencies and limitations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Possess knowledge and is curious to learn more about performance, scalability, enterprise system architecture, and engineering best practices.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Creating prototypes and proof-of-concepts for iterative development. Work effectively with product development and engineering teams.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Actively mentoring junior team members.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join a team of builders and innovators that think outside the box. A team thats committed to a low operational burden by designing for it. A team that puts work-life balance, personal and professional growth as a principle, not a goal. If you enjoy working in a dynamic environment to deliver world class mission critical systems, this may be the career opportunity for you!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Desired Skills and Experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelors or Masters Degree in Computer Science or related field.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "4+yrs to 12 years of industry experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid experience in C, C++, Java or Python (expert in at least one).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid expertise in Data Structures and Algorithms.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid understanding of Object Oriented design and concepts.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid UNIX or Linux experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good understanding of networking concepts.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with scaling and performance of large systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Great understanding of database theory and solid experience in at least one relational DBMS.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Outstanding interpersonal and communication skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Obsession with quality and customer experience - Attention to detail coupled with ability to think abstractly",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In case your profile is short listed, you might be called for a telephonic/in-person interview at our Hyderabad office in the next few days. Hence, please send across your updated resume with the below requested details to pasupg@amazon.com at the earliest.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
