          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Upstox Story:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Upstox (RKSV Securities India Pvt. Ltd.) is one of India's leading Discount Broking companies which enables investors and traders to trade in Stock Market and Commodities exchange at a fraction of market price with our state-of-the-art trading platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "One of the fastest growing stock broking companies and first brokers in India to introduce commission-free trading for investors. Our customers enjoy zero brokerage on equity delivery trades and a flat Rs. 20 per order pricing model on all other segments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are on our way to become the leader in low-cost brokerage and No.1 stock broker in the country. We scaled from a customer database of 25k customers in 2017 to 2 Lakh customers in 2019 to 1 Million+ customers now.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The company will continue to be driven by its guiding principle of making trading in stock markets simple and affordable for all.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Company’s focus on high-design and leading-edge technology seeks to revolutionise the online trading industry in India, all at disruptive price points. Backed by Ratan Tata, Upstox had raised $4 million in Series A funding in early 2016 that was led by Kalaari Capital. The round also saw participation from health care tech firm GVK Davix Technologies Pvt Ltd. US-based investment firm Tiger Global Management invested $25 million in the company in September 2019 in a Series B funding round.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We have a team of highly skilled technology and finance professionals, and are currently looking for highly motivated field experts to be part of our high-energy team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Position: DevOps",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for talented engineers with strong foundations who can learn and pick up new tools on the fly. We want you to share our passion for developing products that will help change the landscape for fin-tech in India. You would be working with the latest web technologies to build new features, improve performance and reliability of existing features, and improve our development processes as we scale our company.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the Team:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a Formula-1 team where every millisecond counts. Here, we are continuously innovating and building highly scalable backend systems and strategies that gives a seamless experience to our customers even during large volume of traffic hitting our systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A glimpse of what we do:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Creating and improving multiple products via continuous delivery",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Embrace and enable DevOps culture within the organization",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Data driven approach to build new products and features",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build new tech innovations to improve business processes and enable our various departments to help service our customers better",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Roles & Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This person will be responsible for architecting, designing, and maintaining a CI/CD pipeline",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A strong candidate with a Development background that translated into Operations or an Operations Engineer who has - Development experience. Knowledge of python, nodejs, golang or some major language is a requirement. This person should understand thoroughly how code goes from code commit to production.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "They should have a thorough understanding on how to implementing highly available infrastructure.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of Linux Containers and IT Security practices is a plus.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The objective of this position is to facilitate, through automation, the Delivery of code.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Skills and Experience:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "7- 15 Years of overall experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong background in Linux/Unix Administration",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with automation/configuration management using either Ansible, Terraform, Puppet, Chef, CloudFormation or an equivalent",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to use a wide variety of open source technologies and cloud services (experience with AWS is required)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience coding in atleast one programming language(Python, Golang, Nodejs or equivalent)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of best practices and IT operations in an always-up, always-available service",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with containerization, Docker, Kubernetes, EKS, ECS, Hashicorp Nomad etc.- Working experience on CI/CD tools like Jenkins and Gitlab.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good troubleshooting skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Have worked on atleast one monitoring stack.(Nagios or Prometheus preferred)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Psst… tips on how you can beat the competition:",
