          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Backend Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This long-term opportunity is for someone who wants to work remotely with a growing international team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We're a fast growing company looking for a leader in the web and app development team. Knowledge of building apps is a plus but not a necessity for the current role.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At the beginning, you will be working with the graphic designer and project managers in developing websites via Wordpress x Elementor Pro",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are a problem solver, eye for detail and speak English, please read more!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Mamma Marketing is an international marketing agency which opens up and maximizes the possibilities of online business for an organisation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our passionate, creative team works together on developing all the important parts of an online presence for a business, from website design and online visibility to graphic design and video editing.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are currently working remote and will be for the foreseeable future. Most of our team is located in Ireland and Portugal and the rest of our team are jotted around the world in Italy, Germany, Poland, Spain, UK, the US, China and a few other countries.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We're looking for an energetic, problem solving and hardworking person to join our team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Website developers create and edit various types of websites. We create websites on wordpress using Elementor and with some html. You’ll be creating websites for clients and our own projects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The role involves developing websites and landing pages. We are constantly building new websites and developing marketing campaigns targeted at various industries, in several countries. We have a full service team of designers, marketers, developers, video editors, salespeople and more to work with on each project.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll be responsible for working on how to improve the conversion rates with the data analytics and marketing teams. You will all be given access to the real data provided by user actions and will work closely with each other on improving websites and webpages.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We believe in coaching enthusiastic people who want to become part of an international team. We implement the same new age marketing strategies that are used by the biggest companies and best marketing agencies around today, which you’ll learn about.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are working on a variety of different projects so you won’t be only working on one industry, you’ll be learning about several different industries. You'll be actively researching evolving trends in new functionalities in building websites, new updates to certain plugins, improving the design and conversions of webpages, and much, much more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We use the best website hosts which provide 5 star support that become very helpful when an issue arises with the backend of the website or host. Our team of web developers work alongside designers and we have a system in place for intern developers to learn from practical experience and mistakes, our experienced developers are on-hand to help with any issues you can’t resolve by yourself.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll be working on websites with different teams; developers, content creators, designers, marketing, sales staff and client managers. We help you develop websites by testing the pages and websites you create with a fine comb once you believe it’s ready to go live. Once the website is live, we track the user actions with certain software which is analysed and gives a big insight into how we can further improve and tweak the website further, based on those user actions. This is known as the “Growth Driven Design” methodology which you’ll learn about in week one.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About our team",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re a growing international team that's expanded its network and partners all over Europe, and in parts of Asia, Australia and North America.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will be joining a high energy, young, motivated team with a great work ethic. We're a full-service team of writers, marketers, developers, designers, video editors and other specialities!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Communication & Organisation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We communicate during the day using slack, email, phone calls, and then video calls when needed.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We have an organised and efficient system yet we're flexible and always open to new ideas on improving our system.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We're always learning how to develop our systems, managing projects and how to carry out tasks, with the goal of working together more effectively and enjoying what we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We encourage learning from our own or other people's mistakes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities and Requirements of Successful Applicants:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Successful applicant will be a self motivated, hard working, friendly and well rounded individual ready to represent our expanding company in the best way possible.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The successful applicant will have a good level of English to communicate with the team. There are people who joined our team with a basic level of English and after a few months, their confidence grew while massively improving in speaking, reading, listening and writing in English.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sounds good to you?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To apply for this position, please take the first step and fill out the short fill out form here at this link below.",
            "intent": "job_description"
