          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join the ‘A’ team!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We hire for potential and develop at pace. Recruiting people with potential, our focus is on what you might be capable of achieving. We look for aspiration and passionately believe that your individual personality and core strengths are what can make you right for us. We want you to learn, to discover, to experiment, to make a difference.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "So, if you can reimagine your future in a vibrant growing company, we would like to hear from you. We are an equal opportunity employer, committed to removing bias from the hiring process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Visit us at https://www.oneadvanced.com/",
