          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "_*_*We are looking for an iOS developer responsible for developing and maintaining applications aimed at a range of iOS devices, including mobile phones and tablet computers. Your primary focus will be the development of iOS applications and their integration with back-end services. You will be working alongside other engineers and developers working on different layers of the infrastructure. Therefore, a commitment to collaborative problem solving, sophisticated design, and the creation of quality products are essential.",
