            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Network Administrator",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Introduction",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At IBM, work is more than a job - it's a calling: To build. To design. To code. To consult. To think along with clients and sell. To make markets. To invent. To collaborate. Not just to do something better, but to attempt things you've never thought possible. Are you ready to lead in this new era of technology and solve some of the world's most challenging problems? If so, lets talk.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Role and Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Network Administrator, you are responsible to maintain a reliable, secure and efficient data communications network. You will configure, maintain and monitor all active network equipment in order to ensure smooth network operation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are self-motivated and willing to learn about new technologies, vendors, and IBM / client environments. Solving problem and network skills are required. You will be a team player with proven communication skills, and that is willing to work with other teammates to aid / support to both our internal and external clients.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsible for recovering provisioning failures and will be first point of contact for any provisioning related issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Configuration, implementation & troubleshooting in the field of Cisco IP telephony Network Infrastructure",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Demonstrate expertise in switching domain such as VLAN, Voice VLAN, VTP, STP, PoE, Ether channel, HSRP, Routing Protocols, etc.,",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Review each provisioning request / incident and plan the activities with minimal impact to customer environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Manage Cisco Unified Communication Products such as Cisco Unified Communications Manager (CUCM) – 9.x, 10.x, 11.x",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Technical and Professional Expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum 5+ years of experience in IT domain",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient in Cisco Unity Connection, Cisco Unified Presence.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
