          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Vertafore is a leading technology company whose innovative software solution are advancing the insurance industry. Our suite of products provides solutions to our customers that help them better manage their business, boost their productivity and efficiencies, and lower costs while strengthening relationships.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our mission is to move InsurTech forward by putting people at the heart of the industry. We are leading the way with product innovation, technology partnerships, and focusing on customer success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our fast-paced and collaborative environment inspires us to create, think, and challenge each other in ways that make our solutions and our teams better.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are headquartered in Denver, Colorado, with offices across the U.S., Canada, and India.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JOB DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Technical Lead, Software Development Engineering in Test, you will be instrumental in Vertafore’s ongoing success within the insurance industry. Our leads work with our development, product teams focusing on the providing the best products for our valued customers. This is a fast paced, ever changing environment. We continually challenge ourselves to exceed objectives, remove barriers, meet crucial deadlines, and maintain multiple projects, all while pioneering ways for efficiency with a team player attitude. If you have a passion for product quality, love technology, and enjoy thinking outside the box, you are who we are looking for.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Core Requirements and Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
