          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Role: Senior Network Engineer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re Advanced",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join a business that embraces innovation, gives you the scope to seize every opportunity and will help get you where you want to go. Life at Advanced begins in an unprecedented environment with a role that matters, taking you on a fast-paced journey of discovery, however big that might be.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are one of the UK’s largest and fastest growing software companies. True partnership is the defining thing that makes us different from the competition. We pride ourselves on delivering focused software solutions for public sector, enterprise commercial and health & care organizations that simplify complex business challenges and deliver immediate value.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the role:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Joining a team of Network specialists, you will be integrated quickly and efficiently into a supportive and friendly coalition.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will be undertaking an extremely varied role that blends Project and BAU work, thus will include but not limited to managing, monitoring, providing support and troubleshooting for Advanced Managed Services, Customer Local Area and Customer Wide Area Networks as well as being a presence in Network Security. We can offer a unique working environment where you will be able to learn and grow simultaneously. This is a chance for a dedicated Network professional to not only fulfil their potential, but to go above and beyond.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Essential skills to be considered for the role:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· 8+ Years of experience in to Network engineering having strong technical skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Previous experience in a similar role with a Managed Services Provider or large Enterprise Business, supporting UK and EU based customers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Familiarity with content switching / network load balancing technologies such as F5 or Netscalers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Excellent spoken English",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Comprehensive knowledge of network infrastructure, including the ability to analyse and debug layers 1-7.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience of troubleshooting enterprise LAN’s",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience of troubleshooting enterprise WAN’s",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Managing Telco’s throughout Incidents",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience with Cisco layer 2 and 3 switches.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience of firewall and VPN and troubleshooting Cisco ASA firewalls.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join the ‘A’ team!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We hire for potential and develop at pace. Recruiting people with potential, our focus is on what you might be capable of achieving. We look for aspiration and passionately believe that your individual personality and core strengths are what can make you right for us. We want you to learn, to discover, to experiment, to make a difference.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "So, if you can reimagine your future in a vibrant growing company, we would like to hear from you. We are an equal opportunity employer, committed to removing bias from the hiring process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Visit us at https://www.oneadvanced.com/",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
