            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What's on Offer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work for a well-funded startup",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "International working environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Exposure to cutting-edge technology",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In this role you will:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be working on all aspects of a production machine learning system. You will be acquiring data, training and building models, deploying models, building API services for exposing these models, maintaining them in production, and more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work on performance tuning of models",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "From time to time work on support and debugging of these production systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work on researching the latest technology in the areas of our interest and applying it to build newer products and enhancement of the existing platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Building workflows for training and production systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Contribute to documentation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "While the emphasis will be on researching, building and deploying models into production, you will be expected to contribute to aspects mentioned above.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are a mid-career machine learning engineer (or data scientist). Our ideal candidate is someone with 6-20 years of experience in data science.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You should be experienced in framing and solving problems with the application of machine learning or deep learning models.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of and experience in computer vision. A large part of our work revolves around computer vision, and you should have worked on this in a production environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have experienced that and understand that modelling is only a small part of building and delivering AI solutions and know what it takes to keep a high-performance system up and running.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our usage of libraries and tooling is oriented around Python, Tensorflow and Pytorch, so we would want you to have a good understanding of and experience in applying these.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We build our own services, hence we would expect you to have knowledge of writing APIs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "An enthusiasm and drive to learn and assimilate the state of the art research. A lot of what we are building will require innovative approaches using newly researched models and applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good to Have",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our stack also includes languages like Ruby, Go and Elixir. We would love it if you know any of these or take interest in functional programming.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of and experience in ML Ops and tooling would be a welcome addition. We use Docker and Kubernetes for deploying our services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in using any other platform, frameworks, tools.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Other things to keep in mind",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are interested, you also have the opportunity to mentor interns and junior team members from time to time. If you have not done this before, we will help you through coaching.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This is an opportunity to positively impact billions of people, and we hope you like it as much as we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Type: Full-time",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Salary: ₹1,500,000.00 - ₹3,000,000.00 per year",
            "intent": "job_description"
