            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your primary focus will be the development of the core backend engine and its integration with multiple frontends across mobile and web. You will be working alongside other engineers and developers working on different layers of the infrastructure. You will be part of a startup environment with a small, agile team that moves fast and uses cutting-edge technologies, tools, and processes. Therefore, a commitment to collaborative problem solving, sophisticated design, and the creation of quality products are essential.",
