          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Riversand Technologies is a leading Master Data Management (MDM) software company headquartered in Houston, TX with offices in Boston, Dallas, and Bangalore. We are looking for individuals who will enjoy working",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "in a creative and collaborative environment. There is a significant opportunity for growth within the company, and a chance to learn about and become part of a growing MDM community.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Riversand was founded in 2001 with the goal of providing world- class enterprise software to Global 2000 companies seeking comprehensive and cost- effective Product Information management (PIM) solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Riversand PIM solution enables manufacturers, distributors and procurement organizations to populate accurate, timely & up-to-date product information across the enterprise. It aggregates all product data into a",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "single repository and eliminates data inconsistencies, resulting in precise product information for all enterprise systems. The Riversand PIM solution easily scales to millions of items and thousands of attributes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our solutions drive significant business process and operational cost savings by streamlining the creation, collection and use of product information across the enterprise and beyond. They enable enterprises to",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "synchronize product information, business processes and all relevant internal and external users into one centralized platform. A single- source of product information enables enterprises to automate collaboration and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "trading partners, whether the needs are in supplier facing activities such as Engineering Design, Sourcing & Procurement or customer facing interactions across multiple channels and markets.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "For more details please visit our website: http://www.riversand.com/",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Location: Bangalore",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
