          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JavaScript Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience: 1 - 4 Years",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualification: B.Tech (CS/IT/EC) / BCA / MCA",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a JavaScript Developer who is motivated to combine the art of design with the art of programming. Responsibilities will include implementing visual elements and their behaviors with user interactions. You will work with both front-end and back-end web developers to build all client-side logic. You will also be bridging the gap between the visual elements and the server-side infrastructure, taking an active role on both sides, and defining how the application looks and functions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Skills Required",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong understanding of JavaScript, its quirks, and workarounds",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Practical HTML5, CSS, Node / IONIC JavaScript experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good understanding and knowledge of advanced JavaScript libraries and frameworks such as AngularJS, Knockout JS, Backbone JS, React JS, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good understanding of asynchronous request handling, partial page updates, and AJAX",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient understanding of cross-browser compatibility issues and ways to work around such issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with JavaScript module loaders, such as Require. js and AMD",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with front-end build tools, such as Grunt and Gulp.js Proficient understanding of code versioning tools, such as {{Git / Mercurial / SVN}}",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good understanding of browser rendering behavior and performance Using IONIC Framework, you will be a part of a strike team to create real-time multiplayer games on Web and iOS/Android/Windows devices.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "WHY SHOULD YOU CONSIDER MOBZWAY",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "FOR A PROSPEROUS CAREER?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A job in our organization will provide you ample amount of opportunities and every day you will get the chance to acquire new skills and upgrade existing ones. Mobzway has highly dynamic work culture where knowledge is shared freely and you will learn the ways to overcome the challenges in the designing and development of best in class games for global clients. Our company has made a contribution in taking the Indian gaming industry to the next level of success. We are looking for talented individuals who not only take the responsibility of their own work but for the success of the entire team at large and has ability to work as a part of multidisciplinary team. We are looking for people who would like to be a part of our group and contribute to our goal of developing exciting and innovative gaming products. We provide a platform for boundless achievements to all our employees and with the talent and passion that you have there is no limit to what we can achieve working as a team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To apply, please send an email to hr@mobzway.com telling us about yourself and your past development experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Based in Silicon Valley, Tintri is a wholly owned subsidiary of DataDirect Networks (DDN), the data-at-scale powerhouse and world’s largest privately held storage company. Tintri solutions serve the needs of enterprise data centres with intelligent infrastructure. Our product portfolio includes advanced technologies from Tintri (acquired September 2018), Nexenta (acquired May 2019), and IntelliFlash (acquired from Western Digital November 2019). This portfolio offers a fresh choice and a new experience to elevate your user experiences through automation, analytic insight, and tight integration with application workflows for your enterprise applications, including mission-critical databases and business applications, virtualization, and flexible software defined solutions. Learn more about the Tintri portfolio of solutions at https://www.tintri.com/products",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tintri is looking for motivated and passionate individuals that are self-motivated in their work and careers but we are valuing and thriving in an environment where collaboration and teamwork are at best. We are all together on a quest to provide game changing storage solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Summary:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a Software Engineer for our RED Tintri Storage engineering team who will participate in the design, build and deliver of data protection solutions for DDN RED software storage product:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement critical distributed storage components including file system network protocols, storage optimization features and high availability services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement heath checking tools definition and implementation providing solutions for data consistency, data replication and media continuous sniff testing.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities for this role include but are not limited to:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Drive design discussions, build prototypes and contribute to deliver high quality products;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and implement complex and critical distributed storage components including file system network protocols, storage optimization features and high availability services;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Conduct code reviews and improve scalability, stability, reliability and performance of RED product support solutions;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Collaborate with your teammates and integrate a group of passionate developers in an outcome oriented environment;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Adopt Agile practices and support appropriate technical meetings/scrums and message progress/status/concerns;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Providing regular reports on your project progress to team members and supervisors.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "BS/MS/Ph.D in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Statistics, Mathematics or equivalent degree/experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "5+ years of experience years of software development experience with file systems, server architectures and distributed systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in developing and debugging at system level C/C++, particularly for Linux/UNIX computing environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience on system deployment on premise or cloud for Enterprise solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understands all or some of IB and high performance Ethernet, tcp and socket programming, libfabrics, virtualisation for datastores, data storage, file systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Attention to detail and commitment to high quality deliverables.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong team player with good communication skills and should be self-starter.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent time management skills, with the ability to independently prioritize, multitask, and work under deadlines in a fast paced environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
