            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will get an experience of working with international reputed clients from various industries.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Skills required",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "WordPress is built on PHP with HTML, CSS & JavaScript. So besides these obvious skill sets, WordPress developer should have a good understanding of it’s CMS functionalities, codebase architecture & most importantly – community & entire ecosystem.",
