          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Position Summary: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Micrologic Associates is seeking an experienced, hands-on Software Development Manager to lead a team of developers and to help refine operational procedures within the department. At Micrologic, our software technology products are an integral part of our services & success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Development responsibilities will include working on new system features as well as maintaining and supporting existing applications. Additionally, the Software Development Manager will assist in developing and implementing the technical strategy, development methodology, and necessary IT operational procedures to sustain a reliable set of production systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a team leader within the Development team, this position will be responsible for the planning and delivery of appropriate solutions to meet required specifications and timelines and will work closely with other departments to ensure products and services meet all technical, functional, and performance related requirements.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Software Development Manager should be a self-starter, have a can-do attitude, and possess a strong development background. This position has a strong team emphasis and will require exceptional relationship building skills with the ability to create effective partnerships with business, shared services, and other IT Support areas. This position will report to our Director of Development Services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Monitor systems and applications uptime and performance with a goal of minimizing downtime",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Monitor system deployment and maintenance for impacts to production support",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Support and maintain production environments and applications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Assist in developing the technology strategy for the organization; research and implement technical tools needed to optimize the business processes and workflows",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Review requirements and determine technical design and implementation alternatives",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Responsible for department’s technologies including JIRA, CRM and ticketing system",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Implement development guidelines and processes including coding standards, documentation and audit trail, code maintenance, peer reviews and check-in/checkout procedures",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Mentor, coach and provide technical guidance ensuring team is successful to deliver quality products",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Ability to work in a fast-paced environment, recognize and react to changing business needs and effectively prioritize tasks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Ability to meet deadlines, identify issues and resolve with minimal direction",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
