          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "i-exceed technology solutions private limited",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We have an opportunity for you with our company \"i-exceed\". Kindly find below the JD mentioned below, if you are interested in exploring this opportunity then do reply back with your updated resume at the earliest. About i-exceed: i-exceed technology solutions private limited is an IT products and services company with offices in India, Singapore, and the US. With niche IT solutions and specialized consulting services, i-exceed serves 70+ customers in 5 continents with offerings in the technology transformation, core banking business transformation, enterprise mobility, and performance management space. With readymade business solutions, customers can leverage on our decades of experience and fine tune applications for the best performance in their working conditions. Our service offering in the industry include: - Core Banking Transformation - Performance Management - Testing and Validation - Requirement Management and Business Analysis - Project Management and High End Consulting - System Integration Appzillon, i-exceed’ s flagship product offering consists of a world-class Unified Application Development Suite (MADP+) and readymade business solutions for various industries (including BFSI). The development suite offers rich, agile, and robust cross-platform capabilities to build device and OS independent apps. With its unique capability to automatically extend enterprise services to multiple channels, organizations can jumpstart their channel activities including mobility initiatives with Appzillon.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Contact Company:i-exceed technology solutions private limited",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Django Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What is the larger purpose and impact of this role?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At MiStay, we are changing the way hotel operations have been managed traditionally. Changing the decade old traditions of rigid full-day hotel booking into flexible stay will be a paradigm shift in the hotel industry. Technology would be the key driver in enabling this change.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a backend developer, you'll be able to build innovative solutions that would disrupt how hotel room inventory management is being done since decades. You'll get to develop mobile and web experiences with real world impact by solving problems faced by travellers around the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What would be my responsibilities?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Take an idea to production - architect, build, test and deploy.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Engage in product discussions and help improve the user experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Prototype concepts to facilitate product development.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Participate in code reviews and collaborate with the team to ensure best practices are followed.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Leverage cutting edge technologies to power the solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Assist other teams to enhance their productivity by building internal systems to improve their workflow.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What type of a candidate will succeed in this role?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Atleast 2 years of experience in web development using Python",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Have successfully built, deployed, and supported a large-scale web application in the cloud",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong software design skills and ability to break down problems independently",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Prior experience in these technologies will be a plus: Docker, Django, React, Redux, MySQL, Docker, React native, ES6",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient in version control systems like Git",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to pick up new technologies quickly",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong understanding of product development stages",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Additional Details",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "MiStay is founded by alumni of IIT Madras and backed by Axilor Capital, Kris Gopalakrishnan (Founder of Infosys) and various industry professionals. Currently operational in 90 Cities in India with around ~1000 hotel partners, MiStay has been featured as \"Top 5 Websites globally for Hourly or Day-use Hotels\" and is one of the fastest growing travel-tech startup in the country. At MiStay, everyone gets the opportunity to participate and contribute to overall growth strategies of the company apart from the core responsibilities, while working in an extremely entrepreneurial environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Gas, Power, and Energy Futures (GPE) team at IHS Markit is seeking an individual with deep technical skill sets to assist the data science lead in developing the capabilities of our data science team. Prospects must have strong python and SQL experience, familiarity with AWS cloud computing tools, and a demonstrable academic and/or applied knowledge of data science. Individuals with some knowledge or experience working in electric power or gas markets in any country are preferred.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Core Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Assisting the data science lead with a wide variety of tasks to further the role of data science in producing actionable insights for researchers within GPE.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Maintenance of existing data science platforms within GPE",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
