          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP started in 1972 as a team of five colleagues with a desire to do something new. Together, they changed enterprise software and reinvented how business was done. Today, as a market leader in enterprise application software, we remain true to our roots. That’s why we engineer solutions to fuel innovation, foster equality and spread opportunity for our employees and customers across borders and cultures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP values the entrepreneurial spirit, fostering creativity and building lasting relationships with our employees. We know that a diverse and inclusive workforce keeps us competitive and provides opportunities for all. We believe that together we can transform industries, grow economics, lift up societies and sustain our environment. Because it’s the best-run businesses that make the world run better and improve people’s lives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the LoB Real Estate",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The LoB Real Estate is a dedicated team with the mission to create innovative and potentially breakthrough standard software solutions for high value, strategic customers. To achieve this, we collaborate closely with customers. Our development approach is user-centric, applying different methods (such as Design Thinking, Scrum, Agile Development) within short project cycles.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As one of the 21 core processes of SAP S/4HANA we are frontrunner for the implementation of ONE S/4HANA Cloud. For this we apply the newest Cloud-technologies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In this summer we were responsible for the REStart or Workspace Booking app launched to manage the return to office during the COVID-19 crisis and we launched the Honeywell partnership to great acclaim on SAPPHIRE.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a developer for Cloud integration you will be a member of a team that focuses on the development of innovative Real Estate solutions for the Cloud. These solutions will interact and integrate with other strategic SAP initiatives like SAP S/4HANA Cloud, SAP Cloud Platform, SAP Asset Intelligence Network, etc. Currently, the team is working on SAP Cloud for Real Estate (https://www.sapstore.com/solutions/99066/SAP-Cloud-for-Real-Estate%2C-location-management-option ), a native Cloud solution tightly integrated with other SAP Cloud solutions such as SAP’s flag ship solution SAP S/4HANA Cloud.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will work in a distributed team in Scrum fashion. Specifically, the team is already spread over three locations in Germany. Since the team is used to spanning multiple locations already, you will be fully integrated in the Scrum team, with all roles being distributed over all locations, including leadership roles in India, and meetings held at compatible times.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Learning about new technologies and trends is very crucial. In order to achieve our challenging goals, you will be expected to share your knowledge with your colleagues and apply them in your projects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your tasks will include:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Developing SAP Cloud Platform application components with Java, JavaScript and TypeScript and testing them",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Integrating with ABAP and Fiori components",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Collaborating closely with a strong team of designers and domain experts",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Contributing to the entire application lifecycle from definition and design to go-to-market",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Working together with partners and customers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Role Requirements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a Developer with at least 4+ year of experience or comparable knowledge.",
            "intent": "job_description"
