          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description : Roles and Responsibilities Providing 3rd level technical support for complex problems in an operational environment; Recommending alternative solutions, priorities, systems hardware/software, design changes and improvements; Perfor",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Roles and Responsibilities Providing 3rd level technical support for complex problems in an operational environment; Recommending alternative solutions, priorities, systems hardware/software, design changes and improvements; Performing off-hours work to support changes. Managing problems to resolution using defined process flow. Implementing changes using defined change management protocol. Performing additional responsibilities as assigned; Configure network devices Device activation and implementation Network Performance Investigation Perform WAN and LAN troubleshooting Firewall and VPN troubleshooting Monitor network devices and circuits Provide circuit utilization reporting Maintain CMDB Inventory in Service-Now Desired Candidate Profile 9+ years extensive experience / knowledge of R&S, Wireless, Optimization and in load balancing worked in complex environment including various products and enterprise scenarios. Hands on experience on FortiGate firewalls, Cisco ASAs, Cisco FTD, Cisco Switches (Catalyst and Nexus), F5 Load Balancer, Cisco wireless networks, Cisco Umbrella Cisco Prime Infrastructure configuration and support that include analyse logs to troubleshoot issues and configure wireless policies Cisco ISE infrastructure configuration and support which includes Configure and maintenance Analyse logs to troubleshoot account authentications issues Experience with routing protocols specially RIPv2, OSPF, BGP Experienced and proficient with Azure networking and security. You love collaborative environments that use agile methodologies to encourage creative design thinking and find innovative ways to develop with cutting edge technologies Ambitious individual who can work under their own direction towards agreed targets/goals and with creative approach to work Intuitive individual with an ability to manage change and proven time management Proven interpersonal skills while contributing to team effort by accomplishing related results as needed",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
