          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Education Qualification: B.Tech / BE / MCA, Degree in Computer Science or workforce equivalent technical certifications preferred Experience: 3+ years of experience working CI/CD pipeline and application deployments Expectations and Responsibilities: • Strong expertise in Dev Ops tools: o CI Servers (Jenkins, TeamCity, Travis CI) o Infrastructure Automation (Chef/Puppet/Ansible/Terraform/SaltStack) o SCM (TFS, GIT, Subversion) o Build tools (Ant, Maven, Make, Gradle) o Artifact repositories (JFrog ArtiFactory, Nexus) o Scripting (Python/ Ruby/ Groovy/ Shell/ PowerShell) o ChatOps (Slack/ HipChat) o Container Management (Kubernetes/ Docker) o Database Configuration Automation (Redgate/Datical/LiquiBase) • Some development experience with Java, .Net/C# • Working knowledge of operating systems (Unix/Linux, Windows) • Basic knowledge of network infrastructure for e.g. TCP/IP, DNS, Firewall, router, load balancer etc. • Understanding of application code and build scripts • Must be highly collaborative and be able to work in a team environment, with technical and business stakeholders. • Excellent communication, problem solving and customer service skills with the ability to translate technical detail into non-technical information. • Must be able to multi-task and work well with changing priorities in a fast paced, 24x7 environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
