          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Purpose and Challenges",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "With over 47% market-share, MakeMyTrip is India’s first and biggest travel company. In fact, one in every four passengers at an airport is our customer. Driven by the desire to provide an exceptional travel experience for our customers, we have continuously stayed ahead of the curve by developing technology and products to meet the ever-changing demands of the rapidly evolving travel ecosystem.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are currently solving multiple challenging problems, including -",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to bring the next 100 million users to our platform?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to leverage customer insights to create a truly personalised experience for users?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to create a delightful experience for our users, to make travel synonymous to MMT?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If this excites you, join us for a rewarding, fulfilling and enriching career.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "“Not only do we make the best trips for our customers, we also promise the trip of a lifetime to our employees! Everyday, our teams solve challenging problems for millions of users by leveraging the latest technology, while having loads of fun. Every day is a new trip for them, and that is precisely why we call them Trippers!”",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sanjay Mohan, Group CTO, MakeMyTrip",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the opportunity",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you’ll be doing:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will contribute to all aspects of an agile software development lifecycle including design, architecture, development, documentation, testing and operations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will build cutting-edge scalable systems by writing simple and efficient code.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will push your design and architecture limits for new product development.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will collaborate with product managers, and other key stakeholders within the MMT family to successfully execute projects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will ensure compliance with build/release and configuration management process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you’ll bring to the table:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You possess good understanding of Agile Methodology, Object Oriented Programming Concepts and Responsive Designs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have hands-on experience on Java/ J2EE stack and have done development across multiple browsers/platforms delivering mind-boggling results.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You thrive in complexity and jump at the opportunity to collaborate with colleagues to delivery projects within tight deadlines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you have work experience in a product/start-up company, we’ll like you even more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Interview Process & Prep Notes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Coding Assessment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Basic Coding, Core Java, Struts, Hibernate and Spring",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We love Java. So if you're going to tell us that you're the next James Gosling we expect you to know it all - (OOP Concepts, Singleton, Dynamic Method, ServletContext vs ServletConfig)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Data Structure And Problem Solving",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Array,LinkedList, Stack, Binary Tree, Hash Tables, Heap",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Like every invention has a necessity, engineering at MMT also has one. Data structures and Algorithms have stood the test of time and have helped us solve our daily engineering problems. Binary Tree, Linked List, Algorithm Design, Dynamic Programming, Graphs are our best friends.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design & Architecture",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design patterns, System Design & Architecture Review",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be prepared to answer some simulation-based questions during our interviews. From system design for an e-commerce platform to component interaction.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Team Fitment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Behavioural Assessment, Culture Fit, Project Knowledge, Role Operation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be yourself. It works out better for everyone if we're genuine and can see if we're a cultural fit for each other. Everyone here is focused on our mission, so you should figure out what it is.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
