            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Agiloft",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Agiloft was named as the market leader in every category in the Gartner Critical Capabilities for CLM report, and a market leader in the Gartner Magic Quadrant. Contract Lifecycle Management (CLM) is one of the fastest-growing areas of enterprise sales, with a TAM projected to climb from $2B to $7B in the next 5 years.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Agiloft Contract and Commerce Lifecycle Platform has won over a dozen awards, including the Editor's Choice award from PC Mag, for the past five years in a row.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Agiloft has a highly differentiated value proposition which is uniquely appealing to enterprises: pre-built applications with a deeply configurable, no-code platform for integrated Business Process Management throughout an organization.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Agiloft is pioneering the applied use of Artificial Intelligence to enable next-generation business commerce at organizations ranging from small enterprises to U.S. government agencies and Fortune 100 companies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Agiloft is the only company in the industry with the confidence to provide an unconditional satisfaction guarantee, and you too will be successful with Agiloft.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As the leader in the CCLM market, Agiloft is winning many Enterprise deals and looking to hire the best talent to meet this demand with a competitive compensation plan that rewards overachievement.",
