          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and develop responsive web applications and workflows on Cloud Platform n Extensive experience in any one of Node.js, React JS, Go Lang, Python, scripting n Solid knowledge of Restful architecture and use cases n Experience on AWS along with any other cloud services (Azure/Google Cloud etc) n Knowledge of Secure Programming PrinciplesHELP n Must be proficient with DevOps and CI/CD pipeline. n Experience in development of micro services based architecture. n Minimum work experience: 5 - 8 YEARS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
