            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Leading EDJE helps our partners solve their most complex business challenges by building them the highest quality custom software….and we do it better than anyone else!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Since 2007, we have honed a unique culture that promotes high, positive energy with an entrepreneurial spirit. Our firm is made up of exceptionally talented professionals who deliver exceptional results. Our clients span a wide variety of industries, but all have the common goal of choosing a partner who provides distinct, creative solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We choose to work and live deliberately by our uncompromising core values: Puts Team First, Is Dedicated to Growth, Does the Right Thing…Not the Right Now Thing, Approaches Problem Solving Passionately, and Is Authentic and Clear. It is an absolute must that our team members share these values and embrace them both professionally and personally.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "QUALIFICATIONS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are interested in every qualified candidate who is eligible to work in the United States. However, we are not able to sponsor visas.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The ideal Solutions Developer is a creative thinker who thrives on innovation and thinking outside the box. Understanding how to approach complex issues is critical when delivering a solution on time and under budget. In today’s complex business environment, the ability to provide real-time information and tie different technologies into a seamless solution is imperative.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Leading EDJE team members (we call ourselves EDJErs) are continuous learners who are passionate about technology and thrive on keeping up with the latest technology trends. They take advantage of every opportunity to grow their skills and knowledge.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "EDJErs are great team players who are dependable and reliable. They are good communicators, open-minded, and respect other opinions. They are honest, transparent, and flexible. The ideal candidate is authentic and personable, not ego-centric. He or she recognizes the “we” in team success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
