            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JavaScript Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "No relocation needed, can telework from home, required good Internet.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Please send in your current and expected CTC too.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who is TEKgile?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a tech company that works with our American partner to deliver innovative new technology for Google Assistant & Amazon Alexa markets that reach millions of end-users. We are a multi-tenant SaaS platform that delivers information to communities through voice user interfaces (VUI’s). We work with global companies and some of the top data providers and technologies to connect data through the power of voice.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why would I want to be a JavaScript Developer at TEKgile?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "TEKgile and our American partner company aims to continue its growth trajectory in the US and have an exciting future. Software and platform improvements are vital to the success of the company and are looking to grow our team to add new features to what we offer. You will be reporting to the Product Manager, who is based in the US as well as our Technical manager in Trivandrum. The team focuses on all product life cycle, bugs, and features that relate to the existing clients and future needs of the platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The JavaScript Developer role is focused on building on the success of the Voice SaaS platform as it is now, and continuing to grow the functionality and capabilities for all our users. Responsibilities include helping to grow the features our platform can do, make it faster and more efficient, and interact with as many data platforms as possible. We also innovate and create insights from data that is collected and will help explore those more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for someone that is:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Interested in the startup culture",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Looking to take ownership of your tasks and be held accountable for their quality and completion",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Interested in Voice enable devices like Google Assistant, Amazon Alexa, and Chat bots",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Being great at what you do and enjoy doing it.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What would I be doing?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
