          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "For over 10 years, Zscaler has been disrupting and transforming the security industry. Our 100% purpose-built cloud platform delivers the entire gateway security stack as a service through 150 global data centers to securely connect users to their applications, regardless of device, location, or network in over 185 countries protecting over 3,900 companies and have detected 100 Million threats/day.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We work in a fast-paced, dynamic and make it happen culture. Our people are some of the brightest and passionate in the industry that thrives on being the first to solve problems. We are always looking to hire highly passionate, collaborative and humble people that want to make a difference.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The Emerging Technology group is a fast paced and exciting product development team which is at the forefront of adopting cloud technology and solving customer problems. We hire talented engineers and provide them lots of freedom and autonomy to build great products. The position is to hire an engineer who will contribute to significantly improve product quality. We are looking for engineers with a combination of",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "solid in-depth understanding of networking, systems and security and have the ability to test software for scale, performance and availability.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
