          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This position is critical to the growth and continued success of the organization with responsibility for quality assurance of the group's products and services. The ideal candidate will apply their in-depth working knowledge of quality assurance methodologies and work alongside our Creative and Engineering departments to help develop cutting edge software that is helping to revolutionize the clinical trial process.",
