            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Culture, Our Ethos",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At CloudSkope, we believe that we can individually only excel when the collective is healthy. Which is why we are commonly described as a family. We believe that happy employees result in happy customers and we live, breathe, and embody that belief in everything we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In addition to unique experiences and technical expertise we also bring together the best and brightest minds to our team and give them the freedom to innovate.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At CloudSkope, we are a family that genuinely cares for one another, our clients, and our community — and we have a lot of fun together!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are shaped by the experiences of our collective team, driven by a shared passion for making a difference, and steadfast in our commitment to integrity and humility in everything we do.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Every member of our team brings unique perspectives, vision, entrepreneurship, and approaches to doing things. We help each other, our customers, and sometimes even our competitors- after all- no matter who does the work, a customer will always benefit from it somehow.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our contribution to a project usually comes from many of us working together.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are seeking a DevOps Engineer for a permanent/direct hire opportunity in Bangalore, India. In this Agile environment, you will work between the SQA and Dev teams to design and develop high performance solutions for critical applications. The responsibilities of this role are as follows:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design, deploy and maintain DevOps platforms, systems and infrastructure.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build, deployment, monitoring, and troubleshooting of cloud-native infrastructure and technology components using Kubernetes, Docker and Big Data technologies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work across all development teams to encourage best practices for continuous delivery and configuration management and to identify missing tools and automation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop, implement, and optimize the software build and deployment pipelines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Development of solutions for the automation of system provisioning and deployment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement monitoring platforms across infrastructure, applications and networks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Improve and build on kernel performance, database and storage optimizations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Manage Linux clusters and containers using tools such as Ansible, Chef, Puppet.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Troubleshoot and resolve live production issues by analyzing logs from different sources, follow up with developers, platform engineer and other teams on the resolution.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Perform software installations and upgrades for the DevOps services platform and associated systems during industry-standard maintenance windows",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Direct involvement with 24/7/365 production environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelor's in Computer Science, Telecommunications or equivalent work experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Three years of hands-on experience in DevOps engineering.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Three years of hands-on experience with automation/configuration management tools (Puppet, Salt, Chef, Ansible, etc.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Three years of hands-on experience in multi-server platforms and Linux operating system",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Three years of hands-on experience with container technologies and management platforms (Kubernetes, Docker, Elastic Container Service)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
