          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with databases, networks (LAN, WAN), printers and patch management. He should be responsible for Installing and configuring software, hardware and networks, software Antivirus installation and configuration, Mail configuration on mobile devices.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "He should be capable to Diagnose, troubleshoot and resolve hardware, software or other network and system problems, and replace defective components when necessary.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "He should be responsible to maintain the timely back up of the important data and management resource, taking care of daily, weekly, monthly, yearly backups of all servers and send backups reports to concern IT head on daily basis.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Should have good knowledge of system security (e.g. intrusion detection systems) and data backup/Restore",
