          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "CloudIQ is looking for talented and motivated professionals with profound knowledge in Devops side, who can work independently on given challenging tasks. As a Devops Engineer, you should have in-depth experience on application containerization and incorporating CI CD flows for the same using any industry acclaimed tools. With Cloud being the very base of the Company, experience in AWS or Azure will bring enormous advantages to your profile. The profile demands close collaboration with developers in understanding the system, articulating requirements etc., which will help in delivering the suitable build and deployment solution to get quicker TimeToLive.",
