          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Basic Qualifications :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelor's degree in software engineering or a related technical field is required (or equivalent experience), plus a minimum of 5 years of relevant experience; or Master's degree plus a minimum of 3 years of relevant experience. Agile experience preferred.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Clearance Requirements:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Department of Defense TS/SCI security clearance with a Polygraph is required at time of hire. Applicants selected will be subject to a U.S. Government security investigation and must meet eligibility requirements for access to classified information. Due to the nature of work performed within our facilities, U.S. citizenship is required.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities for this Position:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This position is eligible for a sign-on bonus up to $20,000 for New Hires Only",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Employee Referral Program offers a $20k Referral Bonus for any candidate referred by an employee and hired for this position",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A Relocation package may be available for this position",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Help make the technologies, products and services that make a difference. That’s the opportunity that’s waiting for you at General Dynamics Mission Systems. We help our nation’s heroes keep our nation safe by creating solutions so advanced, they redefine innovation for the world. It’s an amazing challenge. And it’s waiting for you now.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We apply advanced technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Blockchain, AR/VR, Cloud Native and Quantum Physics to solve our customers’ missions in cyber, RF, undersea, interstellar space and everything in between.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working successfully within a team, the Java Developer will perform software requirements analysis, and participate in the research, design, development and testing of software and tools, to include development of mission critical systems that support an enterprise infrastructure. Your talent will be front and center. It’s your chance to step up to the challenge and prove you’re ready to lead the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developers will have the opportunity to work on an Agile team to design and develop a wide array of K8s and Spring Based high data rate Microservices using Java 11.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developers on CORKEDBAT have the opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies including:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Technologies: Microservices, Docker, Kafka, Kubernetes, Cassandra, Java 11, ReactJS, Spring Boot/Cloud/Data, Redis, Postgres",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tools: Maven, Node, Git, Sonar, Eclipse, IntelliJ, Atlassian Jira (Bitbucket, Confluence, Bamboo, Crucible)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Basic Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum of 7 years of experience as a software engineer developing, maintaining, and enhancing complex and diverse software systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum of 3 years of experience with Java and/or JavaScript like languages",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with distributed applications (i.e. Microservices, Kubernetes, Kafka, NiFi, Cassandra)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Company Overview:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "General Dynamics Mission Systems (GDMS) engineers a diverse portfolio of high technology solutions, products and services that enable customers to successfully execute missions across all domains of operation. With a global team of 12,000+ top professionals, we partner with the best in industry to expand the bounds of innovation in the defense and scientific arenas. Given the nature of our work and who we are, we value trust, honesty, alignment and transparency. We offer highly competitive benefits and pride ourselves in being a great place to work with a shared sense of purpose. You will also enjoy a flexible work environment where contributions are recognized and rewarded. If who we are and what we do resonates with you, we invite you to join our high performance team!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "General Dynamics is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer that is committed to hiring a diverse and talented workforce. EOE/Disability/Veteran",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Company Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Infobip we dream big. We value creativity, persistence and innovation, passionately believing that it is through teamwork that we can all reach greater heights. Since 2006, we have been innovating at the edge of technological possibilities and are now shaping global communications of the future. Through 60+ offices on six continents, Infobip’s platform is used by almost 70% of the population, making it the largest network of its kind and the only full-stack cloud communication platform (cPaaS) globally. Join us on our mission to create life-changing interactions between humans and online services with new and unseen solutions. Join our development forces in deploying the code that powers the performance of the Infobip platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why is this role important at Infobip?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our use case is specific. We are solving complex problems for global brands. If our services are down, our clients send messages through other providers. And when our competitors have troubles in production, we have to be the most reliable provider to get the majority of their traffic. We avoid big release dates and deploy to production when you finish a task in your sprint. It is an in-house developed product so there is no contract forcing you to guerilla develop something and troubleshoot later.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Software Engineer, you will directly impact the quality of the software we produce, dealing with challenges of large architecture (scalability, fail over, balancing...) that sends over 400 million messages daily.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You know you are doing a good job when:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You write well designed, testable and scalable code in accordance to clean code principles and team agreement.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "All code you produce is thoroughly tested for bugs and reviewed before going into production.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have a great general overview of the system that your team is dependent of, understanding the interactions and dependencies among those components.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You regularly contribute to discussions and brainstorming with high quality ideas that result in adoption and improvements.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You proactively share knowledge and help your team evolve into a better team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "More about you:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have 2+ years of experience with Java, Spring and Spring boot development or related techologies and delivering multi-tier enterprise applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You don't want to touch HTML, CSS or the latest JS library - great!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have worked before on a high load, large scale platform that has to be highly available. Or you are just starting and this is your career goal. :)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You know how to build highload distributed service-oriented applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You share our passion for building high quality software in agile environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You know and care about engineering practices like continuous delivery and automated testing.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are genuinely curious about how things work, always looking to improve code quality, development process etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You build positive, lasting relationships with colleagues in the team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Additional Information",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why our employees choose us (and stay)?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Cutting edge technology & processes – To us, continuous delivery and integration aren't just buzzwords - all our teams combined deploy something new every 5 minutes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Educational budget – You get to decide will you spend your budget on conferences, online courses or certifications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Global products developed in-house – We depend on the quality of our in-house developed products, which is why we put so much emphasis on code quality. The fact that our products are being used by half of the world’s population means that we have to make our software platform scalable.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Opportunity knocks. Often. – Being a part of a growing company in a growing industry – we challenge you not to grow! Whether it’s horizontal, vertical, or angular, we want to support the path that you want to carve.",
