          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "PatientTrak is a leading, cloud-based, healthcare SaaS application used by healthcare organizations to reduce wait times, build their brand, and improve patient satisfaction. Our software solutions enables leading healthcare providers across the nation to track patients, improve online reputation management, send/receive automated surveys and communicate with patients via SMS text messaging.",
