          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are seeking an experienced, enthusiastic, full stack, software developer to support SaaS as well as custom programming for customer implementations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This individual will be responsible for various new feature developments, implementing improvements and changes to the software application as well as troubleshooting customer issues. Scrum methodology is key to our product release cycle, so this individual will excel if they have worked on a scrum team before. The right candidate should be entrepreneurial minded and preferably has some healthcare application and HL7 experience.",
