            "utterance": "Network Administrator",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job DescriptionConfiguration and troubleshooting of network, Internet and email problems for users. Hands on Experience on Fortinet and Cyberoam Firewall. Hands on Experience on Cisco, Brocade and Netgear products like Switch, Router, Access points",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Configuration and troubleshooting of network, Internet and email problems for users. Hands on Experience on Fortinet and Cyberoam Firewall. Hands on Experience on Cisco, Brocade and Netgear products like Switch, Router, Access points etc. IP Addressing and Subnetting Familiar with routing protocols (EIGRP, OSPF, BGP). Knowledge of VLAN, VTP & also configuration of VLANs, spanning- tree on switches. Configuration knowledge & Hands on Experience of Cisco, Brocade and Netgear products. Installation, Configuration and troubleshooting of switches, Access points, routers, Firewalls. Co- ordination with ISP Team for Internet related issues & new requirements/ changes in network. Creating & updating required documentation of network for future references. Monitoring auto logs backup of firewall system enabled & updating concern team. Taking regular backup of system configurations for future references & require troubleshooting in case of failure.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
