          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "10Decoders Technologies will train you in Java, Enterprise Java and other Web Technology for one month. We will place you in project immediately after successful completion of your training. Getting paid is completely based on your efforts in training and how much you can contribute to 10Decoders.",
