          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for outstanding engineers to implement the novel machine learning models for various complex problems and use cases.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The work will involve implementing an idea from a new research paper, building new tooling to optimise a large scale workflow or working out how the latest open source machine learning technologies can be applied in our problem space.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We work very closely with our technology researchers and adapt the direction of our work as exciting new ideas emerge. You will be a part of a team that handles all the processes from data collection, cleaning, and preprocessing, to training models and deploying them to production.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The ideal candidate will be passionate about artificial intelligence and stay up-to-date with the latest developments in the field.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What are we looking for?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The candidate should have knowledge in some of these areas, should have interest and desire to learn the others:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of numerical programming in Python using libraries such as Pandas, NumPy and tools such as Anaconda, Plotly, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Analyzing the ML algorithms that could be used to solve a given problem and ranking them by their success probability",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implemented deep learning solutions either commercially or as a personal project.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Defining the preprocessing or feature engineering to be done on a given dataset",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Training models and tuning their hyperparameters",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in NLP or Computer Vision on deep learning frameworks such as TensorFlow, Keras or PyTorch.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with distributed compute platforms including areas such as package management, security implementation and containerisation (Docker).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to engineer and own solutions that will be relied upon by many users and deployed to machines in large compute clusters.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of version control with branching and merging in GitHub or BitBucket.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in working with cloud computing. (AWS, Google or Azure).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implementing microservices in Python for serving ML models using Flask or equivalent framework.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of Test Driven Development (TDD) using Pytest or Unit test in Python.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Technical writing is a nice to have skill for writing technical documents, process notes, technical blogs, development stories, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This is a challenging role requiring you to combine technical knowledge and engineering skills with the ability to take on the hard data science challenges.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualification :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative subject - Computer Science, Mathematics, Statistics or Engineering",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Selection procedure :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The selection process consists of the following steps:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Shortlisting of Profiles (Resume) - Shortlisted based on information provided by you in your resume.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Coding Round [1 Hour] - You will be provided with one or more use cases and data with access to a cloud instance. You will need to write and execute the program to resolve the problem.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Technical Interview - This will happen if and after you clear the Coding Round. You could be asked questions about technology in general, best practices and approaches and solutions that you used to solve the problem given to you in the coding round.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Social Discussion - This will be a general discussion to understand you better in terms of your team skills and your passion and appetite for technology and growth.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Send us your resume to hr@quantrium-tech.com and for further Details, Contact: +91 9176663397",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Wordpress Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Do you want to join one of the fastest-growing Digital Agencies in Punjab? *Infino* is looking for an experienced WordPress Developer, having great skills and the ability to solve unique complex and technical web problems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you live and breathe the fundamentals of web design and want to command an impressive portfolio, then Rayana Web is the best place for you. We have collaborated with international clients around the globe, and have successfully completed major projects with our proven industry experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Infino *offers a platform to enhance your development skills and impart your knowledge under the guidance of industry experts. Our clients are listed in Fortune 500 companies or have ROI in millions each day. A candidate who wants to unplug from the surroundings and wants to live in a professionally driven environment where the emphasis is put on developing coding analytics, collaborative work ethic and cutting-edge coding skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working at Infino: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Life at Rayana web is very happening. The company focuses on personality development by arranging various kinds of fun and educational activities. Time-to-time special activities, movies, trips and dinner etc. are organized to create a friendly environment and better coordination among the employees. Moreover, various perks are given based on the performance and efforts of the individual.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "_Infino is looking for highly talented and motivated individuals, with a minimum of 3-6 years of experience, to join its WordPress team._*",
