          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Flutter developer with good leadership qualities and solid experience in flutter development. The ideal candidate must display excellent written and oral skills with demonstrated interpersonal abilities and must be able to work in a varied fast paced environment, as well as the ability to self-manage and work independently.",
