          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We have been empowering clients with ideas for the last 15 years and offer solutions in Design, Brand Communication, and Advertising. Our Strategies make brands more sustainable and profitable. The solution design approach we follow positions them in a better perspective and contribute towards business growth increasing the ROI",
