            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Hewlett Packard Enterprise (HPE) advances the way people live and work. We bring together curious minds to create breakthrough technology solutions, helping our customers make their mark on the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "HPE Global IT is immediately seeking a DevOps Engineer.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Overview: Do you consider yourself a software engineer and leader with a tenacious attitude? Are you someone who can jump in and contribute to a dynamic team environment. Are you passionate about development, automation, and container technologies?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The DevOps Engineer will be part of the Global ITs Cloud Services team in the Infrastructure and Operations organization and will report to the Sr. Manager of Cloud Services. The ideal candidate will have a demonstrated experience in software engineering, cloud native technologies DevOps automation frameworks, and architecture / deploying and managing CI/CD pipelines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Requirements:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to execute on multiple projects as an engineer with internal and outsourced partners responsible for all stages of design and development for the supported platforms. Responsibilities includes solution design, analysis, coding, testing, documentation, integration and operations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Drive innovation and integration of new technologies into projects and activities in the Global IT organization.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Champion DevOps best practices, including improved scalability, performance, reliability, and speed to market",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Professional software engineering experience in integration areas including container orchestration, authentication & authorization, micro-services architectures, distributed object storage software, image repositories, and configuration management.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps experience with CI/CD pipelines, automated testing platforms, site reliability engineering, and chaos monkey testing.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software expertise in distributed systems and services models REST-based services as well as integration with 3rd party web services, orchestration systems, control and management planes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Highly motivated and ability to provide self-directed execution",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge and Skills:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with containers, and micro-services in a production environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with API-driven integration across multiple sub-systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience defining robust APIs and providing implementations using a micro-services architecture model.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with a modern, CI/CD implementations (Jenkins, CircleCI, Gitlab CI, etc.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with a Secret Management platforms (Hashicorp Vault)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2-5 years development experience with Python, Node or Go (or C#, C++, C, Java, JavaScript) or similar programming languages",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2-5 years of experience in designing, building and supporting (in DevOps fashion) multi-tenant software platforms.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have Linux or Unix software development expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in automating large-scale deployments with modern tools (Ansible, Ansible Tower, Chef, Puppet).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with various container run-times and orchestration platforms (Docker, Containerd/cri, Swarm, K8s, Mesos).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with container registries (DTR/Jfrog/Harbor) and how to manage security/governance for docker containers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Great verbal and written communication skills and ability to effectively communicate product architectures and design proposals.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Demonstrated ability to collaborate across teams and larger organization.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent analytical and problem solving skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelors degree in Computer Science (or related field and a minimum of 2 years of related experience) or 5+ years of equivalent working experience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Soft Skills:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent communication skills (written & verbal)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good Documentation Skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good Presentation Skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build and maintain relationships with stakeholders",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we can offer you:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Extensive benefits, a competitive salary and participation in the shared values and purpose that make Hewlett Packard Enterprise one of the world´s most attractive employers! At HPE, our goal is to provide equal opportunities, flexible work-life balance, and constantly evolving career growth.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are looking for challenges in an exciting, supportive and international work environment, then we definitely want to hear from you. Continue the conversation by clicking apply now below, or directly via our Careers Portal at www.hpe.com/careers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join us and make your mark!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Find out more about us and follow us on:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "https://www.facebook.com/HPECareers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "https://twitter.com/HPE_Careers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "HPE is an Equal Employment Opportunity/ Veterans/Disabled/LGBT and Affirmative Action employer. We are committed to diversity and building a team that represents a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. We do not discriminate and all decisions we make are made on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need. Our goal is to be one global diverse team that is representative of our customers, in an inclusive environment where we can continue to innovate and grow together.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "#GlobalITIN",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "_Apply your C#, _Java,_ and/or JavaScript server skills to build next-generation back-end systems that __improve the health, well-being, and security for millions of people. Grow your current skills and learn new ones as you partner with industry thought leaders, system architects, front-end developers, and a supportive QA team. _",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are seeking skilled server developers who can enthusiastically build next generation FinTech and IoT software to improve health, well-being, and security that will benefit millions of peoples. Candidates should be passionate about coding robust, reliable, and scalable products. The ideal candidate will demonstrate expertise with server-based development using .Net and Java and ideally with additional technologies including Node.js, PHP Laravel and C++.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with team-based development using agile principles, Jira and git will be very helpful. Strong communication and collaboration skills will be essential. The candidate should be knowledgeable on current technologies and able to share new ideas and energy with the team and our customers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Company*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Founded in 2001 as one of the world’s first mobile application development companies, OpenPath Products provides advanced software engineering and quality assurance services to its world-wide clientele. Based in historic and beautiful Annapolis, Maryland, we develop for the Internet of Things, Financial Tech, media streaming and next generation technologies. We have delivered thousands of products for some of the largest and most innovative companies in the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At OpenPath Products you will continue to grow your skills while doing exciting and meaningful work. This is not a “program to spec” position. Your out-of-the box thinking, energy, and enthusiasm will be valued and will have a direct impact on our team and projects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Position*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will participate in requirements gathering, technical design, agile development, and customer interactions. You will apply your existing skills while staying abreast of the latest trends and tools. Most deployments will be cloud-based, but there is no “one size fits all” for every project. You will be expected to think through the gray areas of requirements and work with the team to map out a clear path for project success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Skills and Experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• C# and/or Java language expertise, including using generics",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience designing and developing building RESTful APIs",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Hands-on experience with messaging-based architectures using JMS, MQTT, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• JavaScript (Node.js), PHP and C++ server development skills also highly desirable",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Understanding of networking principles, including the OSI model and the use of Wireshark",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Ability to conduct UML and database modeling",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Organized, detail oriented, and a proven ability to troubleshoot",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• System-level architecture and documentation experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Requirements documentation and traceability experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why Should You Apply?*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "OpenPath Products provides a unique balance of benefits and opportunities that are hard to find in today’s working world. We offer 19 years of stability, but we are never stagnant. We are always learning new technologies and bringing new ideas to solve tough problems. You will have many opportunities to grow and advance. We offer Excellent Health Insurance, Vision, Dental, Life, LTD and a 401k plan. Salary is commensurate with experience. We believe in continuous education and continuous improvement. Everyone’s opinion here matters and no one is just a “cog in the machine”.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are passionate about producing, learning and growing while doing meaningful work, OpenPath Products may be the place for you.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Type: Full-time",
            "intent": "job_description"
