          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you will do:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This Senior Full Stack Java Developer role will have a significant impact on the entire SDLC including requirements gathering, design, development, implementation, and maintenance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop high quality, secure, scalable, web-based software in an Agile environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Demonstrate an ability to rapidly deliver new product development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Champion clean code and elegantly simple design",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work collaboratively in a team to understand and deliver on our clients’ needs",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At LPL, we believe that objective financial guidance is a fundamental need for everyone. As the nation’s leading independent broker-dealer, we offer an integrated platform of proprietary technology, brokerage, and investment advisor services. We provide you with a work environment that encourages your creativity and growth, a leadership team that is supportive and responsive, and the opportunity to create a career that has no limits, only amazing potential.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are one team on one mission. We take care of our advisors, so they can take care of their clients.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Because our company is not too big and not too small, you can seize the opportunity to make a real impact. We are committed to supporting workplace equality, and we embrace the different perspectives and backgrounds of our employees.We also care for our communities, and we encourage our employees to do the same. This creates an environment in which you can do your best work.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Want to hear from our employees on what it’s like to work at LPL? Watch this!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We take social responsibility seriously. Learn more here",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Want to see info on our benefits? Learn more here",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join the LPL team and help us make a difference by turning life’s aspirations into financial realities. Please log in or create an account to apply to this position. Principals only. EOE.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Information on Interviews:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "LPL will only communicate with a job applicant directly from an @lpl.com email address and will never conduct an interview online or in a chatroom forum. During an interview, LPL will not request any form of payment from the applicant, or information regarding an applicant’s bank or credit card. Should you have any questions regarding the application process, please contact LPL’s Human Resources Solutions Center at (800) 877-7210.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sentieo is powering the future of financial and corporate research in a $30B market. Our vision is to create a world where competitive organizations have the insights they need to win. Built by former hedge fund analysts, we empower competitive investors and corporations to rapidly discover insights so they can make smarter investments and execute winning strategies. Supporting a global customer base of over 900 clients, we are excited to propel Sentieo into the next phase of our company’s global growth - from advanced, unprecedented product development to accelerated team scaling and expansion. Join our team as we reimagine the future of fintech.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a DevOps Engineer, you'll be responsible for building and maintaining the servers and infrastructure and help us scale, automate and monitor the growing infrastructure at Sentieo. You will be playing a key role in shaping the architecture of company that is growing exponentially.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your key responsibilities would be:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Work on existing AWS infrastructure and scaling.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Implement processes to automate deployments of various applications and services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Assist development teams with any infrastructure needs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Diagnose complex issues affecting performance and scaling.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Review,monitoring and setup alerts for all the various services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Help with cost optimization of infrastructure.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Work with terabytes of data.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Requirements:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-2 to 4 years of relevant experience in either systems engineering, infrastructure engineering or DevOps engineering role.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Sound knowledge of Linux (ubuntu server preferred), Linux containers and deployment methodologies (blue,green methodologies preferred).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Hands on experience with AWS services (EC2, VPC/Private cloud configurations, elasticache, Route53, and others).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Experience working with Jenkins and CI/CD pipelines.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Knowledge of Configuration Management tools such as- Puppet, Chef, Ansible.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Hands on experience on working with ELK (Elasticsearch, Logstash and Kibana) stack.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Experience with deploying and maintaining high traffic infrastructure (performance testing is a plus).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Hands on experience with database performance analysis (NoSQL/MongoDB) and scaling.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Hands on experience with scripting languages (high five on python and/or shell)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Knowledge of Monitoring framework like Nagios, Datadog, New Relic.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Good knowledge of git.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Experience with web servers and application load balancing using Nginx/HAProxy/ELB and handling/analyzing large amount of logs and anomaly detection.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Inquisitive nature to learn about new tools & technologies and implement the same",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "-Self starter who can implement with minimal guidance.",
            "intent": "job_description"
