            "utterance": "Java Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join Riverside Research's Satellite Collection Planning Suite Development Team! In this role, you will participate in the research, design, development, testing, optimization, and deployment of complex new solutions supporting mission critical programs for defense and intelligence users across the globe. You will work in a dynamic team on developing, debugging, and maintaining software deployed in a cloud environment. This candidate will support developing user interfaces, web services, and data and business logic portions of the code in both pre-mission planning and real-time execution phases of the mission planning process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The selected candidate will have experience developing applications in an agile environment leveraging established legacy C#/VB code. You will use your technical expertise and problem solving skills to develop a wide variety of operational grade software solutions to meet government defense and intelligence missions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• U.S. Citizenship required.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Must be eligible to obtain and maintain a TOP SECRET clearance",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• B.S. in computer science, engineering, or a related field and professional experience with an emphasis on full lifecycle systems development including system design, development, and maintenance/support.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 5+ years of strong demonstrated experience in full stack development using .NET and C# with Web Forms and MVC models.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Demonstrated experience working with relational databases (Microsoft SQL Server 2008 - 2016) and developing database-driven .NET applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Desired Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with web-based technologies, methodologies and architectures, including, MVC, JavaScript, CSS, Bootstrap, JQuery, AJAX, and JSON",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with database development and design principles, preferably Oracle",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with satellites, satellite sensor systems, mission planning, or similar domain knowledge",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Riverside Research strives to be one of America’s premier providers of independent, trusted technical and scientific expertise. As we continue to add experienced, technically astute staff, we are looking for highly motivated, talented team members that can help our DoD and Intelligence Community (IC) customers continue delivery of world class programs. As a not-for-profit, technology-oriented Defense Company, we believe service to customers and support of our staff is our mission. Our goal is to serve as a destination company by providing an industry-leading, positive, and rewarding employee experience for all who join us. We aspire to be a valued partner to our customers and to earn their trust through our unwavering commitment to achieve timely, innovative, cost-effective and mission-focused solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "All positions at Riverside Research are subject to background investigations. Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background investigation including criminal history and identity check.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This contractor and subcontractor shall abide by the requirements of 41 CFR 60-741.5(a). This regulation prohibits discrimination against qualified individuals on the basis of disability, and requires affirmative action by covered prime contractors and subcontractors to employ and advance in employment qualified individuals with disabilities.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This contractor and subcontractor shall abide by the requirements of 41 CFR 60-300.5(a). This regulation prohibits discrimination against qualified protected veterans, and requires affirmative action by covered contractors and subcontractors to employ and advance in employment qualified protected veterans.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Backend Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Client",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Client is on a mission to create the Netflix of Gaming in order to cater to the largest and fastest growing segment of online entertainment. Client recently closed series B funding $ 18 Million USD company and it has grown at a record pace to achieve an install base of over 20MM in less than a year. Client has been hailed as the Start-up of the year, Technology, 2019 by Entrepreneur India and it is India’s fastest growing vernacular social arcade gaming platform which aspires to grow to a $1B venture by end of 2020.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Innovation and constructive disruption are at the core of what our client do. To cater to Bharat (T2-T5) audience and then scale globally, client hosts all its 70+ games on a single platform across multiple formats in 11+ regional languages and 60% of content on our platform is consumed in non- English languages. WinZO has also revolutionised the online payment system in the country with its unique concept of micro-transactions which is inspiring more and more fellow Indians to adopt digital payment mediums. Our comprehensive micro-influencer program and partnership with women and college students for vernacular translations are testament not only to our commitment to achieve efficiency and lean operations but also to our determination to financially empower women and students in the country.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What’s unique about Client?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "They’re fastest growing Company in the globally hottest market of Gaming! Fun Fact- Average Daily time spent per user on the client App is 55 mins which is 50% higher than the industry average. All the games hosted on WinZO are skill based and are compliant with all the regulatory frameworks by the Govt. of India. Client is one of the few firms operating in the segment which has a licence from the Government of India",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Client focus on team excellence and collaboration. Team is a collaboration of stellar achievers from their own fields. Tech team has alumni from IIT-KGP, IIT-D, NITs, NSIT/DCE who have joined us from Amazon, Oyo, Practo, Samsung, Code Nation etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Client is a product only company. We are building real time gaming servers, auto-scaling chat servers and data-intensive active recommendation engines. There are 5 million micro- transactions happening on our platform every day and clocking 1 billion multi-player gaming sessions a month concurrently. There are very few companies solving such complex tech challenges in the country. You get to take ownership of such complex and challenging tasks and build these grounds up",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we expect you to help us with:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Designing and developing scalable APIs for different clients used by our users.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Collaborate with multiple stakeholders to define, design, and ship new features",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Integrate third party APIs as and when required",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and Implementation of Data Storage Solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Code Optimization from time to time to enhance performance",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Write clean and thoroughly tested code which is reusable",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Come up with innovative ideas or suggest new/emerging technologies to enhance our tech stack",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Skills/Qualifications that we expect you to have:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "4-6 yrs, great pedigree. We need people with a depth of experience and exposure to working on problems of scale. Should be experienced in developing products on their own right from the coding till the deployment to production. While hiring, our focus should be looking at previous work and clearly understand whether his work at his previous company was handling such scale or not.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sound knowledge of REST Standards",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement security and data protection.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sound familiarity with at least one of the programming languages such as C#, JAVA, Javascript, Ruby, Erlang, Elixir",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience working with a relational database",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good to have knowledge of MongoDB/Redis/ElasticSearch/Kafka",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficiency with Git",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Must have good OOPS fundamentals",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good to have Computer Science fundamentals in operating systems, networks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong algorithm/data structures design and problem solving skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with cloud environments like AWS is a plus.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to diagnose and solve complex problems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bonus points if you have developed a real time application",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What do you get?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A chance to be a part of the next revolution and observe it from a close distance when we change the world together.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To collaborate with the best minds in the country and together accomplish even higher levels of excellence.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Opportunity to work on new and challenging problems and innovate.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Get complete ownership of the product and chance to conceptualise and implement your solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A swanky informal workspace in the heart of Delhi which defines our open and vibrant work culture.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
