            "utterance": "Knowledge of relational, in-memory, distributed and NoSQL databases",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience of implementing programming best practice, especially around scalability, automation, virtualisation, optimisation, availability and performance",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
