          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for an outstanding *Machine Learning Engineer* with an adaptable and productive working style which fits in a fast-moving startup. This role will start off with a 3-month contract leading to a full-time position in our company. The role requires an independent thinker with ML knowledge, able to use sophisticated and state of the art techniques to contribute to tasks like building an extraction algorithm which can read and evaluate information from resumes effectively. You must be able to translate technical concepts into implementable solutions, whilst communicating results and benefits clearly to your colleagues.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we are working on: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are currently working on a product which is an applicant tracking system. As a product with a huge scope for being an intelligent system to automatically complete mundane tasks, we would like to leverage the ample amount of research available out there in the machine learning space.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Many Human Resource personnel struggle with the repetitive task of going through every resume to decide whether the candidate fits the profile. Our machine learning algorithms are trained on tons of resumes to decide whether a candidate makes the cut or not.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement, evaluate and optimize algorithms and models for our information extraction and candidate scoring algorithms.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Use NLP/Machine Learning techniques including linear/logistic regression, decision trees, classification, entity recognition, ensembles, text mining to build models.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Selecting and transforming features, building and optimizing classifiers using machine learning techniques.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide software design and programming support to research projects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Skills: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At least 2 years hands on experience in the development of machine learning based systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience working with NLP techniques, entity recognition, predictive modeling, and other analytical techniques over structured as well as unstructured datasets.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to read, understand and implement the latest research papers from top conferences like NIPS, CVPR, and ICML.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong Python programming skills and working experience in libraries like Pandas and Numpy.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to quickly prototype solutions and perform critical analysis.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Us: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "FullThrottle Labs has a wide and diverse portfolio of B2B SAAS business productivity applications which include marketing automation software primarily targeted towards Y Combinator startups, team management software 'DixiApp' which has over 1500 companies using it globally, an identity resolution platform 'Truemailer', and finally a hiring automation platform 'PyjamaHR' that we've just launched in Q1 2020. Besides the above, we work with select Y Combinator startups and provide niche consulting in Automation & Machine Learning using our expertise in these areas. Having seen traction and growing revenue with incredible potential in the market, FullThrottle Labs is eager to scale rapidly. Join us to be a part of the journey!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Benefits/Perks: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "FullThrottle Labs offers an array of benefits including competitive salaries, equity options, free food and beverages and weekly team outings!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Location: * Bangalore (Koramangala - 8th Block)",
            "intent": "job_description"
