          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Senior JavaScript Developer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Looking for JavaScript Developer jobs in Bangalore? Would you like to take part in JavaScript expertise jobs in Pune? We are looking for an experienced JavaScript Developer in Pune and Bangalore. We are highly prioritizing over hiring a versatile Senior JavaScript Developer who can join Pattem Digital’s Engineering team. Being a successful professional, you would have full-stack engineering expertise with a strong base to implement robust front-end components. You would be working on an agile environment, with a team that would always focus on quality-driven development. You would require a user-focused mindset with more focus towards attention-to-detail as well as a strong usability sense. Know more about the role to apply for our JavaScript Developer jobs in Bangalore.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Know your work:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As our experienced JavaScript Developer in Pune, your contribution towards full designing, components, SDLC; implementing, and features for our platform would matter the most",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You would be working along with our Product Management, Engineering, and Design teams while you want to implement and design more reusable, robust, and top-notch front-end components.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Being our experienced JavaScript Developer in Pune, you would know to maintain your platform’s front-end assets meant for future and needs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As our Senior JavaScript Developer jobs in Pune, you would know about developing and building large-scale interactive web apps in HTML, Typescript, Angular or React, JavaScript , and CSS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "To apply for JavaScript Developer jobs in Bengaluru, you should have knowledge on back end services for building out APIs on the basis of your knowledge on relational databases and web servers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a part of our JavaScript Developer jobs in Bengaluru, you should facilitate the right requirements while you are gathering and translating the business requirements into your technical solution design",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you need to apply:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our ideal criteria for you to apply for Senior JavaScript Developer jobs in Pune would be 5+ years in software design, algorithm-based solutions, and web-based front end product development, HTML, CSS, JavaScript",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You should know how to write JavaScript codes and use programming languages like AngularJS, React, Ember Data, Redux, Node, Meteor, Mocha, jQuery, Sinon, Gulp, Grunt, Webpack, Browserify and Grommet",
