            "utterance": "We are an outsourcing company working for clients based around the world. We are looking for an iOS developer responsible for the development and maintenance of applications aimed at a range of iOS devices.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your primary focus will be the development of iOS applications and their integration with back-end services. You will be working alongside other engineers and developers working on different layers of the infrastructure.You will be part of a startup environment with a small, agile team that moves fast and uses cutting-edge technologies, tools, and processes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Therefore, a commitment to collaborative problem solving, sophisticated design, and the creation of quality products is essential.",
