          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who is TEKgile?*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a tech company headquartered in Trivandrum, Kerala, that works with our international partners to deliver modern apps and software for various types of businesses. We work with global companies and various clients to always push the limits of web and server applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why would I want to be a JavaScript Developer at TEKgile?*",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "TEKgile and our International partner company aims to continue its growth trajectory in Japan and have a variety of geospatial web app projects to work on. Software and app improvements are vital to the success of the company and are looking to grow our team to add new features to what is being offered. You will be working with our Product Manager, who is based in Japan as well as our Technical manager in Trivandrum. The team focuses on all product life cycle, bugs, and features that relate to the existing clients and future needs of the project.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The JavaScript Developer role is focused on building various web app dashboards focused around geospatial data, and continuing to grow the functionality and capabilities of our frameworks. Responsibilities include helping to grow the features of existing projects and new projects. You would be partnered with other team members to assist with various DevOps tasks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for someone that is: *",
            "intent": "job_description"
