            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer who is proficient with Java and Spring Boot. Your primary focus will be on developing RESTful services for our Microservice platform. You will work closely with the senior architects and leadership team. Your Responsibilities",
