          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If youre happiest in an agile environment, with complex projects to oversee, theres a digital revolution underway in the UK and at CGI you can help shape it. Our teams are bursting with talent and ideas, and are ready to help you deliver transformative digital work for high profile clients.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We need Senior DevOps Engineers to help further grow our digital teams of agile service design specialists within our Central Government Business, to build and deliver user centred services and solutions in partnership with our clients across England and Wales. You must already hold, or be eligible to hold, UK Security Clearance (SC level) to be considered.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build your career with us.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "It is an extraordinary time to be in business. As digital transformation continues to accelerate, CGI is at the center of this changesupporting our clients digital journeys and offering our professionals exciting career opportunities.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At CGI, our success comes from the talent and commitment of our professionals. As one team, we share the challenges and rewards that come from growing our company, which reinforces our culture of ownership. All of our professionals benefit from the value we collectively create.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be part of building one of the largest independent technology and business services firms in the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Learn more about CGI at www.cgi.com.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "No unsolicited agency referrals please.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "CGI is an equal opportunity employer.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your future duties and responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Senior DevOps Engineer your work will include a multitude interesting projects, learning modern tooling and techniques to facilitate cutting-edge products on a variety of cloud and bare-metal platforms. You will also get opportunities to lead projects as well as to contribute towards process and technology choices that help deliver the best solutions for our clients.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required qualifications to be successful in this role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Senior Engineers will need to show experience across the majority of the skills/experience below;",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Linux sysadmin experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Cloud platform experience (Azure, AWS, etc)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Networking experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• IaC tooling experience (terraform, etc)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Automated Configuration Management tooling (ansible, etc)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Problem solving experience, in particular around connectivity issues",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• An understanding of distributed systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Containerisation (Docker) and orchestration (Kubernetes) experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Secret Management experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Pipeline experience (Jenkins, Azure DevOps, etc)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• GitOps experience and an understanding of the importance of everything as code",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience in software development lifecycle (Agile/Lean methodologies)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• JIRA, collaboration experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Machine Learning",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ellie Mae is the leading cloud-based platform provider for the mortgage finance industry. Ellie Mae’s technology solutions enable lenders to originate more loans, reduce origination costs, and reduce the time to close, all while ensuring the highest levels of compliance, quality and efficiency. Visit ‪ EllieMae.com to learn more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a Senior Data Scientist that will help us discover the information hidden in vast amounts of data and documents and help us make smarter decisions to deliver even better products. You will have strong Deep Learning and Python programming skills.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your primary focus will be in applying computer vision and NLP techniques on large number of documents, doing statistical analysis, and building high quality prediction systems integrated with our products. In that role, you will work closely with product management as well as application development teams.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities & Objectives",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Participate in discovery processes collaborating with key stakeholders to identify business requirements and expected outcomes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Develop Neural Network models for information extraction from mortgage documents using Computer Vision and NLP techniques.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Perform ad-hoc analysis and present results in a clear manner to a wide audience and key stake holders.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Design experiments, test hypotheses, and build models. Conduct advanced data analysis and highly complex designs algorithm.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Apply advanced statistical, predictive and machine learning modeling techniques to build, maintain, and improve on multiple real-time decision systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Collaborate with development teams on deploying models to production environment to support ML-driven product features.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Define business-specific performance metrics to measure model effectiveness. Monitor and improve metrics over time for models used in production environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Qualifications and Skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· M.Sc. in mathematics, statistics or M.S./M.E./M.Tech. in computer science or related field; Ph.D. degree preferred.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Overall experience of 7-9 years in software development and 3 + years of relevant quantitative and qualitative research and analytics experience using image processing and computer vision.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Great communication skills and ability to convey complex topics to a cross-functional audience.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience in building production-grade Neural Network models using CV or NLP techniques.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Excellent understanding of machine learning techniques and algorithms, such as k-NN, Naive Bayes, SVM, Decision Forests, Neural Networks, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience with Deep Learning frameworks, such as TensorFlow, PyTorch, MxNet.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience with common data science toolkits, such as Sklearn, NumPy and MLib. Excellence in at least one of these is highly desirable.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Good applied statistics skills, such as distributions, statistical testing, and regression.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Hands on with query languages such as SQL, Hive, Pig and NoSQL databases.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Hands on with Bigdata, Python and PySpark",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "· Experience in Databricks environment and OCR based library -Tesseract / Nuance / AWS Textract will be an added advantage.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ellie Mae is an equal opportunity and affirmative action employer. Women, minorities, people with disabilities, and veterans are encouraged to apply.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We do not accept resumes from headhunters, placement agencies, or other suppliers that have not signed a formal agreement with us.",
            "intent": "job_description"
