          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Avalara",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re building cloud-based tax compliance solutions to handle every transaction in the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Imagine every transaction you make — every tank of gas, cup of coffee, or pair of sneakers, every movie ticket, meal kit, or streamed song, every sensor-to-sensor ping. Nearly every time you make a purchase, physical or digital, there’s an accompanying unique and nuanced tax compliance calculation.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The logic behind calculating taxes — the rules, rates, and boundaries — is a global, layered, three-dimensional mess of complexity, with compliance dictated by governments and applied by every business, every day.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Avalara works with businesses of all sizes, all over the world — from corner stores to gigantic global retailers — to calculate tax accurately and automatically, at speeds measured in milliseconds.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "That’s a massive technical challenge, in terms of scale, reliability, and complexity, and we do it better than anyone. That’s why we’re growing fast.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Headquartered in Seattle, Avalara has offices across the U.S. and around the world, in Belgium, Brazil, Canada, India, and the U.K.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Avalara is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, creed, religion, age, gender, national orientation, disability, sexual orientation, or any other factor protected by law.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a candidate with experience in various AWS services such as Beanstalk, CloudFormation, API Gateway, Lambda Functions, DynamoDB, RDS, Autoscaling, Security Groups, VPC Subnets, etc. The applicant should have the ability to design, deploy, and support complex AWS cloud architecture. AWS Certified Solutions Architect or AWS Certified SysOps Administrators will be preferred. She or he should have experience in implementing CI/CD using Chef, Vagrant, Jenkins, Gitlab, Bamboo, Artifactory, etc. Scripting knowledge is a must.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
