            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We hiring for Ahmedabad's most prestigious IT company. our client is providing IT consulting and solution provider of next-gen business collaborate with customers across the world. With tremendous experience, comprehensive intelligence system across diverse industries and domains, we work with customers to turn them into the most successful and high-performance organizations.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Established in 2017, located in headquartered at Ahmedabad, India with presence in Canada, Australia and the USA. The commitment to quality and the spirit to innovate has made us serve over 20+ clients across 7 countries with 100% client retention.",
