          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP started in 1972 as a team of five colleagues with a desire to do something new. Together, they changed enterprise software and reinvented how business was done. Today, as a market leader in enterprise application software, we remain true to our roots. That’s why we engineer solutions to fuel innovation, foster equality and spread opportunity for our employees and customers across borders and cultures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP values the entrepreneurial spirit, fostering creativity and building lasting relationships with our employees. We know that a diverse and inclusive workforce keeps us competitive and provides opportunities for all. We believe that together we can transform industries, grow economics, lift up societies and sustain our environment. Because it’s the best-run businesses that make the world run better and improve people’s lives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ariba, an SAP company, is the world’s business commerce network. We help companies extend their business commerce processes into the Cloud, where they can use our Procurement solutions and the Ariba Network to find opportunities to cut costs, reduce risk, and grow revenue through better collaboration with trading partners. The Ariba Network is the world’s largest trading partner community with more than $600B of commerce flowing through and more than 1.7 million businesses in 190 countries around the world, with a new business joining Ariba Network every two minutes. Together with SAP, we are combining the best of both companies to fuel a whole new way of doing business in today's digital economy.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Curious? Take a peek into Ariba products: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TeaUEBvH5UU",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Deliver across the entire app life cycle –concept, design, build, deploy, test, release to app stores and support",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working directly with developers and product managers to conceptualize, build, test and realize products",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Gather requirements around functionality and translate those requirements into elegant functional solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Build prototypes at tech scoping stage of projects",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working along the web developers to create and maintain a robust framework to support the app and working with the front end developers to build the interface with focus on usability features",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Create compelling device specific user interfaces and experiences",
