          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "being developed. Coming in with an understanding of the importance of end-to-end software development-such as Agile frameworks-is key. And best of all, you'll be working with and sharing ideas, information and innovation with our global team of technologists from all over the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
