            "utterance": "Powerbi + Qlik Developer 1. Solid T-SQL knowledge (Stored Procedures) 2. Optimization/Indexing 3. SSAS (Tabular - DAX), SSRS 4. PowerBI experience, min 3 years (other BI tools meriting) 5. Experience of migration Qlikview -> PowerBI – HIGHLY valued 6. Sharepoint 7. Ability to translate business needs into IT related solutions 8. Experience of agile methods is a plus, as well as data warehouse technologies 9. Strong English language skills Besides the above the person should have experience in Qlik, preferable including ”Qlik Backend”, i.e Script and ETL and: 1. Knowledge within Qlik QDF. 2. Way of working using Qlik ETL. 3. QMC experience.",
