            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tivix is a business unit of Kellton Tech, that focused on digital product development. Kellton Tech is a public listed, CMMi Level 5 company that aims to be one of the fastest emerging IT services company in India. Company today has presence in US, EMEA and Asia. We have development centres in Gurgaon, Hyderabad, Europe and the US. We have at present major focus on Digital Transformation, Microsoft Technologies, Enterprise Consumer Mobile Application Solutions and Open Source Solutions. We are also into Internet of Things (IoT), ERP, Big Data and Cloud computing.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tivix is a team of 72+ engineers, designers and product managers. We're headquartered in San Francisco, and with other offices in New York, Portland, Poland, London and India. We’re looking to add a key engineering team member to work closely with our clients and internal team members to deliver high-quality software products, features and updates. We work well with people who are smart, continuous learners and take professionalism seriously (while having fun).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our team members know how to support one another while working hard to make clients happy. Because everyone is empowered at Tivix, new team members enjoy making a difference right away and progressing quickly in responsibility and ownership.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "This is an on-site position with twice a week work-from-home flexibility.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Would you like to join our rockstar team?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
