            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Cisco is transforming the networking industry. To make this happen, we are heavily investing in team responsible for The Network. Intuitive. We are disrupting the industry by building a new networking platform that can learn, adapt, and secure itself at the speed of today’s businesses. This Digital Network Architecture platform automates network management and provides our customers with state-of-the-art analytics and insights. This team's innovations span artificial intelligence, machine learning, analytics, IoT, security, automation, and more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who You'll Work With",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for software engineering and technology visionaries to join the DNA platform team. This includes building highly reliable and scalable services, and designing innovative full stack technical solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As we build the new network, we need you to bring your new ideas and enthusiasm to jump into opportunities, transforming industries as they emerge and grow. You will collaborate with a creative team to take on some of the toughest challenges in the tech world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Are you passionate about working on groundbreaking technology with global impact? Are you pumped about making billions of connections happen? Will you be our next hire?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who You Are",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The ideal candidate must enjoy working in a fast-paced dynamic environment with a “take-charge” / “can-do” attitude and is able to demonstrate flexibility and resiliency. Successful candidate must be self-sufficient and be able to work with minimal supervision. Work with geographically distributed teams across different time zones.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DNA Platform will be enabling the Network to work with the larger IT Ecosystem, exchanging data seamlessly. You will be building Integration tools and solutions on top of the DNA Platform to enable this interaction. You have experience with building industry leading integration tools, integration components and adapters. You will need to enable integrations to happen at world class scale, through one of the largest enterprise ecosystems in the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsible for the delivery of an entire software product or part of a project, including design, implementation, testing, integration (in-house) and documentation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Lead mixed, cross-functional and multi-cultural project teams",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Monitor, track and communicate project status",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to work with Product Management and Solution Management on refining product requirements and creating technical requirements, test cases, design specifications and development tasks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop and test software in accordance with requirements, test cases and design documentation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Guarantee the compliances of the QA rules and guidelines",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Document developed software applications and tools",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Deliver defined parts of a product, including design, implementation, testing, integration (in-house) and documentation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Maintain and fix bugs",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide 2nd and 3rd level support",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in investigating issues in production environments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide guidance and best practices to implementation projects",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Customer service-oriented attitude, top-notch time management, and quality driven designs",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Bachelor's degree (or above) in engineering/computer science with an overall work experience of 8+ years.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong JS development experience of building web applications using React, Angular or other client side application frameworks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Expert skills in application / backend engineering, developing REST APIs and micro-services, DB (SQL/NoSQL) persistence.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid foundation in data structures, algorithms, and object oriented Design",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Expert skills in NodeJS, ES6, Babel, Webpack, React / Angular, Postgres / MongoDB, HTLM, CSS, Jasmine / Mocha / Jest, CodeceptJS",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Desired Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiar with AWS or other Cloud environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Product engineering experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be highly flexible and adaptable and demonstrate passion for product development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with the full web stack performance optimization techniques",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Respond to internal customers promptly and competently",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work with Solution and Product Management on Customer Software Solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Deliver standard, easy to deploy and configure Customer Software Solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proactively work to develop and maintain good working relationships within the department, company and customers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Prior experience with network domain",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "#WeAreCisco, where each person is unique, but we bring our talents to work as a team and make a difference powering an inclusive future for all.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We embrace digital, and help our customers implement change in their digital businesses. Some may think we’re “old” (36 years strong) and only about hardware, but we’re also a software company. And a security company. We even invented an intuitive network that adapts, predicts, learns and protects. No other company can do what we do – you can’t put us in a box!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "But “Digital Transformation” is an empty buzz phrase without a culture that allows for innovation, creativity, and yes, even failure (if you learn from it.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Day to day, we focus on the give and take. We give our best, give our egos a break, and give of ourselves (because giving back is built into our DNA.) We take accountability, bold steps, and take difference to heart. Because without diversity of thought and a dedication to equality for all, there is no moving forward.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "So, you have colorful hair? Don’t care. Tattoos? Show off your ink. Like polka dots? That’s cool. Pop culture geek? Many of us are. Passion for technology and world changing? Be you, with us!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "PHP Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Summary",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are hiring fresher / experience PHP Developer responsible for developing web applications. Your primary focus will be the development of all server-side logic. You will also be responsible for integrating the front-end elements built by your co-workers into the application. Therefore, a basic understanding of front-end technologies is necessary as well.",
