          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our Purpose and Challenges",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "With over 47% market-share, MakeMyTrip is India’s first and biggest travel company. In fact, one in every four passengers at an airport is our customer. Driven by the desire to provide an exceptional travel experience for our customers, we have continuously stayed ahead of the curve by developing technology and products to meet the ever-changing demands of the rapidly evolving travel ecosystem.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are currently solving multiple challenging problems, including -",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to bring the next 100 million users to our platform?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to leverage customer insights to create a truly personalised experience for users?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to create a delightful experience for our users, to make travel synonymous to MMT?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If this excites you, join us for a rewarding, fulfilling and enriching career.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "“Not only do we make the best trips for our customers, we also promise the trip of a lifetime to our employees! Everyday, our teams solve challenging problems for millions of users by leveraging the latest technology, while having loads of fun. Every day is a new trip for them, and that is precisely why we call them Trippers!”",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Sanjay Mohan, Group CTO, MakeMyTrip",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the opportunity",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you’ll be doing:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll skilfully deploy, automate, maintain, troubleshoot and constantly improve the systems that will keep the backend infrastructure running smoothly.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll competently handle automation of the cluster management for various components like PDT, Kafka, EMR(Spark), S3 integration and workflow/DAG schedulers, etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll proficiently own and execute deployment and maintenance of a cloud-based business intelligence SaaS solution.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What you’ll bring to the team:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll bring outstanding expertise in developing and automating tech stack on AWS technologies (e.g. EC2, RDS, ELB, EBD, S3, VPC, Glacier, IAM, CloudWatch, KMS, EMR, Athena, Containers(Docker)) to develop and maintain cloud infrastructure with strong emphasis on best practices with cloud security.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have mad skills as a DevOps Engineer in a 24x7 uptime Amazon AWS environment, including automation experience with configuration management tools like Ansible.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have experience in analyzing and resolving complex infrastructure resources and application deployment issues.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Interview Process & Prep Notes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Coding Assessment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Scripting Languages, Jenkins, Ansible, Docker",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Prior experience in deployment tools ,a strong familiarity with Linux and shell environments, and in depth programming experience in scripting languages such as Bash, Perl, Python, and Ruby.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Assessment On Big Data Technologies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Hbase, Hive, Hadoop",
            "intent": "job_description"
