          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DBRS Morningstar is a global credit ratings business, currently with 700 employees in eight offices globally. Formed through the July 2019 acquisition of DBRS by Morningstar, Inc., the ratings business is the fourth-largest provider of credit ratings in the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DBRS Morningstar is committed to empowering investor success, serving the market through leading-edge technology and raising the bar for the industry. DBRS Morningstar is a market leader in Canada, the U.S. and Europe in multiple asset classes.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DBRS Morningstar rates more than 2,600 issuers and 54,000 securities worldwide and is driven to bringing more clarity, diversity of opinion, and responsiveness to the ratings process. DBRS Morningstar’s approach and size provide the agility to respond to customers’ needs, while being large enough to provide the necessary expertise and resources.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Wordpress Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Corporate Overview",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Founded in 2005, DCKAP is on the path to creating a global digital commerce community for brands and companies in the commerce space. Entrepreneurship is in our DNA and it fuels our innovations helping us develop products and solutions. DCKAP is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive organisational culture.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DCKAP provides Digital Commerce Products and Solutions for organisations of all sizes to make the merchant’s life easier. Our platform includes Cloras, Productimize, flexiPIM, VizB and QA Touch. Our cloud-based product suite is widely used by 100+ businesses globally.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are headquartered in Austin, TX with an office in Chennai, TN, India.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why work at DCKAP?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At DCKAP you will have the opportunity to be part of a highly active ecosystem which is transforming the way the world looks at eCommerce. You will be responsible for both back-end and front-end development, including creating WordPress themes and plugins.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Primary Job Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Hands-on software development skills, deep technical expertise across the entire software delivery process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will work closely with the Marketing team to write well documented code, design, implement and manage the WordPress websites.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Requirements:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent knowledge of WordPress, PHP, MySQL, CSS, HTML and jQuery.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience creating custom WordPress CMS websites and plugins using the best practice.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Theme/template integration and creation of custom post types.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience working on any one of the page builders is an added advantage.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong understanding of latest industry trends and content management systems.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience using SVN software and GIT.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good organisational skills with the ability to track and prioritise numerous tasks.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proactive personality with a proven track record of following through and delivering on responsibilities.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Highly adaptive and capable of being an individual contributor and working as part of a team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Alone we can do so little. TOGETHER we can aim for the sky",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DCKAP is an equal opportunity employer. As a diversified company, we’re trying to address the gender dominated workforce. 50% of our employees are women starting from a beginner to a leadership role. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, colour, religion, national origin, pregnancy status, sex, age, marital status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, or any other characteristics protected by applicable laws, regulations and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
