          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a Senior Data Scientist to help us create artificial intelligence and machine learning products. Responsibilities will include building end to end Machine Learning Pipeline. Understanding the problem, data preprocessing, creating machine learning models, deployment and retraining systems. To do this job successfully, you need exceptional skills in statistics, programming, python, machine learning algorithms, frameworks (such as Tensorflow), libraries and tools. You should be able and interested in a fast paced, output oriented environment with a startup mindset.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
