            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your ultimate goal will be to shape and build efficient self-learning applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "•Study and transform data - Has strong expertise in Data Pre-processing and Feature Engineering •Build ETL Pipelines and Data Streams for the models •Designing and developing machine learning and deep learning systems in Classical Machine Learning, Computer Vision and NLP •Research and implement appropriate ML algorithms and tools •Running machine learning tests and experiments •Deployment on Production •Implementing appropriate ML algorithms",
