            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient in testing the front-end code for supported browsers and devices",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient demonstrated experience in incorporating reliable unit and end-to-end testing to UI frameworks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our employees are incredible individuals - that’s the only kind we hire - and we’re committed to their well-being and supporting their efforts to become the best they can be, both at work and in life. This includes offering flexible working hours, unlimited PTO, Summer Fridays, an inclusive work environment (D&I Council), and gym reimbursement for physical well-being.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re growing rapidly and were recently named #1 Fastest-Growing Fintech Company on the Inc. 5000, and #1 Fastest-Growing Software Company in NY in Deloitte’s Technology Fast 500. If you have ever wanted to jump on a rocket ship as it’s taking off, now is your chance!",
