          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "NOTE: This position is being published to build our candidate pipeline for future opportunities. If an opportunity opens that matches your qualifications, we will reach out to you at that time if there is a mutual interest. We appreciate your interest in Kapsch.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Kapsch TrafficCom North America is seeking resumes for Java Developers for future positions. In this role, you would work as part of the back-end development team to develop, improve, and maintain multiple products designed on the principles of an N-tier architecture. The main products are mission-critical transaction processing systems, similar to a clearing-house application, with supporting applications that provide diagnostics and infrastructure monitoring. The developer will design software components for some of the most complex traffic management systems using object-oriented design principles.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
