            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a STEM Education provider and on expansion to the international market. Research & Training are the most important technical roles in our company structure. It involves product development research, testing, validation and curriculum building activities in Robotics, 3D printing, IoT, Drones, Ml & AI for K-12 students.",
