          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Consilium Software",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Consilium Software is an enterprise software company, our software greatly improves customer's experience through real-time integration, control & orchestration of multi-channel communications solutions. Consilium specializes in Business Communication Operation management (BCOM), Computer Telephony Integration (CTI) and Customer Relationship Management (CRM) integration. Consilium is also an Independent Software Vendor for Cisco's unified communications and contact center solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JavaScript Developer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Consilium Software:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Founded in 2007 in Singapore, Consilium Software and our Uni™ digital customer engagement platform have helped over 1,000 companies in more than 110 countries connect their employees with customers. Our choice of cloud-based and on-premise software powers 3 billion-plus interactions each year, simplifying the management of voice, video and digital channels.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Consilium conceives, develops and delivers enterprise software for unified communications (UC) and contact centers to power transformative Customer Experience Management (CEM.) Our software adds CRM integration, service automation and insight to leading collaboration technology vendors. Consilium UniCloud™, UniAgent™, UniCampaign™, UniDashboard™, UniRSM™ and UniVCX™ products enhance the performance and productivity levels of enterprise customers and service providers. Our solutions go beyond omni-channel to merge the contact center and CRM, creating fluid experiences with artificial intelligence (AI), bots and Robotic Process Automation (RPA.) Consilium is led by practitioners who have differentiated customer experiences through every major cycle of evolution for 32 continuous years. Consilium Software is incorporated in Singapore, with software development and engineering labs in India, and subsidiaries and branch offices in Malaysia (Kuala Lumpur), Taiwan (Taipei City), Indonesia (Jakarta), Thailand (Bangkok), Australia (Melbourne) and Canada (Toronto.).",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We encourage you to visit our website https://www.consiliuminc.com before the interview to get an overview of our company and products.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Consilium Software Products Road Map",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Consilium Software’s products are the foundation of our solutions portfolio and provide all the elements needed for enterprise unified communications, customer interaction management and business intelligence. These would primarily be in the area of",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Cloud and Premise based contact center applications, Artificiel Intelligence (AI)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Video Chat, Virtual Assistant",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Enterprise UC Applications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Mobile apps",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "CTI Applications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Analytics and Business Intelligenc",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a JavaScript Developer who is motivated to combine the art of design with the art of programming. Responsibilities will include implementing visual elements and their behaviours with user interactions. You will work with both front-end and back-end web developers to build client-server logic. You will also be bridging the gap between the visual elements and the server-side infrastructure, taking an active role on both sides, and defining how the application looks and functions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
