          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are hiring for Ahmedabad best reputed IT Company. our client is providing software development, IT support and digital marketing company providing affordable IT & digital services to all-size businesses across the globe. Over years, we have successfully helped companies all over the globe with their IT needs. , we offer website development, e-commerce development, mobile application development, social marketing services, managed IT services and digital marketing solutions. We provide our clients with highly reliable, secure and scalable business solutions as per their needs. Customer satisfaction is our top priority and we constantly strive to achieve this by providing the best solutions on time and every time.",
