            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Introduction",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software Developers at IBM are the backbone of our strategic initiatives to design, code, test, and provide industry-leading solutions that make the world run today - planes and trains take off on time, bank transactions complete in the blink of an eye and the world remains safe because of the work our software developers do. Whether you are working on projects internally or for a client, software development is critical to the success of IBM and our clients worldwide. At IBM, you will use the latest software development tools, techniques and approaches and work with leading minds in the industry to build solutions you can be proud of.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Role and Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As DevOps Engineer, you are responsible to setup and maintain GIT repository, DevOps tools like Jenkins, UCD, Docker, Kubernetes, Jfrog Artifactory, Cloud monitoring tools, Cloud security. You will automate daily tasks using Ansible, Puppet or chef.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Setup, configure and maintain GIT repos, Jenkins, UCD etc for multi hosting cloud environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working on Docker images and maintain Kubernetes clusters.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop and maintain the automation scripts using Ansible or other available tools.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Maintain and monitor cloud Kubernetes Clusters and patching when necessary.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working on Cloud security tools to keep application secured.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Participate in software development lifecycle, specifically infra design, execution and debugging required to achieve successful implementation of integrated solutions within the portfolio.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Technical and Professional Expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Minimum 6 -8 years of experience in IT industry",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Expertise in implementing and managing Devops CI/CD pipeline",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in DevOps automation tools. And Very well versed with DevOps Frameworks, Agile.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working knowledge of scripting using shell, Python, Ansible or puppet or chef.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience and good understanding in any of Cloud like AWS, Azure, Google cloud. IBM Cloud, Redhat OpenShift. Knowledge of Docker and Kubernetes is required.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficient in troubleshooting skills with proven abilities in resolving complex technical issues.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with working with ticketing tools (Service now is preferable)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Willing to take additional responsibilities to understand on-premise/legacy system and perform deployments as needed",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Preferred Technical and Professional Expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Middleware technologies knowledge or database knowledge is desirable",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience and well versed with Jira tool is a plus",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Basic understanding of IBM Cloud and Redhat OpenShift is a plus.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proven communication skills in a customer/stakeholder facing environment and provide support and fix the issues related with devops and cloud",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You love collaborative environments that use agile methodologies to encourage creative design thinking and find innovative ways to develop with cutting edge technologies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ambitious individual who can work under their own direction towards agreed targets/goals and with creative approach to work",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Intuitive individual with an ability to manage change and proven time management",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proven interpersonal skills while contributing to team effort by accomplishing related results as needed",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Up-to-date technical knowledge by attending educational workshops, reviewing publications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Business Unit",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We, at the IBM Chief Information Office (CIO) are a dynamic group of business, strategy and technology professionals, who provide top-of-the-line industry consulting, application and business process delivery, and follow agile values and principles. CIO is at the forefront of the digital reinvention of key applications used across IBM globally, providing value-led and asset-powered end-to-end solutions.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are a cross-functional organization that provides IT applications and infrastructure services to IBM Business Units and to IBMers worldwide. Our mission is to provide a productive environment for everyone at IBM. We do this by leading with Design to drive simplicity and ease of use, Engineering the systems that own the business, and Innovating to transform the business. We continually Deepen our Agile practices while ensuring we Secure the Enterprise.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Life @ IBM",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What matters to you when youre looking for your next career challenge?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Maybe you want to get involved in work that really changes the world? What about somewhere with incredible and diverse career and development opportunities where you can truly discover your passion? Are you looking for a culture of openness, collaboration and trust where everyone has a voice? What about all of these? If so, then IBM could be your next career challenge. Join us, not to do something better, but to attempt things you never thought possible.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Impact. Inclusion. Infinite Experiences. Do your best work ever.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IBMs greatest invention is the IBMer. We believe that progress is made through progressive thinking, progressive leadership, progressive policy and progressive action. IBMers believe that the application of intelligence, reason and science can improve business, society and the human condition. Restlessly reinventing since 1911, we are the largest technology and consulting employer in the world, with more than 380,000 IBMers serving clients in 170 countries.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Location Statement",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "For additional information about location requirements, please discuss with the recruiter following submission of your application.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Being You @ IBM",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IBM is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, pregnancy, disability, age, veteran status, or other characteristics. IBM is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
