          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "iOS Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Introduction",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As an Application Developer, you will lead IBM into the future by translating system requirements into the design and development of customized systems in an agile environment. The success of IBM is in your hands as you transform vital business needs into code and drive innovation. Your work will power IBM and its clients globally, collaborating and integrating code into enterprise systems. You will have access to the latest education, tools and technology, and a limitless career path with the world’s technology leader. Come to IBM and make a global impact!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Role and Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your day in the role will include...",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Envision how people experience products and bring that vision to life in a way that feels inspired, refined and magical",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Take on complex tasks and transform them into intuitive, accessible and easy-to-use designs for billions of customers around the world",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Collaborate with researchers, engineers and product managers throughout design process - from creating research protocols, personas, scenarios, information architecture and wireframes to building user interface prototypes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At each stage, anticipate what our users need, advocate for them and ensure that the final product surprises and delights them.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will come with...",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Min of 3+ years of experience in IOS app development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will use your expertise in application development to evaluate and select development methods, processes, standard methodologies and tools",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How we’ll help you grow...",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll have access to all the technical and management training courses to grow your expertise.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’ll learn directly from guide developers in the field; our team loves to mentor.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have the opportunity to work in many different areas to identify what really excites you",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Technical and Professional Expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2+ years’ experience developing software in Objective-C, Java, C, C++, or C#",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2+ years Object Oriented programming experience or equivalent education",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in iterative software development environments (Agile, Kanban)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with Test-Driven Development, Continuous Integration and other Agile practices",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good experience in using Apple's XCode for software development",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in standard debugging techniques such as logging, LLDB, and/or Instruments to localize and correct software defects.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of the challenges related to mobile development including battery and radio usage as well as CPU and memory constraints.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of common design patterns including Model-View-Controller.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Hands on experience using smartphones and/or tablets preferably iPhone and/or iPad.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong understanding of ARC as it relates to iOS Memory Management, including the concepts of strong vs weak.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Preferred Technical and Professional Expertise",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to design/develop/support new/existing apps, and perform unit testing and integration testing",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About Business Unit",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IBM Services is a team of business, strategy and technology consultants that design, build, and run foundational systems and services that is the backbone of the world's economy. IBM Services partners with the world's leading companies in over 170 countries to build smarter business by reimagining and reinventing through technology, with its outcome-focused methodologies, industry-leading portfolio and world class research and operations expertise leading to results-driven innovation and enduring excellence.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Your Life @ IBM",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What matters to you when you’re looking for your next career challenge?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Maybe you want to get involved in work that really changes the world. What about somewhere with incredible and diverse career and development opportunities – where you can truly discover your passion? Are you looking for a culture of openness, collaboration and trust – where everyone has a voice? What about all of these? If so, then IBM could be your next career challenge. Join us, not to do something better, but to attempt things you never thought possible.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Impact. Inclusion. Infinite Experiences. Do your best work ever.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IBM’s greatest invention is the IBMer. We believe that progress is made through progressive thinking, progressive leadership, progressive policy and progressive action. IBMers believe that the application of intelligence, reason and science can improve business, society and the human condition. Restlessly reinventing since 1911, we are the largest technology and consulting employer in the world, with more than 380,000 IBMers serving clients in 170 countries",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Location Statement",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "For additional information about location requirements, please discuss with the recruiter following submission of your application.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Being You @ IBM",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IBM is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, pregnancy, disability, age, veteran status, or other characteristics. IBM is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "If you are a current Motorola Solutions employee, please click this link to apply through your Workday account.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Company Overview",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Motorola Solutions, we create technologies our customers refer to as their lifeline. Our technology platforms in communications, software, video and services help our customers work safely and more efficiently. Whether it’s helping firefighters see through smoke, enabling police officers to see around street corners, or reliably keeping the lights on in homes and businesses around the world, our work supports those who put their lives on the line to keep us safe. Bring your passion, potential and talents to Motorola Solutions, and help us usher in a new era in public safety and security.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
