            "utterance": "We are looking for highly motivated Machine Learning Engineer who can help us to generate usefule insights from hightly volatiled data of Finance, Healthcare, Real Estate etc. One should be quick learner to build machine-learning solutions to communicate with complex data to make future decisions.",
