          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Spark.Live is the platform that has pioneered the marketplace of live online services, and has been one of the fastest growing in recent times. Spark.Live was a category third place holder in #AatmanirbharApp challenge organized by Startup India initiative recently. Based out of Bangalore, India, the company is funded by marquee investors, and led by a team of veteran entrepreneurs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Spark.Live technology stack combines android native app, platform technologies, vernacular tech, speech to text, video / content creation, video calling, AI/ML, payment processes, and much more. A smart engineer would be able to dive into multiple cutting edge areas of tech, and build the platform for a large audience that it currently serves.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
