            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Working knowledge of TCP/IP, IPSEC, Syslog, HTTP(S), SSH, SCP, DHCP, DNS, RDP, LDAP, SMTP protocols is a must. Experience with source and destination NAT is also a must",
