            "utterance": "\\* CI/CD experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "\\* Experience building highly scalable, distributed, and fault-tolerant cloud-native applications",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "\\* Ability to write clean, modular, reusable code (using design patterns) and experience with unit-test driven approach to development",
