          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "iOS Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Y Media Labs is a creative technology company that helps brands re-imagine their customer experiences. Our mission is to export the Silicon Valley mindset to the rest of the world.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We create digital products with purpose that have a lasting impact on users' lives and clients' businesses. We are a team of dreamers and doers united by a simple idea: If we make a difference for your customers, we will make a difference for your business too. And it works. Since 2009, we have led early-stage startups and top-tier brands to \"wow\" their customers with best-in-class digital products and experiences. The Wall Street Journal calls us “YML is one of the most innovative companies in Silicon Valley.”",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Through next-generation technologies and world-class design, we help brands like Apple, PayPal, L'Oreal, Home Depot, Kaiser Permanente, State Farm, First Republic Bank etc develop solutions that drive major business outcomes. Founded in 2009, Y Media Labs is headquartered in Silicon Valley with four offices worldwide including Atlanta, Indianapolis, Bangalore & Sao Paulo.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We came of age with the invention of the app store. We have mobile in our DNA. We create solutions across the digital ecosystem. Unlike agencies who are born desktop, we are deeply connected to how consumer perception has shifted thanks to the mobile lifestyle. We have built and launched 207 products, delighted over 407 million users, built over 200+ apps, work with 30 Fortune 500 clients, been responsible for over 400 billion transactions through our work and generated over $200 billion in transactions for our clients, and been featured on the app store over 700+ times!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Portfolio of our work can be found @ ymedialabs.com/work",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Live look into our engineering team @ medium.com/ymedialabs-innovation • Live look into our design team @ dribbble.com/ymedialabs",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our team in Bangalore is close to 180 strong, and we are growing in a variety of ways. Our goals include a culture of excellence and we are looking to transform the team to be one of the best tech teams in Bangalore.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking to hire multiple iOS Engineers at different levels to help us code the world class apps we are creating. If you are a mobile engineer looking to build apps that will be used by millions of consumers worldwide, build apps for brands that you can be proud to show to your family and friends – you need to join us!",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Key Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Design and build advanced high-quality applications for the iOS platform • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of the applications • Code reviews, automated unit testing, documentation for any code you write • Deal with ambiguity and work in a rapidly evolving environment, with time-sensitive projects • Deadlines matter to us. Plan your work and meet your deadlines, while maintaining code quality.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Get involved in client interactions and gathering project requirements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Lead product initiatives and work on next generation prototypes",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Work with other engineers, product management, QA, and operations teams to develop and meet functional and non-functional requirements",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Work in an environment of agile, test-driven fast feedback cycle (continuous integration, unit, functional, integration and acceptance testing)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Learn and adapt to new technologies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Bring new ideas and technologies to the team that can improve the product or process. • Depending on your level of skills and maturity (not seniority), mentor other engineers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What we are looking for",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Strong foundation in Computer Science fundamentals like data structures and algorithms, and software engineering principles",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Passionate about creating great code",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Proficient with Swift and/or Objective-C.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Understanding of end to end mobile development life cycle",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with latest iOS frameworks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with databases like Realm, Coredata etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with third-party libraries and Cocoapods",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with memory management and caching mechanisms",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Solid Understanding of Apple’s design principles and interface guidelines. • Experience with performance and memory tuning with tools such as Instruments • Experience coding with RESTful APIs to connect iOS applications to back-end services. • Great team player who works well in collaborative situations",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with Android app development is a major plus. Experience with cross-platform tools would be an advantage",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Experience with tools like Git, Jira, Basecamp, BitBucket, Azure DevOps would be an advantage.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Good to have experience working with IOT projects, Bluetooth technologies • Working knowledge of the general mobile landscape, architectures, trends & emerging technologies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Active Open Source, GitHub or Stack Overflow contribution will be a big plus • Published personal apps in play store will be an added advantage",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work from Home Related",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Given the current situation it is expected that working from home for extended periods is a reality that continues for many months. You must be able to fulfil the following requirements: • You must have a high-speed broadband connection and must be able to provide evidence of it • You must have a proper working environment at home, like a desk, chair and any other required infrastructure",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• You must be able to and willing to attend video calls as part of your workday Job Perks",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• Awesome work environment and opportunity to work with great minds • Work in fun teams on projects that impacts millions of people",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "• 100% reimbursement for all job/growth related courses you complete in Udemy • 24x7 stocked pantry with snacks and Coffee/Tea. Highly subsidized lunch.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Software Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In a constantly changing world, we work together with our people, clients and communities to enable them to fulfill their potential to do great things. We believe that by bringing everyone together, we can solve problems using innovative technology that can create a world that is sustainable and secure. At NTT, we encourage you to remain continuously curious, as that is what keeps you fast, flexible and relevant. No two days will be the same but that is what will help you grow and realize your full potential.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The power is in your hands to do great things. Its time to lead the change, be the authentic you, to solve difficult challenges, to set the pace of change and to unleash your potential.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Want to be a part of our team?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
