          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the team",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The machine learning team is a self-contained team of 9 people responsible for building models and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "services that support key workflows for IDfy.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our models are gating criteria for these workflows and as such are expected to perform accurately and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "quickly. We use a mix of conventional and hand-crafted deep learning models.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The team comes from diverse backgrounds and experiences. We have ex-bankers, startup founders,",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "IIT-ians, and more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We work directly with business and product teams to craft solutions for our customers. We know that we are,",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "and function as a platform and not a services company.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience Range:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "1 - 3 years",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Educational Qualifications:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Any graduation,",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be working on all aspects of a production machine learning system. You will be acquiring data, training and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "building models, deploying models, building API services for exposing these models, maintaining them in",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "production, and more.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work on performance tuning of models",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "From time to time work on support and debugging of these production systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work on researching the latest technology in the areas of our interest and applying it to build newer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "products and enhancement of the existing platform.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Building workflows for training and production systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Contribute to documentation",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Skills Required :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Python, Computer Vision,",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Candidate Attributes :",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are an early-career machine learning engineer (or data scientist). Our ideal candidate is",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "someone with 1-3 years of experience in data science.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have a good understanding of Python and Scikit-learn, Tensorflow, or Pytorch. Our systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "are built with these tools/language and we expect a strong base in these.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are proficient at exploratory analysis and know which model to use in most scenarios",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You should have worked on framing and solving problems with the application of machine learning or",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "deep learning models.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have some experience in building and delivering complete or part AI solutions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You appreciate that the role of the Machine Learning engineer is not only modeling, but also building",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "product solutions and you strive towards this.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Enthusiasm and drive to learn and assimilate the state of art research. A lot of what we are building will",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "require innovative approaches using newly researched models and applications.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Good to Have",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of and experience in computer vision. While a large part of our work revolves around computer",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "vision, we believe this is something you can learn on the job.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We build our own services, hence we would want you to have some knowledge of writing APIs.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our stack also includes languages like Ruby, Go, and Elixir. We would love it if you know any of these or",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "take an interest in functional programming.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Knowledge of and experience in ML Ops and tooling would be a welcome addition. We use Docker and",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Kubernetes for deploying our services.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
