            "utterance": "DevOps Engineer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Vertafore is a leading technology company whose innovative software solution are advancing the insurance industry. Our suite of products provides solutions to our customers that help them better manage their business, boost their productivity and efficiencies, and lower costs while strengthening relationships.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our mission is to move InsurTech forward by putting people at the heart of the industry. We are leading the way with product innovation, technology partnerships, and focusing on customer success.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our fast-paced and collaborative environment inspires us to create, think, and challenge each other in ways that make our solutions and our teams better.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are headquartered in Denver, Colorado, with offices across the U.S., Canada, and India.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "JOB DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Does building out a top-tier DevOps team, and everything that comes with it, sound intriguing?",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "DevOps senior software engineer/team lead embedded in an energetic DevOps agile team. Our DevOps teams are tightly coupled and integrated with the culture, tools, practices and patterns of the rest of our software engineering organization. They not only “keep the lights on” for our systems and networks, but also empower our other development teams with cutting edge tools and capabilities to bring Vertafore products to market as quickly as possible. All of this will be accomplished with cutting edge, lean-agile, software development methodologies.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Core Requirements and Responsibilities:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Essential job functions included but are not limited to the following:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will lead the team in building out our continuous delivery infrastructure and processes for all our products utilizing state of the art technologies. You will be hands on leading the architecture and design of the frameworks for the automated continuous deployment of application code, the operational and security monitoring and care of the infrastructure and software platforms. You and your team will serve as the liaison between the agile development teams, SaaS operations, and external cloud providers for deployment, operational efficiency, security, and business continuity.",
