          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Java Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About the Firm",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Aperio Group, our strategies are designed to put our clients’ and their clients’ interests at the center of our investment advice; to minimize costs and taxes; and to incorporate each client’s unique environmental, social, and governance (ESG) preferences. We are a purposefully growing quantitative/index-tracking investment management firm specializing in managing customized equity portfolios tax efficiently.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We recognize that our competitive advantage starts with our people and our culture. At Aperio, we work hard and move quickly as a well-coordinated, collaborative team whose exceptional people are focused on providing extraordinary client service. Our firm seeks to build a workforce that is as diverse in experience, perspective, and culture as the clients with whom we aspire to work. We are looking to add amazing people to our team who will bring diversity across many lines, including race, ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, age, marital/family status, disability, gender identity, sex, and country of origin.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our headquarters is in Sausalito, California, only one block from the beautiful harbor. It’s a short, 20-minute drive from much of San Francisco. We are looking for talented individuals in the San Francisco Bay Area as well as Nationwide as a remote opportunity. If not local, when travel is permitted, team members are expected to visit the office on a periodic basis for training and work with the core onsite team. If you are looking for an opportunity to grow and contribute in a fun, industry-disruptive, fast-paced environment, Aperio is the place for you.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "APERIO GROUP, LLC IS COMMITTED TO ATTRACTING, RETAINING, ENGAGING, AND DEVELOPING A POOL OF TALENT THAT IS DIVERSE ALONG MANY DIMENSIONS. WE SEEK TO LEVERAGE THESE DIVERSE EXPERIENCES, BACKGROUNDS, AND VIEWPOINTS TO BEST SERVE THE NEEDS OF OUR CLIENTS.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Position Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "The purpose of this role is to serve as a full stack software developer. The focus of the role is developing web applications and working on other components of Aperio’s software systems. Our web applications are built using Django, so you can expect a lot of Python and JavaScript programming. Aperio practices agile software development and works in two-week sprints. Therefore, this role will work closely with all other members of the Aperio technology team as well as members of our project management team and end users.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Duties and Responsibilities",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide consistent improvements to Aperio’s codebase and choice of third-party enterprise software components",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Write code that is easily understood and maintainable by other team members",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Keep up to date with developments in technologies Aperio is using",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Use Git (and a flavor of GitFlow) to keep track of software versions",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Contribute to overall application design, from the way applications interact with users to the way data is stored in the database",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Continuously improve Aperio’s CI/CD practices",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Perform other duties as assigned",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Required Skills/Experience",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Five-plus years’ experience in a similar role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Solid knowledge of programming fundamentals—algorithms, data structures, design patterns, and paradigms",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Advanced knowledge of web development, with a deep understanding of the JavaScript ecosystem",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Seasoned Python background or related experience with modern object-oriented languages (Java, Scala, etc.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Facility with building web applications and integrating them with other software systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience in an Amazon Web Services (AWS) ecosystem",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with relational databases",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong written and verbal communication skills",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to communicate and work effectively, supporting various business departments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Ability to work in fast-paced interdisciplinary environment",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Visa sponsorship is not available for this position.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "California Residents: The California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) requires us to inform job applicants about the categories of information Aperio collects about you and the purposes for which Aperio will use your information. For personal information subject to the CCPA, please see this Privacy Notice, which contains required disclosures and details information that we collect as a part of our job application process.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Applicants: Please be aware and cautious about scams and requests for information from sources claiming to be affiliated with or working on behalf of Aperio Group. Be suspicious of anyone contacting you from an email domain other than “aperiogroup.com” or “app.bamboohr.com”, or calling you about a job opportunity if you have not sent a resume to us. We will never ask for personal or background check information directly over email or the telephone before providing a formal job offer, and we only use secure methods to request and receive such information. If you are concerned about the legitimacy of a communication or request, we suggest that you call our main line (415) 339-4300 to verify.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
