          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "COMPANY DESCRIPTION",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP started in 1972 as a team of five colleagues with a desire to do something new. Together, they changed enterprise software and reinvented how business was done. Today, as a market leader in enterprise application software, we remain true to our roots. That’s why we engineer solutions to fuel innovation, foster equality and spread opportunity for our employees and customers across borders and cultures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "SAP values the entrepreneurial spirit, fostering creativity and building lasting relationships with our employees. We know that a diverse and inclusive workforce keeps us competitive and provides opportunities for all. We believe that together we can transform industries, grow economics, lift up societies and sustain our environment. Because it’s the best-run businesses that make the world run better and improve people’s lives.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As the leading cloud-based HCM Suite, SAP SuccessFactors helps more than 6,500 customers, and 50 million cloud application subscribers, across more than 60 industries in over 177 countries tap into this heartbeat.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsible for design and implementation of Secure and Scalable InfrastructureResponsible for the effective and efficient delivery of customer environments in Cloud of respective product lines and to ensure the delivery according to defined Service Level Agreements.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Define future automation strategy and model , ensure smooth operations and maximize uptime.Definition of operations model/operational processes and proceduresEnsure excellent quality and maintain high standards in all processes listed in the relevant process map Build automated frameworks and tools improve system's observability, availability, reliability, performance/latency, monitoring, emergency responseBuild and maintain CI/CD pipelines across multiple cloud platformsSetting up alerts and monitoring for system infrastructurePractice sustainable incident response as well as participate in peer reviews and blameless postmortemsDemonstrated virtualization and global infrastructure, load balancing, networking, security and operations",
            "intent": "job_description"
