            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are Storyteq. Since 2017, we help creative teams to take out repetitive work in their production process and help brands to be more relevant in their (video) marketing. We do this through our state-of-the-art creative automation platform, which uses data to automatically adapt visual assets. The company consists of 25+ dedicated people working together to build a great product and deliver a smooth experience for companies such as Heineken, Netflix, and Ahold.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
