            "utterance": "Company Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Over the last twenty years, MarketAxess has completely revolutionized the fixed-income market by creating a single platform using proprietary technology that connects the world’s most influential financial institutions. Today, more than 1,700 institutional investors and broker-dealer firms rely on us to bring them accurate market data to assist with their trading decisions, connectivity solutions that facilitate straight-through processing and technology services to optimize trading environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a Core Java/Applications Developer, you will work closely with your team to design and implement new features and products. You will learn the fixed-income market allowing you to fully understand the “big picture” of not only what you are developing, but why and how it benefits our customers. At the same time, you will be challenged and pushed out of your comfort zone, by learning new and exciting technologies that we want to implement here at MarketAxess. Above all, you will be empowered by having a voice within your Scrum team as well as within MarketAxess as a whole.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What You’ll do",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design and enhance the Leading Global Fixed Income e-trading platform for institutional investors",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be part of a scrum team comprised of skilled technology professionals with the goal to revolutionize the credit and corporate bond markets",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Innovate and transform business ideas into highly utilized features and services for our customers",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Utilize industry standard technologies including: Java, AWS, Kafka, Oracle, React, Redis Spring Boot and others",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Implement and support products/initiatives from infancy to maturity",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop and design APIs in a microservices and/or event-driven architecture in the cloud",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What You Bring to the Table",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "4+ years of enterprise software development using Java",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Strong knowledge of object-oriented design patterns and multi-threading programming",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Familiarity with streaming technologies such as Kafka/Redis etc.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with microservices using Spring/Spring Boot (or ideally migrating from the monolith to microservices)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proven experience using react or angular",
            "intent": "job_description"
