          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Django Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "TELECOMMUTE LOCATION: Remote, New York, United States",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a Senior Web Engineer - Backend with in-depth working knowledge of the Django framework to join our growing team. Our engineers come from major tech companies such as Amazon and Facebook and many other companies with strong software disciplines. We take pride in our mission to build great advertising software.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Our tech stack is always evolving to meet the challenges of the massive scale of transactions on which we operate. To manage the firehose of data coming in, we explore complex tradeoffs and carefully architect high performance distributed systems. Those in turn require elegant and thoughtfully designed interfaces to make the systems accessible to both our team and our customers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Beeswax offers multiple solutions to our customers with digital advertising needs. Many customers rely heavily on our custom built UI and API in their daily workflow. The mission of the App team is to bring a streamlined experience for marketers to target the right audience and achieve satisfying results. Our contribution is highly visible and impactful to end-users. With short feedback loops, features are prioritized and built to create the most value for our customers. As a senior Django/Python engineer, you will guide the development of our API with some cutting edge technologies. If you enjoy architecting scalable systems and building impactful applications with other accomplished engineers, keep reading.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Django MySQL Python REST API Web Development Web Application Development Web UI Design Communication Skills Written Communication Skill",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities and Duties",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "What You'll Be Doing:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You'll guide major architectural changes as we scale to improve our engineering velocity",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Be the \"Go-to\" for all things Django, we hire tech agnostic so having a resident expert in this framework is essential to the success of our team going forward.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work with engineers, product managers, designers and data scientists to evolve these services to provide new experiences for our customers and meet our ever-growing scale",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You will mentor other engineers on architecture and process",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work on our public REST API that supports both our customers and our own JS UI",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Do fun tasks like reviewing code, writing design docs and closing JIRA tickets",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You'll report to our Director of Web engineering",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Who You Are:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "5+ years of web engineering experience at strong software companies",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with building and operating a modern REST API (ie. Swagger, monitoring, rate limiting, authentication, etc.)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A solid understanding of relational databases (we use Amazon Aurora MySQL)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A solid understanding of modern operational processes and concerns for web applications (deployment, provisioning, monitoring)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
