            "utterance": "We are seeking a skilled candidate who has solid development experience and is well established with the below technical areas. Are you passionate and interested in helping to build a Product Development department? Are you ready to be directly involved in the creation of new products on a daily basis, in addition to being a key person in coaching, and helping to create our best practices around the development of software? Are you personable and good at communicating your opinions clearly, completely, passionately? Are you looking for a fast-paced, collaborative environment? This could be the position for you! We expect the average candidate for this position to be 5-10 years into their career.",
