          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Support.com is looking to hire a DevOps Engineer who will be responsible for maintaining the health and availability of Platform as a Service (PaaS), Software as a Service (SaaS), and Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offerings.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "At Support.com we believe life is better when technology does what it's supposed to do. We want to make that happen for everyone by enabling dramatically better support for a connected world. Our offerings change the way technology support is built into products, managed and delivered. Consider working with us on our full-service support environment (get.support.com) and the backend at Support.com Cloud, our next-generation SaaS solution for technical support, delivering on these core values:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Reducing customer effort through advanced tools embeddable in mobile and web apps. We embed in customer's support sites as well as our own full-service support offering.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Optimizing the interaction of support agents with customers via intelligent, contextual guidance; data-driven, step-by-step solutions; and modern visual remote tools",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Providing actionable insights into support practices and real-world product performance through support interaction analytics and data from external systems",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Building technology when it's within our core differentiation, or integrate other software when outside that mission",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Join us as a DevOps Engineer responsible for maintaining the health and availability of Platform as a Service (PaaS), Software as a Service (SaaS), and Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offerings. We are seeking a dynamic individual with broad, hands-on technical experience in a highly technical environment. This role is heavily focused on scripting and automation of routine tasks to streamline the management of all facets of our environment. To succeed in this role would generally require that a candidate has a minimum of 5 years' experience working in an enterprise IT environment in a senior system administrator role, ideally supporting more than 150 users.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities :-",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a member of the DevOps Team, the DevOps Engineer is expected to work with Dev, QA and Production Operations to serve as a technical SME responsible for the IT Infrastructure and Platform as a Service offerings.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Design, build and execute against client's Software as a Service (SaaS), Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) and Platform as a Service (PaaS) offerings",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Integrate and help define requirements for client's Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offering",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Automate all aspects of infrastructure and platform services",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Create the design, implementation, and ongoing management of systems that deliver against strict requirements for functionality, scalability, performance, and reliability.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Serve as a senior technical escalation point for critical pre-production issues and drives escalation/resolution of problems into Development, QA, and Operations teams.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Collaborate with development to design in-house monitoring tools/software for managing the SCM and Development Operations environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Adopt, customize and implement best practice DevOps policies and DevOps procedures.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Provide senior management with metrics and other reporting materials for the executive team.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work closely with strategic planning groups to provide future technologies direction that fits executive vision.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develop and define processes and procedures to proactively manage all pre-production and production environments.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Work with multiple in-house and external Software Configuration Management (SCM) teams to assist in new architectural needs and optimize existing environments to improve workflow and productivity.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Helps to build, automate and monitor our infrastructure",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Accelerates Engineering Team productivity by creating scripts, tools, utilities or code to address issues with new projects and existing operational procedures",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Develops codes, builds systems and tools to automate deployments and operations tasks more effectively and consistently",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Essential Skills :-",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "5 years of senior level server administration experience in a large-scale production environment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "3 years cloud administration experience in development and production environments",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
