          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Django Developer",
            "intent": "job_title"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "EngineerBabu is a product company, We build products for Startups. Our Portfolio includes MIT and Harvard Innovation Labs Startups. We are a heart-driven company and not a mind-driven company, so anyone joining needs to be able to speak from your heart and connect with people. We have always been a people-first organization. You can find recent updates here: https://www.linkedin.com/in/aditichaurasia/detail/recent-activity/shares/",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "EngineerBabu Linkedin and Youtube channel.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’ve gotten by on strength of the product, the cult of personality, a unique point of view, running against the wind, and incredibly generous word-of-mouth promotion from our customers. We’re fortunate that it’s been working. 5 profitable years in business is the proof. We’re naturally proud of that",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Job Description",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We are looking for a full stack developer to produce scalable software solutions. You’ll be part of a cross-functional team that’s responsible for the full software development life cycle, from conception to deployment.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "As a full stack developer, you should be comfortable around both front-end and back-end coding languages, development frameworks and third-party libraries. You should also be a team player with a knack for visual design and utility.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Responsibilities for the Role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You love how technology can change people's lives for the better",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You like working with and scaling relational databases",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You care about how the clothing industry affects the lives of people, and want to be apart of a better future.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You have strong skills and experiences with libraries like Django, Django REST Framework, Celery or equivalents in your language of choice",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You understand and like working with Heroku",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You are self-motivated and an optimist at heart",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Skills Required for the Role",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "2+ years' experience working with a Javascript framework, preferably React",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "In-depth understanding of Javascript, the DOM, and relevant concepts",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Proficiency with browser based debugging and performance testing",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Understanding of progressive web apps",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience with a testing framework (Jest/Mocha)",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience using Git",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "About You:-",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "You’re creative. You’re organized. You’re experienced. You’ve done this before. You want to do it again. You absolutely want to do it for us. We value people who can take a stand yet commit even when they disagree. We’ll often subject ideas to rigorous debate, so you’ll need to stand up for what you believe, but we remember that we’re here for the same purpose: to do good work together.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Yes, you’ll need to learn how we work at EngineerBabu, but we’re also looking for someone to teach us how to work.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "We’re not looking for a superhero who thinks sheer hours = good work. Excess doesn’t impress us – creativity and efficiency do. You’ll have 8 hours a day to work, and, we hope, at least 8 hours a night to sleep. What you do with the other 8 is up to you, never to us. You’ll report directly to the Project Managers.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "How to Apply:-",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Introduce yourself to us as a colleague. Show us your future here! We value great writers, so be yourself, be creative, and take your time with the application. There’s no prize for being the first to submit! Stock cover letters won’t do. Tell us why you want this job. Tell us about:",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why you decided to work in Fullstack domain.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Why you want to work at EngineerBabu and not somewhere else.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "A time you taught yourself a new skill to complete a job or project.",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Tell us about yourself and the kind of person you are",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Experience Required",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Mid-Senior level",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
            "domain": "default",
            "utterance": "Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India",
            "intent": "job_description"
          },
          {
