      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Version Control - GIT"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong understanding of design principles and design patterns is a must."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Should be able to set standards, define templates etc. to promote reusability and establish standards."
      ],
      [
