        "Hands on for critical parts of development, testing, deployment, and production"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "automation and tools to ensure everything is built according to the best practices"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Carry out your on-call duties as part of a critical team handling our cloud"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "infrastructure performance and availability"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Mentor other engineers, define our technical culture and help build a fast-growing"
      ],
