        "en",
        "KlearNow is an exciting new company providing an innovative state of the art solutions that brings the global supply chain into the digital age. KlearNow is funded by serial entrepreneurs with proven track record and sizable exits already. We are now building our initial team post the founders and are looking for exceptional talent to join us."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Get in on the ground floor of a startup company with a new product offering that is changing the way technology is leveraged in the global supply chain. We are looking for is an experienced DevOps engineer with a passion for systems automation. You will be responsible for managing innovation in our software release processes, increase the robustness and automation. In this role, you will help bring significant gains to how we build and deploy software, all towards the end- goal of achieving releases that are swift, predictable and of the highest quality."
      ],
