        "en",
        "Vista Equity Partners is the world's leading private equity firm for Enterprise Software and recently invested $1.5B in the Reliance Jio Digital Platform. As part of the Vista portfolio, Integral Ad Science (IAS) is a NYC-headquartered global technology and data company that builds verification, optimization, and analytics solutions for the advertising industry. We are looking for a Java Software Engineer to join our new and fast-growing R&D team in Pune. If you are excited by technology that has the power to handle hundreds of thousands of transactions per second; collect tens of billions of events each day; and evaluate thousands of data-points in real-time all while responding in just a few milliseconds, then IAS is the place for you!"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "As a Software Engineer you will build and expand upon the IAS reporting framework and UI for IAS' analytics and reporting software products. You will integrate reports and dashboards into the IAS UI platform and implement critical features in our custom report builder tool using state of the art technologies and tools."
