        "en",
        "Ensuring on-time and quality deliveries in train model across different product lines in parallel."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Exhibit cross-functional knowledge to monitor efficiency of the systems/process in the entire software development and supply chain"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strategic engagement with Product Management team and Customer facing teams to understand the product opportunities and influence the roadmaps"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Handle customer escalations and provide swift actions and satisfactory experience to the customers"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Ability to create goals, facilitate cascade through first line management, provide clarity & priority of the same in line with organization goals"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong written and verbal communication skills to be able to conduct effective group/stakeholder meetings"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong interpersonal strengths to understand the strength of the team, conflict management work towards excellence"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Effective talent management within the group, and setting up good hiring and training plans"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Working across the group with peers for shared goals"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Effective budget utilization within the group"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Good leadership and negotiation skills to deal with ambiguities and challenging interactions"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Innovative thought process in problem solving"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Develop & manage relationships through the organization to re-inforce culture of collaboration"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Keep abreast of latest technologies, best practice and apply relevant to the org,"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Champion best practices, lead the change in adoption of new process / technology and take corrective actions where required."
      ],
