        "en",
        "Autodesk is seeking to hire a passionate Intern Software Engineer for our team in Kilsyth with the option to work from home. As an Intern Software Engineer, you will help develop the framework for the next generation of simulation tools working with our amazing team of developers, scientists, and leading customers as well as agile development and user research methodologies. You will help shape the next generation of simulation and engineering tools with the Simulation R&D team. You will partner with researchers, interaction visual designers, and other software engineers to help define and deliver new cloud based workflows, test new concepts and assist in building prototypes."
