        "en",
        "· Manage and lead efforts that can involve multiple teams and deliver solutions with impact across the R&C organization"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Be a trusted advisor to R&C customers and engage on projects with high degrees of complexity and business criticality."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Manage requirements, design, build and rollout solutions."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Lead initiatives with multiple stakeholders and manage the complexity of competing needs and timelines."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Support customers through reporting and compliance cycles, mentoring, troubleshooting and running processes as needed."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Understand the solutions we have today, applying them where appropriate and inventing new capabilities when needed."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Own multiple processes and/or parts of our technology toolset, providing subject matter expertise and mentorship"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Listen to customers across the organization and expand our toolset to the benefit of all, avoiding point solutions."
      ],
