      [
        "en",
        "About Uline"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Uline is the leading distributor of shipping, industrial and packaging materials to businesses throughout North America. We're a family-owned company whose incredible service, huge inventory and quality products fuel our ongoing expansion and growth. We offer same-day shipping on over 37,500 products in our 812-page catalog and on our state-of-the-art e-commerce website."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Uline provides the essential supplies needed to keep organizations operational and productive. To protect the health and safety of our employees, we have modified our normal operating policies in response to COVID-19."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Each resume submitted gets individually reviewed by our team and retained for 24 months in case a great opportunity opens for you to join our Uline family."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Unfortunately, Uline is unable to offer US work sponsorship at this time."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "EEO/AA Employer/Vet/Disabled"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Machine Learning"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Johnson & Johnson Technology is recruiting for Machine Learning Engineer, Consumer Health R&D Experience. We are offering this position in Mumbai, India. You may need to travel to global business and development centers in the US, Europe, 15% of the time based on active product development."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "With $81.6 billion in 2018 sales, JNJ the world's most comprehensive and broadly-based health care company. Our products and services span the consumer, pharmaceutical, and medical devices markets. We are more 125,000 employees operating over 250 operating companies worldwide. Our products touch the lives of over a billion people throughout the world every single day."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are steadfast in our pursuit to help people live healthier, happier lives. Innovation is at the heart of our organization and embedded in all we do. It fuels our discovery and development of new products and extends to our collaborations, education and community efforts to bring new solutions to those in need. We are seeking someone with a passion for bridging well-designed technology solutions and the needs of our customer’s daily health journey."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You will play on IT analyst role in crafting Machine Learning Data driven solutions to lead ground-breaking change and accelerate business value. You and your team will work closely with key technology and business partners to apply human-centered design techniques to empathize with users and help design solutions that delight them. You will collaborate with the business to execute experiments with users to validate and further refine those problems and solutions. ML analyst will coordinate and participate in a core team of developers, software engineers and technical software architects to build, Test and Train ML Models with standard CI/CD Pipeline. You will be responsible for advising a team to develop and incubate the solution Minimum Viable Product and, when successful, continue to scale, launch and continually develop that solution to drive higher levels of engagement and participation. You will employ and champion Agile best-practices to accelerate our velocity and deliver solutions. We seek co-workers with a B.S. or equivalent in a technical field with deep technology development experience. We expect experience in analysis, and strategic assessment. We support unique and independent thought and creativity, combined with pragmatic analytical difficulty - to cultivate significant insights that inspire and advise our technical development."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "If you are you looking for a dynamic and creative technology role helping people live more healthy and vibrant lives as part of Johnson & Johnson Consumer Health, this may be the career opportunity to help make it happen. Join us!"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Key Responsibilities:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are a customer centric and integrated team. You will develop a keen understanding of R&D needs and perceptions. Partner closely with solutions teams, and cloud engineers to build innovative product solutions for Product Development, Engineering, Regulatory, Medical and Clinical Affairs, Product Safety, and Laboratories groups on a world-wide basis. You will apply this knowledge to improve key business outcomes."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We love data. You will find opportunities to drive continual improvement, demonstrating both new and existing metrics. We also work in a GxP compliant environment. You will ensure that J&J information assets are appropriately identified, valued, and protected by complying with and making sure all local and worldwide security policies."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are a global team. You will partner with an extended team of both internal and external partners across multiple time-zones to provide outstanding custom development technology solutions. You will regularly provide customer-facing communications and demos related to your products, their budgets, and their value delivery to senior leaders from Technology and R&D organizations."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Qualifications"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Minimum of a Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, or related is required, with a minimum of 6 years of related business experience required."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience and Skills :"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Excellent written and oral communication skills, interpersonal skills, strong negotiating skills, and the ability to motivate in a collaborative environment with exceptional service orientation are all requirements."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Good in Data Structure and Algorithms and Analyze extensive scale data to train ML models and evaluate them with the right metrics."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Proven experience as an ML Lead or similar roles and worked in Python / R and Cloud (AWS, Azure) ML Platforms with CI/CD Pipeline."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Integrate ML components into a fully functional software system."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Provide hands-on ML models, designs, prototypes, and implementations incorporating intelligent software engineering tools and monitoring according to industry best practices Hands on programming to chip in optimal to project work you're doing."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Proficiency in software engineering tools &Ability to document requirements and specifications"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Ability to craft context around key business features and behaviors and present ideas in business-friendly and user-friendly language."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Up to 15% domestic / international travel is required for this position"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience and Skills:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong IT Development background with a proven record of delivering results. Proven Technical leadership, influencing skills, interdependent partnering skills, as well as critical thinking skills required"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience in defining Cloud based API Gateway solution architecture also responsible for leading the technical direction, configuration, project development, and ongoing operations for R&D Application."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Deep understanding of IT and cloud development practices and previous hands-on coding experience required."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Agile development experience, SDLC methodology, Risk management including Security is required"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "The ability to synthesize leadership and partner inputs into decisions, to lead medium to high level of complexity, and to be comfortable operating amongst senior R&D partners is required."
      ],
      [
        "en",
