        "We apply advanced technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Blockchain, AR/VR, Cloud Native and Quantum Physics to solve our customers’ missions in cyber, RF, undersea, interstellar space and everything in between."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Working successfully within a team, the Java Developer will perform software requirements analysis, and participate in the research, design, development and testing of software and tools, to include development of mission critical systems that support an enterprise infrastructure. Your talent will be front and center. It’s your chance to step up to the challenge and prove you’re ready to lead the world."
      ],
