        "What you will do:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "This Senior Full Stack Java Developer role will have a significant impact on the entire SDLC including requirements gathering, design, development, implementation, and maintenance."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Develop high quality, secure, scalable, web-based software in an Agile environment"
