        "iLendingDIRECT is seeking a *.Net Developer* to join our growing team. The .Net Developer will be part of an agile/scrum development team, building and working on enterprise grade software systems on top of the Microsoft .NET development stack. In this crucial role, you will be involved with the design, development, testing, and support of a suite of applications ranging from web applications, windows services, WCF services, and thick-clients which enable our customers to safely operate at peak performance and within the law."
