        "en",
        "If youre happiest in an agile environment, with complex projects to oversee, theres a digital revolution underway in the UK and at CGI you can help shape it. Our teams are bursting with talent and ideas, and are ready to help you deliver transformative digital work for high profile clients."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We need Senior DevOps Engineers to help further grow our digital teams of agile service design specialists within our Central Government Business, to build and deliver user centred services and solutions in partnership with our clients across England and Wales. You must already hold, or be eligible to hold, UK Security Clearance (SC level) to be considered."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Build your career with us."
