        "en",
        "Your future duties and responsibilities"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "As a Senior DevOps Engineer your work will include a multitude interesting projects, learning modern tooling and techniques to facilitate cutting-edge products on a variety of cloud and bare-metal platforms. You will also get opportunities to lead projects as well as to contribute towards process and technology choices that help deliver the best solutions for our clients."
      ],
