        "en",
        "Tivix is a business unit of Kellton Tech, that focused on digital product development. Kellton Tech is a public listed, CMMi Level 5 company that aims to be one of the fastest emerging IT services company in India. Company today has presence in US, EMEA and Asia. We have development centres in Gurgaon, Hyderabad, Europe and the US. We have at present major focus on Digital Transformation, Microsoft Technologies, Enterprise Consumer Mobile Application Solutions and Open Source Solutions. We are also into Internet of Things (IoT), ERP, Big Data and Cloud computing."
