        "en",
        "Our Exciting Opportunity :"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are looking for a Data Scientist that will be responsible for the Development, management, execution and reactive maintenance activities that require a higher level of development. This person shall ensure that the services provided to customers are continuously available and maintaining Service Level Agreement (SLA) performance levels."
