        "en",
        "WHAT MAKES YOU A GOOD FIT FOR THIS ROLE:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong experience in Java 8 or higher, Spring Framework-Core/Boot/MVC, Hibernate/JPA, JMS/ AMQP/ Kafka, JavaScript and Microservices Architecture."
      ],
