      ],
      [
        "en",
        "About Cognizant Digital Engineering: Well-designed software transcends digital technology, going beyond the"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "fulfillment of basic requirements to focus instead on human needs. Within Cognizant Digital Engineering, we"
      ],
