        "that works on mission-critical applications. You have a passion for high-quality, reliable and maintainable code."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You’re comfortable working side by side with product managers, designers, and clients, making decisions"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "together in order to quickly deliver valuable working software to clients and their users. You are agile and"
      ],
      [
