        "Job Description:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "About the team"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "The machine learning team is a self-contained team of 9 people responsible for building models and"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "services that support key workflows for IDfy."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Our models are gating criteria for these workflows and as such are expected to perform accurately and"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "quickly. We use a mix of conventional and hand-crafted deep learning models."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "The team comes from diverse backgrounds and experiences. We have ex-bankers, startup founders,"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "IIT-ians, and more."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We work directly with business and product teams to craft solutions for our customers. We know that we are,"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "and function as a platform and not a services company."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience Range:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "1 - 3 years"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Educational Qualifications:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Any graduation,"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Job Responsibilities:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Be working on all aspects of a production machine learning system. You will be acquiring data, training and"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "building models, deploying models, building API services for exposing these models, maintaining them in"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "production, and more."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Work on performance tuning of models"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "From time to time work on support and debugging of these production systems"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Work on researching the latest technology in the areas of our interest and applying it to build newer"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "products and enhancement of the existing platform."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Building workflows for training and production systems"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Contribute to documentation"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Skills Required :"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Python, Computer Vision,"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Candidate Attributes :"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You are an early-career machine learning engineer (or data scientist). Our ideal candidate is"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "someone with 1-3 years of experience in data science."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You have a good understanding of Python and Scikit-learn, Tensorflow, or Pytorch. Our systems"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "are built with these tools/language and we expect a strong base in these."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You are proficient at exploratory analysis and know which model to use in most scenarios"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You should have worked on framing and solving problems with the application of machine learning or"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "deep learning models."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You have some experience in building and delivering complete or part AI solutions"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "You appreciate that the role of the Machine Learning engineer is not only modeling, but also building"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "product solutions and you strive towards this."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Enthusiasm and drive to learn and assimilate the state of art research. A lot of what we are building will"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "require innovative approaches using newly researched models and applications."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Good to Have"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Knowledge of and experience in computer vision. While a large part of our work revolves around computer"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "vision, we believe this is something you can learn on the job."
      ],
