      [
        "en",
        "We are looking for a Senior Web Engineer - Backend with in-depth working knowledge of the Django framework to join our growing team. Our engineers come from major tech companies such as Amazon and Facebook and many other companies with strong software disciplines. We take pride in our mission to build great advertising software."
