      [
        "en",
        "Our tech stack is always evolving to meet the challenges of the massive scale of transactions on which we operate. To manage the firehose of data coming in, we explore complex tradeoffs and carefully architect high performance distributed systems. Those in turn require elegant and thoughtfully designed interfaces to make the systems accessible to both our team and our customers."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Beeswax offers multiple solutions to our customers with digital advertising needs. Many customers rely heavily on our custom built UI and API in their daily workflow. The mission of the App team is to bring a streamlined experience for marketers to target the right audience and achieve satisfying results. Our contribution is highly visible and impactful to end-users. With short feedback loops, features are prioritized and built to create the most value for our customers. As a senior Django/Python engineer, you will guide the development of our API with some cutting edge technologies. If you enjoy architecting scalable systems and building impactful applications with other accomplished engineers, keep reading."
      ],
