        "Company Description"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "IncubXperts is IT Products and Services company founded in 2016. We focus on building Web solutions for Enterprises and Independent Software Vendors or Product companies. We optimize cloud costs, build migration plan and build or maintain your existing Web/Mobile products."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are a domain agnostic software technology company. Our founders come with an experience of about 20+ years in the software industry. Our primarily work area is Enterprise Web and Mobile solutions that are built on cloud. Azure AI using Cognitive services, Enterprise BOTs are other areas where we have built solutions to help our customers. Using technology that is latest we intend to solve business problems for our customers."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Know More at http://incubxperts.com/"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Job Description"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "An Intern at IncubXperts will be put on “LIVE” project. He/She will be expected to learn in the live environment, build software applications under guidance of leadership that carries multiple years of experience."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Please note that an Internship will be split into 2 phases (3 months + 3 months). Initial 3 months performance will be assessed and if performance is good, internship will extend by additional 3 months. At the end of Internship, suitable candidates will be extended an invitation to join IncubXperts."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Technology/Skills: Angular 2+, .NET Core or .NET MVC, MS SQL Server, Azure (Some experience in these technologies is preferred for Interns but not must)"
