        "en",
        "Additional Information"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "People with ownership grow at IncubXperts. Most of our customers have less or no in house developers. This means a lot of learning opportunities and massive upgrade to the skills every passing year."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Latest technology, many projects – no stagnancy (unlike large companies where one ends up spending multiple years in single project)"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Work with leadership that carries 20 years of exp. Maturity of big company and culture of small company. Grow fast! Since inception, we double our size every year."
      ],
