      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Support.com is looking to hire a DevOps Engineer who will be responsible for maintaining the health and availability of Platform as a Service (PaaS), Software as a Service (SaaS), and Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offerings."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "At Support.com we believe life is better when technology does what it's supposed to do. We want to make that happen for everyone by enabling dramatically better support for a connected world. Our offerings change the way technology support is built into products, managed and delivered. Consider working with us on our full-service support environment (get.support.com) and the backend at Support.com Cloud, our next-generation SaaS solution for technical support, delivering on these core values:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Reducing customer effort through advanced tools embeddable in mobile and web apps. We embed in customer's support sites as well as our own full-service support offering."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Optimizing the interaction of support agents with customers via intelligent, contextual guidance; data-driven, step-by-step solutions; and modern visual remote tools"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Providing actionable insights into support practices and real-world product performance through support interaction analytics and data from external systems"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Building technology when it's within our core differentiation, or integrate other software when outside that mission"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Join us as a DevOps Engineer responsible for maintaining the health and availability of Platform as a Service (PaaS), Software as a Service (SaaS), and Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offerings. We are seeking a dynamic individual with broad, hands-on technical experience in a highly technical environment. This role is heavily focused on scripting and automation of routine tasks to streamline the management of all facets of our environment. To succeed in this role would generally require that a candidate has a minimum of 5 years' experience working in an enterprise IT environment in a senior system administrator role, ideally supporting more than 150 users."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Responsibilities :-"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "As a member of the DevOps Team, the DevOps Engineer is expected to work with Dev, QA and Production Operations to serve as a technical SME responsible for the IT Infrastructure and Platform as a Service offerings."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Design, build and execute against client's Software as a Service (SaaS), Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) and Platform as a Service (PaaS) offerings"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Integrate and help define requirements for client's Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) offering"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Automate all aspects of infrastructure and platform services"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Create the design, implementation, and ongoing management of systems that deliver against strict requirements for functionality, scalability, performance, and reliability."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Serve as a senior technical escalation point for critical pre-production issues and drives escalation/resolution of problems into Development, QA, and Operations teams."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Collaborate with development to design in-house monitoring tools/software for managing the SCM and Development Operations environments."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Adopt, customize and implement best practice DevOps policies and DevOps procedures."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Provide senior management with metrics and other reporting materials for the executive team."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Work closely with strategic planning groups to provide future technologies direction that fits executive vision."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Develop and define processes and procedures to proactively manage all pre-production and production environments."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Work with multiple in-house and external Software Configuration Management (SCM) teams to assist in new architectural needs and optimize existing environments to improve workflow and productivity."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Helps to build, automate and monitor our infrastructure"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Accelerates Engineering Team productivity by creating scripts, tools, utilities or code to address issues with new projects and existing operational procedures"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Develops codes, builds systems and tools to automate deployments and operations tasks more effectively and consistently"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Essential Skills :-"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "5 years of senior level server administration experience in a large-scale production environment."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "3 years cloud administration experience in development and production environments"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong understanding of agile development workflow and process."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong understanding of quality assurance methodologies, workflow, and process."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Deep understanding of centralized (n-tier) and decentralized (microservices) application models."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Proven ability to conceptualize and implement a new architectures/infrastructure based on Business Requirements."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience with deployment of configuration management and automation solutions"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Expertise in building scalable, high performance development and production infrastructure systems"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Ability to rapidly assess, analyze, and resolve complicated issues with little initial information or direction and with varying degrees of ambiguity."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Proficient in scripting and programming languages."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Ability to prioritize and delegate responsibilities for multiple competing priorities in a fast-paced environment."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Excellent verbal and written communication skills."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Ability to work well with people and be both highly motivated and motivating."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Strong presentation and leadership skills."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Additional Skills and Experience Desired :-"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Private & Hybrid Cloud Architectures"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "VMWare ESX (Hypervisor)"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Dev Ops Continuous Integration and Delivery"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Private and Public Cloud experience with many of the following:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "oKubernetes"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "CM Experience Salt is ideal"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Scripting experience in Python, Bash, PowerShell etc."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience programming in C++, Java or .NET"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience in TSQL, PLSQL, etc."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Solid understanding of HTML, HTTP, and other web-focused technologies"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Experience integrating RESTful APIs across multiple technologies"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Basic TCP/IP networking knowledge a plus"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Previous roles in QA or QA Automation a plus"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Education :-"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "A Bachelor's degree in systems engineering, computer science, management information systems, or a related field preferred. For the right candidate, we will consider an equivalent combination of education and work experience."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Current, relevant industry certifications such as MCITP or VCP a plus!"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Support.com is an Equal Opportunity Employer"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Django Developer"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Job Description:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "We are looking for a Python Web Developer responsible for managing the interchange of data between the server and the users. Your primary focus will be the development of all server-side logic, ensuring high performance and responsiveness to requests from the front-end. You will also be responsible for integrating the front-end elements built by your co-workers into the application; therefore, a basic understanding of front-end technologies is necessary as well."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Duties and Responsibilities:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Daily duties for Python developers vary based on the websites, applications, and programs used by the hiring company. However, these main responsibilities are the same across all businesses and industries:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Maintain Existing Programs: Python developers maintain existing programs and apps used by the company, troubleshooting to spot potential problems and ensuring they continue to function smoothly."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Write New Programs: Python developers write new programs and applications to streamline business functions and increase productivity company-wide."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Reprogram Databases: Python developers reprogram existing databases to increase functionality and data capacity."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Manage Online Pages: Python developers streamline web portals by writing new programs in addition to designing and maintaining websites."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Manage Servers: Python developers manage and maintain company servers to keep them functioning efficiently across the network."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Design Marketing Programs: Python developers design programs for marketing campaigns, including promotional emails and web applications."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Create Online Tools: Python developers create digital tools and applications to monitor online traffic and maximize the customer experience on web pages."
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "Skills And Qualifications:"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Expert in Python, with knowledge of at least one Python web framework such as Django, Flask, etc"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Familiarity with some ORM (Object Relational Mapper) libraries"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Able to integrate multiple data sources and databases into one system"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Understanding of the threading limitations of Python, and multi-process architecture"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Good understanding of server-side templating languages Basic understanding of front-end technologies, such as JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Understanding of accessibility and security compliance"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Knowledge of user authentication and authorization between multiple systems, servers, and environments"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Understanding of fundamental design principles behind a scale-able application"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Familiarity with event-driven programming in Python"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Understanding of the differences between multiple delivery platforms, such as mobile vs. desktop, and optimizing output to match the specific platform"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Able to create database schema that represents and support business processes"
      ],
      [
        "en",
        "· Strong unit test and debugging skills"
      ],
